<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LEV" style="id">LAW Lughuru Translation 18/11/2008ted</book>
  <para style="h">Walawi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Wal</para>
  <para style="toc2">Walawi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ichitabu cha Walawi</para>
  <para style="mt1">WALAWI</para>
  <para style="is">Ichilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Walawi china malaghitso gha kutamanila na pfihungo pfa dini ya ghumwande ya Waisiraeli, china iwatambika iwakalile ne sang'ano ya kughasola malaghitso agho na kuwalangulitsa iwanu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Chinu chikulu mne chitabu chino iwo uhenzeluka we Imulungu, na iwanu wake pfawobamighwa kumtamanila na kukala apfo ili kutenda uhabehi wawo naye unoghe.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbuli ngulu itsimanyike mne chitabu chino, atsila tsayatsikemile Yesu laghitso kulu lya kabili, “Umnoghele myagho ka pfawinoghela umwenyegho.” (19.18)</para>
  <para style="iot">Ighali mchitabu</para>
  <para style="io">Ghamalaghitso gha motelo na nambiko 1.1-7, 38</para>
  <para style="io">Kwikighwa wakifu kwa Aruni ne iwanaghe wawe watambika 8.1-10, 20</para>
  <para style="io">Malaghitso gha ukwenzeluka na ukwiha 11.1-15, 33</para>
  <para style="io">Litsuwa lye ukwighongola 16.1-34</para>
  <para style="io">Malaghitso gha ughima mwenzeluka na ukutamanila 17.1-27, 34. Ichitabu cha Walawi.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LEV 1" />
  <para style="s">Ukumlapfila Imulungu tsinambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 1:1" />IMNDEWA hayali kamna Lihema lya ukwitinganila tsakamkema Musa, kamlongela, <verse eid="LEV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 1:2" />“Walongele Waisiraeli apfino, munu yang'abama kumlapfila IMNDEWA mnyama, yamsaghule imnyama ayo kulawa kuna wang'ombe wake, wang'olo wake au wamene wake.”<verse eid="LEV 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 1:3" />“Imunu yang'amlapfa ing'ombe iyobamighwa kulakatsighwa, yamsaghule ing'ombe mmale iyenelele. Yamsole na yakamwike hana ghumlango ghwa Lihema lya ukwitinganila ili yatogholighwe hambele he IMNDEWA. <verse eid="LEV 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 1:4" />Imunu ayo yeke ghumoko ghwake mwitwi mwa imnyama ayo, baho Imulungu katsobokela imnyama iyalapfighwe, naye katsomleghusila imunu ayo nzambi tsake. <verse eid="LEV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 1:5" />Kuya yamsubutule ing'ombe ayo hambele ha IMNDEWA. Nawo iwana wa Aruni wasole idamu ayo wamitse chila ubali wa Matsabahu iili habehi na ghumlango ghwa Lihema Lienzeluke. <verse eid="LEV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 1:6" />Imunu ayo yamuhune imnyama ayo iyolapfighwa yakalakatsighwe na kumghana mahunde. <verse eid="LEV 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 1:7" />Kuya iwana wa Aruni watsotsika tsingodi mna matsabahu na kubwina ghumoto. <verse eid="LEV 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 1:8" />Baho iwana wa Aruni watsosola ghamahunde agho ghe nyama, litwi na ghamapfuta, na ukwika mna tsingodi itsikwaka itsili mna matsabahu. <verse eid="LEV 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 1:9" />Lekeni imunu ayo yahopfughe usapi na maghondi gha imnyama kwa ghamatsi. Mtambika yumwe katsoilakatsa inyama yose mna matsabahu ka nambiko ya kulakatsighwa. Inyama ayo iilakatsighwa yomnung'ila ghoya IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="LEV 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 1:10" />“Ka imnyama iyomlapfa yakalakatsighwe kolawa mna wang'olo au wamene, yasaghule ing'unzu au mvulati iyenele. <verse eid="LEV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 1:11" />Yamsubutulile ubali wa kasikazini wa matsabahu, hambele he IMNDEWA Imulungu, nawo iwana wa Aruni wamitse idamu ikingighwe mna matsabahu chila ubali. <verse eid="LEV 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 1:12" />Kuya imunu ayo yamghane mahunde, kuya yasole litwi lyake na mapfuta ghake, na mtambika yumwe yapfike mna ghumoto mna matsabahu. <verse eid="LEV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 1:13" />Lekeni yahopfughe usapi na maghondi ghake gha kuchughu kwa ghamatsi. Baho Mtambika yumwe katsoilakatsa inyama yose mna imatsabahu. Inyama ayo iilakatsighwa mna ghumoto yomnung'ila ghoya na yomnogheletsa IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="LEV 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 1:14" />“Imunu yang'amlapfila Imulungu pfideghe, yaghale tetele au njiwa. <verse eid="LEV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 1:15" />Mtambika katsomghala ichideghe ayo mna imatsabahu, kuya yambobotole singo na yamghane litwi, na yamlakatse mna ghumoto mna matsabahu. Lekeni tanu yanze kukinga idamu, na yaimitse mna ubanda wa matsabahu. <verse eid="LEV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 1:16" />Kuya yalapfe sekeseke na chila chinu ichili mumo, yakapfase ubali wa mashaliki wa matsabahu, ako kwalikwasighwa lipfu. <verse eid="LEV 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 1:17" />Kuya yamkinde mapamanilo na yambatsule, lekeni yaleke kumghana pfihindi pfibili, kuya mtambika katsomlakatsa hana tsingodi itsili mna matsabahu. Inyama ayo ilakatsighwe mna ghumoto yomnung'ila ghoya IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="LEV 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LEV 2" />
  <para style="s">Ukumlapfila IMNDEWA nambiko ya usaghe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 2:1" />Imunu wowose yang'amlapfila IMNDEWA usaghe, yasole tsimbeghu yadughe ili uwe usaghe utighinike ghendo. Yaughele ghamapfuta gha minzeituni na upfumba. <verse eid="LEV 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 2:2" />“Kuya yawaghalile iwana wa Aruni iwotambika. Mtambika yumwe katsosola ghawo limwe lya usaghe awo utighinike ghendo une ghamapfuta ne upfumba na kuulakatsa mna matsabahu, ghawo alyo limwe lyolangusa ghendo ka usaghe wose iulapfighwe wa IMNDEWA. Usaghe awo iulakatsighwe womnung'ila ghoya na kumnogheletsa IMNDEWA. <verse eid="LEV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 2:3" />Nambiko ya usaghe isighale watsakuja Aruni ne iwanaghe. Ayo yenzeluka ghendo ilapfighwe kwa IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="LEV 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 2:4" />“Na munu yang'amlapfila Imulungu ipfighate pfa usaghe pfokighwe mna litanuli, pfighate apfo pfiwe pfa usaghe utighinike ghendo na pfileke kuwa na ihamila, na pfighate apfo pfibakighwe ghamapfuta.”<verse eid="LEV 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 2:5" />“Ka munu komlapfila Imulungu ipfighate pfa usaghe ipfitsingighwe mchiha, pfighate apfo pfiwe pfa usaghe utighinike ghendo na pfileke kuwa na ihamila na pfighate apfo pfibakighwe ghamapfuta. <verse eid="LEV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 2:6" />Pfighate apfo pfitsobenighwabenighwa na kughelighwa ghamapfuta, ipfighate apfo pfakuwa ipfighate ipfilapfighwa kwa Imulungu.”<verse eid="LEV 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 2:7" />“Ka komlapfila Imulungu pfighate ipfitsingighwe mchiha, pfighate apfo pfiwe pfa usaghe utighinike ghendo na ughelighwe ghamapfuta gha minzeituni. <verse eid="LEV 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 2:8" />Umghalile IMNDEWA usaghe yauulapfa utendighwe kwa pfinu apfo, na mtambika katsoughala mna matsabahu. <verse eid="LEV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 2:9" />Mtambika katsodegha usaghe chidogho uulangusa ka usaghe wose iulapfighwe wake yeye IMNDEWA. Naye koulakatsa mna matsabahu uwe nambiko ya ukulakatsighwa, ayo yonung'ila ghoya na yomnoghelesa IMNDEWA. <verse eid="LEV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 2:10" />Nambiko ya usaghe ikalile watsakuja Aruni na iwanaghe. Ayo yenzeluka ghendo ilapfighwe kwa IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="LEV 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 2:11" />“Usaghe wowose yaumlapfila IMNDEWA uleke kuwa na ihamila, kwaapfila mwiko kughela ihamila na uki mna usaghe yaumlapfila IMNDEWA ukalakatsighwe. <verse eid="LEV 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 2:12" />Mwodaha kumghalila IMNDEWA ipfijo apfo ka ipfijo pfa mkwandusa ukupfuna. Lekeni pfijo apfo pfileke kulakatsighwa mna matsabahu ka pfa kumnung'ila ghoya Imulungu. <verse eid="LEV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 2:13" />Ughele imunyu mna chila ichijo cha usaghe iulapfighwa kwe Imulungu. Mwalangitse mleke kwisemwa kughela imunyu mna ipfijo apfo, kwaapfila imunyu yolangusa lilaghano lyayekile Imulungu na mwemwe.”<verse eid="LEV 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 2:14" />“Mng'amlapfila IMNDEWA ipfijo pfamkwandusa ukupfuna, mlapfileni ipfijo apfila pfamdughile na imikungwi yake na pfamwokile mna ghumoto. <verse eid="LEV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 2:15" />Mtsopfika ghamapfuta na kupfighela upfumba, apfo lelo pfitsakuwa ipfijo pfa usaghe ipfilapfighwa kwa IMNDEWA. <verse eid="LEV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 2:16" />Mtambika yumwe katsodegha ichijo acho chidogho, naye kochilakatsa mna imatsabahu. Ichijo acho ichideghighwe cholangusa ghendo ka usaghe wose iulapfighwe wa kwake yeye IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="LEV 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LEV 3" />
  <para style="s">Nambiko tsa ukukala tseghamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 3:1" />“Ka munu kobama kukala tseghamba na IMNDEWA, ayo yamlapfile ng'ombe mmale au pinga kulawa kuna wang'ombe wake, ing'ombe ayo yawe kenelela. <verse eid="LEV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 3:2" />Imunu ayo yeke ghumoko mwitwi mwa imnyama ayo, yamsubutule hambele ha ghumlango ghwa Lihema lya Kwitinganila. Kuya iwana wa Aruni watsomitsa idamu ikingighwe chila ubali wa imatsabahu ya shaba. <verse eid="LEV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 3:3" />Kulawa mna inambiko ya ukukala tseghamba, iwatambika waghale pfinu pfose ipfili munda pfa imnyama ayo pfikawe pfijo ipfilapfighwa kwa IMNDEWA, mumghalile ghamapfuta ghose ighoghubika ipfinu pfose ipfili munda. <verse eid="LEV 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 3:4" />Pfipfila walapfe tsifigho na ghamapfuta ghake, na likini na ghamapfuta ghake. <verse eid="LEV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 3:5" />Iwana wa Aruni watsopfilakatsa ipfinu apfo ipfili munda mchanya mwa imatsabahu ya shaba hamwe na ipfinu pfingi ipfilapfighwa, ipfijo apfino ipfilakatsighwa pfomnung'ila ghoya IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="LEV 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 3:6" />“Ka munu kobama kulapfa nambiko ya ukukala tseghamba na IMNDEWA, yamlapfile mene au ng'olo, yawe mvulati au mbughuma, iyenelele. <verse eid="LEV 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 3:7" />Ka munu komlapfa mwana wa ng'olo, yakamwike hambele ha IMNDEWA. <verse eid="LEV 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 3:8" />Yeke ghumoko ghwake mwitwi mwa ing'olo ayo, kuya yamsubutule hambele ha Lihema lya kwitinganila. Iwana wa Aruni watsomitsa idamu mna chila ubali wa Imatsabahu. <verse eid="LEV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 3:9" />Kuya sola ghamapfuta, ghumkila ghose ghuna ghamapfuta ighughanighwe habehi ghendo na ichighudi, ghamapfuta ghose ighaghubike usapi na ghamapfuta ghose ighali munda kulawa kuna imnyama ayula iyalapfile imunu yalakatsighwe ili yakale tseghamba na IMNDEWA, <verse eid="LEV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 3:10" />na tsifigho atsila mbili na ghamapfuta ghake hamwe na ghamapfuta ghose gha likini. <verse eid="LEV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 3:11" />Imtambika yalakatse apfo pfose mchanya mwa Imatsabahu ka nambiko ya ichijo iilapfighwa kwa IMNDEWA kwa kulakatsighwa.”<verse eid="LEV 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 3:12" />“Ka munu komlapfa imene, yamghale hambele ha IMNDEWA. <verse eid="LEV 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 3:13" />Yeke ghumwoko ghwake mwitwi mwa imnyama ayo na yamtsubutule hambele ha Lihema lya Ukwitinganila. Iwana wa Aruni watsomitsa idamu yake chila ubali wa Imatsabahu. <verse eid="LEV 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 3:14" />Pfipfila yasole ghamapfuta ghose ighaghubike munda, <verse eid="LEV 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 3:15" />na tsifigho atsila mbili na ghamapfuta ghake na likini. <verse eid="LEV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 3:16" />Imtambika yapfilakatse mchanya mwa Imatsabahu ka chijo ichilapfighwa kwa IMNDEWA kwa kulakatsighwa, ichinung'ila ghoya na kumnoghela IMNDEWA. Ghamapfuta ghose ghawe gha IMNDEWA. <verse eid="LEV 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 3:17" />Imbuli aino itsakuwa laghitso lya ghamatsuwa ghose, na hohose hamkala mlikindise lilaghitso alino. Mwiko ukuja ghamapfuta wala idamu.”<verse eid="LEV 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LEV 4" />
  <para style="s">Nambiko tse nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 4:1" />IMNDEWA tsakamlongela Musa, <verse eid="LEV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 4:2" />yawalongele iwanu wa Isiraeli apfino, munu yang'atenda nzambi aku ng'amanyile baye ka chayatendile nzambi, katenda achila ichighomighwe mna ghamalaghitso gha IMNDEWA, ayo yatende apfino.<verse eid="LEV 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 4:3" />“Ka imtambika mkulu yuyo iyatendile nzambi, naye kowahonza iwanu wose woneke wana nzambi, ayo yaghale mwana mmale wa ing'ombe iyenelele, yakamlapfile IMNDEWA ka nambiko ya ukumleghusila tsinzambi ili yamleghusile inzambi iyatendile. <verse eid="LEV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 4:4" />Yamghale ing'ombe ayo habehi na ghumlango ghwa Lihema lya ukwitinganila, naye yeke ghumoko ghwake mwitwi mwa imwana mmale wa ing'ombe ayo na kumsubutula hambele ha IMNDEWA. <verse eid="LEV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 4:5" />Imtambika mkulu ayo katsosola idamu chidogho na kwingila nayo mghati mwa Lihema lya ukwitinganila. <verse eid="LEV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 4:6" />Katsopfabika chidole chake mna idamu ayo na kumitsa mala saba hambele ha IMNDEWA, hambele ha lipanziya ilighola hanu Haenzeluke na ihanu Haenzeluke Ghendo. <verse eid="LEV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 4:7" />Imtambika mkulu ayo katsosola idamu chidogho yabake mna tsimembe itsisomoke tsa imatsabahu ya ukudusulila upfumba iunung'ila ghoya, baho hambele ha IMNDEWA, ili mghati mwa Lihema lya ukwitinganila. Idamu ikalile yaikutule hasi ha Imatsabahu, baho hapfilakatsighwa ipfinu ipfilapfighwa kwa Imulungu, haghuli ghumlango ghwa Lihema lya ukwitinganila. <verse eid="LEV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 4:8" />Kuya yalapfe ghamapfuta ghose gha ing'ombe ayo, na ghamapfuta ighaghubike usapi, <verse eid="LEV 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 4:9" />tsifigho mbili na ghamapfuta ghake na ghamapfuta aghala ighali mchighudi, na ghamapfuta ghose ighaghubike likini. <verse eid="LEV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 4:10" />Imtambika mkulu yasole ghamapfuta agho yaghalakatse mchanya mwa Imatsabahu. Yatende ka apfila pfayalapfile ghamapfuta kulawa kuna imnyama ayula iyalapfighwe ili imunu yakale tseghamba na IMNDEWA. <verse eid="LEV 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 4:11" />Lekeni yasole ingotsi ya ing'ombe ayo, inyama yake yose, litwi lyake, maghondi ghake, usapi wake na mipfi yake, <verse eid="LEV 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 4:12" />yakapfase kunze kutali na indalo yawo, hanu hayobama Imulungu, kuko kwalikwasighwa lipfu, yapfilakatse kwa ghumoto ghwa tsingodi.”<verse eid="LEV 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 4:13" />“Ka iwanu wose wa Isiraeli watenda nzambi aku ng'awamanyile baye ka chawatendile nzambi, watenda chinu achila ichighomighwe mna ghamalaghitso gha IMNDEWA. Awo wose watotsa ghendo hata ka ng'awotanga baye ka watenda nzambi. <verse eid="LEV 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 4:14" />Hawotanga ka chawatendile nzambi, iwanu wose wamlapfile Imulungu mwana mmale wa ng'ombe, ili IMNDEWA yawaleghusile inzambi yawo. Wamghale mna Lihema lya ukwitinganila. <verse eid="LEV 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 4:15" />Iwakulu wawo weke ghamoko ghawo mwitwi mwa ing'ombe ayo, kuya wamsubutule hambele ha IMNDEWA. <verse eid="LEV 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 4:16" />Kuya Mtambika Mkulu ayo yasole idamu chidogho ya imwana mmale wa ing'ombe yaghale mghati mna Lihema lya ukwitinganila. <verse eid="LEV 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 4:17" />Katsopfabika chidole chake mna idamu ayo, kuya katsomitsa mala saba hambele ha IMNDEWA, hambele ha lipanzia ilighola Hanu Haenzeluke na Hanu Haenzeluke Ghendo. <verse eid="LEV 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 4:18" />Imtambika mkulu ayo katsosola idamu chidogho yabake mna tsimembe tsili mna imamtsabahu ya ukudusulila upfumba iunung'ila ghoya, hambele he IMNDEWA mghati mwa Lihema lya kwitinganila. Idamu ikalile yaikutule hasi ha imatsabahu ya ukulakatsila tsinambiko, hana ghumlango ghwa Lihema lya ukwitinganila. <verse eid="LEV 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 4:19" />Kuya katsolapfa ghamapfuta ghose ighali mna imnyama ayo yaghalakatse mchanya mwa Imatsabahu. <verse eid="LEV 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 4:20" />Apfo yamtende ing'ombe ayo ka pfayamtendile ing'ombe ayula immale iyalapfighwe kwa Imulungu kwa nzambi tsake tsayatendile. Ahala mtambika mkulu hayatsomalitsa kuwalamla na Imulungu na kuwatenda iwanu wele keli, baho Imulungu naye katsowaleghusila iwanu nzambi tsawo. <verse eid="LEV 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 4:21" />Kuya katsosola inyama ikalile ya ing'ombe ayo yakailakatse kunze kutali na indalo yawo, ka pfayamlakatse ing'ombe iyalapfighwe kwa nzambi tsake tsayatendile, ukulapfigwa kwa imnyama ayuno kowaleghusila Waisiraeli wose tsinzambi tsawatendile.”<verse eid="LEV 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 4:22" />“Ka ichilongotsi wa Waisiraeli katenda nzambi aku ng'amanyile baye ka katenda nzambi, katenda ichinu ichighomighwe mna ghamalaghitso gha IMNDEWA, naye katotsa ghendo. <verse eid="LEV 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 4:23" />Na baho hayotanga ka katenda nzambi, yamghalile IMNDEWA mvulati iyenelele. <verse eid="LEV 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 4:24" />Yeke ghumoko ghwake mwitwi mwa imvulati ayo na yamsubutule hanu hawosubutulila iwanyama iwolakatsighwa. Yang'atenda apfo inzambi yake yoleghusighwa. <verse eid="LEV 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 4:25" />Imtambika Mkulu ayo katsopfabika ichidole chake mna idamu ikingighwe ya imnyama ayo kuya katsobakatsa mna tsimembe tsili ka tsa mnyama, itsisomoke mchanya mwa Imatsabahu ya ukulakatsila tsinambiko. Idamu ikalile yaikutule hasi ha Imatsabahu ayo. <verse eid="LEV 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 4:26" />Ghamapfuta ghose gha imvulati ayo yaghalakatse mchanya mwa Imatsabahu, ka pfayaghalakatse ghamapfuta gha imnyama ayula iyalapfighwe ili yakale tseghamba na Imulungu. Mtambika yang'atenda apfi, mtambika katsomlamlitsa na Imulungu na ichilongotsi kakuwa kahela nzambi.”<verse eid="LEV 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 4:27" />“Imunu yungi wowose yang'atenda nzambi aku ngamanyile baye ka chayatendile nzambi, katenda chinu ichighomighwe mna malaghitso gha IMNDEWA, ayo katotsa ghendo. <verse eid="LEV 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 4:28" />Baho hayotanga ka chayatendile nzambi, yaghale mene mbughuma iyenelele, yakamlapfile Imulungu ili yamleghusile inzambi iyatendile. <verse eid="LEV 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 4:29" />Yeke ghumoko ghwake mwitwi mwa imene ayo na yamsubutule hanu ahala hawosubutulila wanyama iwolapfighwa walakatsighwe. <verse eid="LEV 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 4:30" />Imtambika katsopfabika chidole chake mna idamu ya imnyama na katsobakatsa mna tsimembe itsisomoke itsili ka tsa mnyama mchanya mwa Imatsabahu. Idamu ikalile katsoikutula hasi ha Imatsabahu. <verse eid="LEV 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 4:31" />Katsoghalapfa ghamapfuta ghose ighali mna imbughuma ayo ka pfayaghalapfile ghamapfuta gha imnyama ayula iyalapfighwe na imunu ili yakale tseghamba na Imulungu, naye Imtambika katsoghalakatsa mchanya mwa Imatsabahu, na kunung'ila kwake ghoya kutsomnoghelesa IMNDEWA. Imtambika yang'atenda apfo, komlamlitsa na Imulungu, imunu ayo kakuwa kahela keli nzambi, na baho inzambi yake ileghusighwa.”<verse eid="LEV 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 4:32" />“Imunu ayo yang'amlapfila Imulungu imwana wa ng'olo kwa inzambi aila iyatendile, yamghalile ing'olo mbughuma iyenelele. <verse eid="LEV 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 4:33" />Kuya katsakwika ghumoko ghwake mwitwi mwa imwana wa ing'olo ayo na yamsubutule hanu hawosubutulila iwanyama iwolakatsighwa. <verse eid="LEV 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 4:34" />Imtambika katsopfabika chidole chake mna idamu ya imwana wa ing'olo ayo na katsobakatsa mna tsimembe itsisomoke itsili ka tsa mnyama mchanya mwa Imatsabahu. Idamu ikalile katsoikutula hasi ha Imatsabahu. <verse eid="LEV 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 4:35" />Kuya katsoghalapfa ghamapfuta ghose ighali mna imwana wa ing'olo ayo ka pfayaghalapfile ghamapfuta gha ing'olo ayula iyalapfighwe ili yakale tseghamba na Imulungu, naye Mtambika katsoghalakatsa mchanya mwa Imatsabahu ka nambiko ya chijo iilapfighwa kwa IMNDEWA. Mtambika yang'atenda apfo, komlamlitsa na Imulungu, na baho nzambi yake yakuwa ileghusighwa.”<verse eid="LEV 4:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LEV 5" />
  <para style="s">Chokumlapfila Imulungu ahala imunu yang'atenda nzambi atsino</para>
  <para style="p">Nambiko tsa ukuleghusa tsinzambi tsobamighwa tsilapfighwe kwa tsinzambi atsino. <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 5:1" />“Munu wowose yang'akemighwa kuna libalatsa naye kobamighwa yalonge achila chayonile au chayahulike, lekeni yeye kolema ukulonga chayonile au chayahulike, ayo naye kakuwa kana ghomba.”<verse eid="LEV 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 5:2" />“Munu wowose mna mwemwe yang'akinda chinu chihile hambele ha IMNDEWA, iwe kakinda mitsogha ya iwanyama wa kumuhulo au wa ukufugha, au iwe kakinda mitsogha ya wang'onyo iwotambala, na baho hayotanga ka kakinda, naye yamanye ghendo ka katotsa, <verse eid="LEV 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 5:3" />au yang'akinda chinu ichilawa mlukuli mwa munu ichilongighwa ka chiha, au chiwe chochose achila, aku ng'amanyile baye ka kakinda, na baho hayatsomanya chayatendile, yamanye ghendo ka katotsa.”<verse eid="LEV 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 5:4" />“Munu yang'eleha kutenda chinu chochose achila, chiwe chinogha au chiha, ka apfila pfawelaha iwanu wangi aku ng'awakwalangula baye, imunu ayo hayatsotanga ka katenda apfo, yamanye ghendo ka katotsa. <verse eid="LEV 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 5:5" />Lelo yeye mwenyegho hayotanga ka katotsa mna tsinzambi atsino, yatoghole inzambi iyaitendile hambele ha iwanu, <verse eid="LEV 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 5:6" />kuya yamghalile IMNDEWA ng'olo mbughuma au mene mbughuma kulawa mna iwanyama wake, kwa inzambi yake aila iyatendile. Naye imtambika katsomlapfa kwa Imulungu, na baho kakuwa kahela nzambi keli.”<verse eid="LEV 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 5:7" />“Lekeni ka kahela mwana wa ng'olo au mene wa ukulapfa kwa inzambi aila iyatendile, yamlapfile IMNDEWA njiwa weli au makinda meli gha tetele, yumwe kolapfighwa kwa inzambi iyatendile na yungi kolapfighwa yakalakatsighwe mna Imatsabahu. <verse eid="LEV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 5:8" />Yawaghale kwa imtambika, naye imtambika yamlapfe yumwe yawe wa kumleghusila inzambi aila iyatendile kwa kumbobotola isingo bila kulighana litwi lyake. <verse eid="LEV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 5:9" />Kuya yasole idamu chidogho yabakatse mmbalimbali mwa Imatsabahu, na idamu ingi ikalile, katsoikutula hasi ha Imatsabahu. Kwa ukulapfighwa akuno kwa injiwa, inzambi ileghusighwa. <verse eid="LEV 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 5:10" />Kuya Imtambika yalapfe ayula wakeli yakalakatsighwe ka pfailaghitsighwe. Kwa ukutenda apfo, imunu ayo kakuwa ng'atotsile baye. Naye Imulungu komleghusila inzambi yake.”<verse eid="LEV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 5:11" />“Ka kahela ghendo njiwa weli au makinda meli gha tetele, yamlapfile Imulungu kimbo limwe lya usaghe utighinike ghendo kwa inzambi aila iyatendile. Lekeni yaleke kuughela ghamapfuta wala mapfumba kwaapfila usaghe awo ulapfighwa ka nambiko ya kuleghusa nzambi. <verse eid="LEV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 5:12" />Yaughale kwa imtambika, naye yadeghe ghawo limwe, lighawo alyo limwe lyolangusa ghendo ka usaghe awo wose iulapfighwe wa kwake yeye IMNDEWA. Naye imtambika yaulakatse mchanya mwa Imatsabahu, mchanya mwa ipfinu pfingi ipfilapfighwe kwa IMNDEWA ka nambiko ya ukuleghusa tsinzambi. Naye IMNDEWA komleghusila inzambi yake. <verse eid="LEV 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 5:13" />Imtambika yang'atenda apfi komlamlitsa na Imulungu, imunu ayo kakuwa ng'atotsile baye mna tsinzambi atsino tsayatendile na baho Imulungu komleghusila inzambi yake. Usaghe ukalile utsakuwa wa imtambika ka pfaitendighwa inambiko ya ichijo.”<verse eid="LEV 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nambiko tsa matotso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 5:14" />IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, <verse eid="LEV 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 5:15" />“Munu wowose yang'atenda nzambi aku ng'amanyile baye ka chayatendile nzambi, kwa kulema kulapfa ipfinu apfila ipfibamighwa yeng'ighwe IMNDEWA, kobamighwa yamulihe IMNDEWA kwa kumghalila ng'unzu iyenelele kulawa kuna wang'olo wake, naghwe umanye imnyama ayo youtsighwatse kwa ukulingana na ipfinu ipfili mna Lihema lya ukwitinganila. <verse eid="LEV 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 5:16" />Pfipfila imunu ayo kobamighwa yoitse ichinu achila chayalekile ukumwing'a IMNDEWA, yamwongetsele asilimiya ishilini ya bei ya ichinu acho. Kuya yamwing'e imtambika ichinu acho, naye imtambika katsomlapfila Imulungu ing'unzu ayo kwa inzambi iyatendile imunu ayo ka nambiko ya ghamatotso, baho imunu ayo kakuwa kahela nzambi keli.”<verse eid="LEV 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 5:17" />“Munu wowose yang'atenda nzambi aku ng'amanyile baye ka chayatendile nzambi, kwa kutenda ichinu chochose ichighomighwe mna ghamalaghitso gha IMNDEWA, imunu ayo katotsa ghendo, naye katsohighighwa kwa ukutotsa kwake. <verse eid="LEV 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 5:18" />Imunu ayo yaghale ing'unzu iyenelele kwa imtambika, naye imtambika katsomlapfila Imulungu ing'unzu ayo kwa litotso lyatendile imunu ayo, na baho litotso lya imunu ayo lyakuwa lileghusighwa. <verse eid="LEV 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 5:19" />Ukumlapfila inambiko ya ghamatotso IMNDEWA, komtenda imunu yaleghusighwe litotso.”<verse eid="LEV 5:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LEV 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 6:1" />IMNDEWA tsakamlongela Musa, <verse eid="LEV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 6:2" />“Ka munu wowose konitendela nzambi nene IMNDEWA, tulonge kolema kuitsa chinu chayekile poni kwa Muisiraeli miyaghe, au komboka ichinu chake, au kombugha miyaghe, imunu ayo katotsa ghendo. <verse eid="LEV 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 6:3" />Pfipfia ka kodondola ichinu chayaghitse miyaghe, kuya kobela ng'achidondole baye aku kelighita ghendo kwa ughutsu ka ng'atendile baye tsinzambi ka atsino, imunu ayo katotsa ghendo. <verse eid="LEV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 6:4" />Naye hayotanga ka katenda nzambi kobamighwa yoitse chayebile au chayapatile kwa kumbunza miyaghe na yoitse ichinu chikighwe poni na achila chayadondole, <verse eid="LEV 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 6:5" />au chochose achila chayapatile aku kelighita kwa ughutsu. Ipfinu apfo pfose yamuitsile imwenyegho. Yamlihe chila chinu ka pfachili na yongetse asilimia ishilini ya bei ya ichinu acho aho hayotanga ka katotsa. <verse eid="LEV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 6:6" />Kuya yaghale ng'unzu au mvulati iyenelele, ka nambiko ya totso, naye mtambika yamlapfile IMNDEWA ing'unzu, ili IMNDEWA yamleghusile nzambi yake. Ibei ya imnyama ayo itsakuwa ka pfaikwikighwa mna Lihema Lienzeluke. <verse eid="LEV 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 6:7" />Na mtambika katsolapfa nambiko ya kumlalitsa na Imulungu, naye Imulungu katsomleghusila inzambi yoyose iyatendile.”<verse eid="LEV 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukumlapfila Imulungu nambiko tsa kulakatsighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 6:8" />Kuya IMNDEWA tsakamlongela Musa, <verse eid="LEV 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 6:9" />“Mlongele Aruni na wanaghe waghakinde malaghitso ghano ahala hawolakatsa tsinambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa itsilapfighwa kwa Imulungu mchanya mwa Imatsabau. Inambiko ilakatsighwa yobamighwa ikale mna ghumoto mchanya mwa Imatsabahu chilo chose mbaka hamitondo na ghumoto ghwake ghuleke kutsimika. <verse eid="LEV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 6:10" />Kuya mtambika aku kapfala ghwanda lyake lya chitambala chitselu na kaputula yake ya ichitambala chitselu chinoghile, yasole lipfu lya nambiko tsilakatsighwe mchanya mwa Imatsabahu yalike hambalimbali ha Imatsabahu.”<verse eid="LEV 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 6:11" />Kuya yatsule maghwanda ghake na yapfale ghangi, yasole lipfu lila na yalighale kunze kwa indalo yawo, ihanu helile. <verse eid="LEV 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 6:12" />Ghumoto ighuli mchanya mwa Imatsabahu, ghobamighwa ghughendelele ukwaka, ghuleke kutsimika. Chila mitondo mtambika katsokwitsa tsingodi hana ghumoto aghwo na mchanya mwake katsakwika tsinambiko tsibamighwa tsilakatsighwe, na yalakatse ghamapfuta gha iwanyama iwalapfighwe ka nambiko tsa ukukala tseghamba na Imulungu. <verse eid="LEV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 6:13" />Ghumoto ghutsoghendelela ukwaka ghamatsuwa ghose mchanya mwa Imatsabahu bila kutsimighwa.<verse eid="LEV 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukumlapfila Imulungu nambiko tsa usaghe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 6:14" />“Aghano ghagho ghamalaghitso ighowalongotsa ahala hamumlapfila Imulungu nambiko tsa usaghe. Iwana wa Aruni wamlapfile IMNDEWA nambiko tsa usaghe hambele ha Imatsabahu. <verse eid="LEV 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 6:15" />Imtambika yumwe yadeghe ghawo limwe lya usaghe utighinike ghendo, iutipfighwe ghamapfuta na upfumba, kuya yaulakatse mchanya mwa Imatsabahu. Ghawo alyo limwe lyolangusa ghendo ka usaghe wose iulapfighwe ya kwake yeye Imulungu. Ukunung'ila kwake kutsomnoghelesa IMNDEWA. <verse eid="LEV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 6:16" />Usaghe iukalile katsakuja Aruni na wanaghe lekeni pfighate pfake hapfikwambikighwa pfileke kughelighwa ihamila. Watsouja hanu haenzeluke mghati mwa luwa lya Lihema Lienzeluke. <verse eid="LEV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 6:17" />Ileke kwambikighwa na ihamila. Niweng'a wawo usaghe awo kulawa mna usaghe yawondapfila kwa ghumoto. Usaghe awo wenzeluka ghendo ka pfaili nambiko iilapfighwa ili munu yaleghusighwe nzambi na apfila iilapfighwa ili imunu yaleke kwoneka katotsa. <verse eid="LEV 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 6:18" />Iwana wamale wa Aruni wodaha ukuja usaghe awo ukalile kwaapfila matsuwa ghose ubaghulighwa ujighwe na wawo kulawa mna usaghe iulapfighwa kwa Imulungu ulakatsighwe. Imunu wowose youkinda utimbo awo kobamighwa yawe mwenzeluka.” <verse eid="LEV 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 6:19" />IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, <verse eid="LEV 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 6:20" />“Kulawa hayasaghulighwe Aruni na wanaghe wawe watambika, wobamighwa wamlapfile IMNDEWA kimbo limwe lya usaghe utighinike ghendo, nusu imwe ya usaghe waulapfe hamitondo na nusu ingi waulapfe hamihe. <verse eid="LEV 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 6:21" />Wauhanganye ghoya na ghamapfuta na ghwambikighwe, kuya chighate acho wachibatsule batsule na wamlapfile IMNDEWA ka nambiko ya usaghe, na ukunung'ila kwake kutsomnoghelesa IMNDEWA. <verse eid="LEV 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 6:22" />Mna ghamatsuwa ghose ighakutsa chila mwana mlume wa Aruni iyosaghulighwa yawe Mtambika Mkulu kobamighwa yamlapfile Imulungu kimbo limwe lya utimbo, yaulakatse ili uwe wake yeye IMNDEWA. <verse eid="LEV 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 6:23" />Inambiko yoyose ya usaghe iilapfighwa na mtambika yobamighwa ilakatsighwe yose, wala ileke kujighwa.”<verse eid="LEV 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nambiko tsa nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 6:24" />IMNDEWA tsakamlongela Musa, <verse eid="LEV 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 6:25" />“Mlongele pfino Aruni na wanaghe, hawomlapfila Imulungu nambiko ye mnyama ya kuleghusa nzambi watende pfino, hanu hayochinjighwa imnyama iyolapfighwa yalakatsighwe, baho yachinjighwe imnyama iyolapfighwa kwa IMNDEWA ili imunu yaleghusighwe inzambi yake iyaitedile. Hanu aho hawe hambele ha IMNDEWA. <verse eid="LEV 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 6:26" />Mtambika ayo yomlapfa imnyama ayo yakasubutulighwe, inyama yake, yaje yeye. Ijighwe hanu haenzeluke mghati mwe luwa lya Lihema lya ukwitinganila. <verse eid="LEV 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 6:27" />Imunu wowose yodonza inyama ayo kobamighwa yaenzeluke. Idamu ing'alaghalila mna lighwanda, lighwanda alyo likatsapfighwe hanu haenzeluke. <verse eid="LEV 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 6:28" />Inyama ayo ing'ambikighwa mna pfiya, ipfiya apfo pfitulighwe. Lekeni ka yambikighwa mna pfiya pfa shaba, pfinu apfo pfikuwighwe na ghamatsi na kughulutsighwa. <verse eid="LEV 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 6:29" />Chila mmale mna lukolo lwa iwatambika kodaha ukuja inyama ayo, kwaapfila inyama ayo yenzeluka ghendo. <verse eid="LEV 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 6:30" />Lekeni ka idamu ya imnyama yalapfighwe ka nambiko ya kuleghusa nzambi ighalighwa mghati mwa Lihema lya ukwitinganila ili kuwaleghusila iwanu tsinzambi, inyama yake ileke kujighwa, ilakatsighwe mna ghumoto.”<verse eid="LEV 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LEV 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 7:1" />Aghano ghamalaghitso gha nambiko ya kuleghusa totso. Inambiko ienzeluke ghendo. <verse eid="LEV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 7:2" />Mnyama wa nambiko ya ukuleghusa totso katsochinjighwa hanu hawachinjighwa iwanyama wa nambiko tsa kulakatsighwa, na mlopa ghwake kutsoghumitsila mna matsabahu chila ubali. <verse eid="LEV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 7:3" />Ghamapfuta ghake ghose, ghamapfuta gha mkila na aghala ighaghubike usapi ghatsolapfighwa na kulakatsighwa <verse eid="LEV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 7:4" />hamwe na tsifigho tsila mbili na ghamapfuta ghake na hanu hanoghile ha likini. <verse eid="LEV 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 7:5" />Mtambika katsopfilakatsa mchanya mwa imatsabahu ka nambiko iyolapfighwa kwa IMNDEWA Imulungu kwa ghumoto. Ayo nambiko ya ukuleghusa totso. <verse eid="LEV 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 7:6" />Immale wowose mna lukolo lwa iwatambika yaliyeka kodaha kuija, ayo nambiko ienzeluke ghendo. Itsakujighwa hanu haenzeluke. <verse eid="LEV 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 7:7" />Kama pfaili nambiko ayo ya kuleghusa nzambi, na pfipfo pfaili nambiko ya ukuleghusa totso, laghitso lyake limwe, mtambika iyotenda ulamlitsi yuyo iyatsoisola. <verse eid="LEV 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 7:8" />Mtambika iyolapfa nambiko ya ukulakatsighwa ya imunu wowose, katsosola ingotsi ya imnyama iyapfighwe. <verse eid="LEV 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 7:9" />Nambiko yoyose ya mbeghu iyokighwe mchikong'o au mnongo au mchikalango itsakuwa ya mtambika iyailapfile. <verse eid="LEV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 7:10" />Chila nambiko ya mbeghu, iihanganyighwe na ghamapfuta au iisakale, itsakuwa ya wana wa Aruni, na wose wagholelighwe sawa.<verse eid="LEV 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nambiko tsa ukukala tseghamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 7:11" />Aghano ghagho malaghitso ighomlongotsa munu ahala hayomlapfila IMNDEWA pfinu ili yakale tseghamba na Yeye. <verse eid="LEV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 7:12" />Imunu yang'abama ukulonga mighede kwa Imulungu kwa ukumlapfila imnyama ayula iyolapfighwa yalakatsighwe, yamlapfile hamwe na maandatsi ighalihela hamila, pfighate pfidopfido ipfibakighwe ghamapfuta na ipfilihela hamila na maandatsi gha usaghe utighinike ghendo na iuhanganyighwe ghoya na ghamapfuta. <verse eid="LEV 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 7:13" />Hamwe na imnyama ayo iyolapfa ili yalonge mighede kwa Imulungu, pfipfila yamlapfile ghamaandatsi ighaghelighwe ihamila. <verse eid="LEV 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 7:14" />Kulawa mna ghamaandatsi agho ghose, katsosola andatsi limwelimwe yamlapfile IMNDEWA, lelo ghamaandatsi agho ighasolighwe ghatsakuwa gha mtambika iyomitsa idamu ya iwanyama iwolapfighwa na iwanu ili wakale tseghamba na Imulungu. <verse eid="LEV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 7:15" />Inyama ya mnyama ayula iyalapfighwe na imunu ili yalonge mighede kwa Imulungu itsakujighwa litsuwa lilyo.<verse eid="LEV 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 7:16" />“Lekeni ka imnyama ayo iyalapfighwe na imunu tsakamlapfa kwa kutenda achila chayelahile, au tsakamlapfa kwa ukubama mwenyegho, inyama yake ijighwe litsuwa lilyo hayolapfighwa, na inyama yake ikala yodaha kujighwa ilupfi yake. <verse eid="LEV 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 7:17" />Lekeni inyama yoyose ya imnyama ayo ing'akala mbaka tsuwa lya kadatu itsolakatsighwa. <verse eid="LEV 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 7:18" />Ka inyama yoyose ya imnyama ayo yakujighwa mna tsuwa lya kadatu, Imulungu ng'atsomtambula baye imunu iyamlapfile imnyama ayo, wala imnyama iyamlapfile ng'atsobokelighwa baye na IMNDEWA. Inyama ayo itsakuwa iha hambele ha IMNDEWA na imunu iyatsoija ilitsompata alyo lyake.”<verse eid="LEV 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 7:19" />“Inyama yoyose iidonza chinu chayakona Imulungu chiha, ileke kujighwa. Inyama ayo ilakatsighwe kwa ghumoto. Imunu wowose iyebona kotogholighwa na Imulungu kodaha kuija inyama ikalile, <verse eid="LEV 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 7:20" />lekeni imunu wowose yehile, yang'aja inyama ayo ilapfighwe ili yakale tseghamba na Imulungu, katsobaghulighwa kulawa mna iwanu wa Imulungu. <verse eid="LEV 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 7:21" />Imunu wowose iyodonza chinu chochose ichihile, chiwe ichimlawa imunu ichikoneka chiha, au ichimlawa imnyama yehile, au chiwe chinu chochose ichimwihila Imulungu, yang'aja inyama ya imnyama iyalapfighwe na imunu ili yakale tseghamba na Imulungu, imunu ayo katsobaghulighwa kulawa mna iwanu wa Imulungu.”<verse eid="LEV 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 7:22" />IMNDEWA tsakamlongela keli Musa, <verse eid="LEV 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 7:23" />“Walongele Waisiraeli pfino, Mleke ukuja ghamapfuta gha ing'ombe, gha ng'olo wala gha mene. <verse eid="LEV 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 7:24" />Ghamapfuta gha mnyama wowose iyafile imwenyegho au iyakomighwe na imnyama wa kwibagho ghodaha kwikighwa kwa ukutendela sang'ano tsingi lekeni mleke kughaja. <verse eid="LEV 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 7:25" />Kwaapfila munu wowose yang'aja ghamapfuta gha imnyama iyalapfighwe kwa IMNDEWA kwa ukulakatsighwa mna ghumoto, katsobaghulighwa kulawa kwa iwanu wa Imulungu. <verse eid="LEV 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 7:26" />Kwokwose akula kwamkala, mleke ukuja idamu yoyose, iwe ya chideghe wala ya mnyama. <verse eid="LEV 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 7:27" />Imunu wowose iyakuja idamu, imunu ayo katsobaghulighwa kulawa mna iwanu wa Imulungu.” <verse eid="LEV 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 7:28" />IMNDEWA tsakamlongela Musa, <verse eid="LEV 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 7:29" />“Uwalongele iwanu wa Isiraeli apfino, Imunu wowose yang'amlapfa imnyama ili yakale tseghamba na Imulungu, kobamighwa yamghalile Imulungu inyama chidogho kulawa kuna imnyama ayo. <verse eid="LEV 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 7:30" />Yeye mwenyegho yamghale kwa ghamoko ghake ikalakatsighwe mna ghumoto. Yaghale ghamapfuta gha imnyama ayo na chidali chake, kuya inulighwe mchanya kulangusa ka ilapfighwa kwa IMNDEWA. <verse eid="LEV 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 7:31" />Imtambika katsoghalakatsa ghamapfuta ghose mchanya mwa Imatsabahu, lekeni ichidali chitsakuwa cha Aruni na iwanaghe. <verse eid="LEV 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 7:32" />Mghulu ghwa kujilo ighuli kuchughu kwa imnyama ayo iyalapfighwe na imunu ili yakale tseghamba na Imulungu, yeng'ighwe mtambika. <verse eid="LEV 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 7:33" />Lihatsa alyo litsakuwa lya mtambika iyoneke mna lukolo lwa Aruni iyolapfa idamu na ghamapfuta gha imnyama ayo. <verse eid="LEV 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 7:34" />Nene IMNDEWA tsaniwalaghitsa iwanu wa Isiraeli wabaghule ichidali acho na lihatsa alyo kulawa kuna iwanyama iwolapfighwa na iwanu ili wakale tseghamba na nene Imulungu, na waweng'e Aruni na wanaghe kwaapfila tsinyama atso tsikighwa tsiwe tsawo ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse eid="LEV 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 7:35" />Tsinyama tsino tsibaghulighwa tsiwe tsa Aruni na iwanaghe kulawa mna iwanyama iwolapfighwa kwea Imulungu kwa ghumoto, kulawa ahala hawekighwe wamtambikile IMNDEWA.” <verse eid="LEV 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 7:36" />IMNDEWA tsakawalaghitsa Waisiraeli waweng'e tsinyama atso tsiwe tsawo matsuwa ghose kulawa ahala hawabakighwe mapfuta wawe watambika. <verse eid="LEV 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 7:37" />Aghano ghagho ghamalaghitso ighowalongotsa Waisiraeli ahala hawomlapfila Imulungu nambiko tsa usaghe, na hawolapfa nambiko ili watogholighwe keli na Imulungu na hawolapfa nambiko kwa kulema kumwing'a ipfinu ipfibamighwa yeng'ighwe Imulungu, na hawolapfa tsinambiko ahala hayosaghulighwa Imtambika, na ahala hawolapfa ipfinu ili wakale tseghamba na IMNDEWA. <verse eid="LEV 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 7:38" />Aghano ghagho ghamalaghitso gha IMNDEWA ghayamwing'ile Musa kuna chidunda Sinai, litsuwa alila hayawalaghitse Waisiraeli wamghalile tsinambiko na iwanyama wawo, akula mna inyika ya Sinai.<verse eid="LEV 7:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LEV 8" />
  <para style="s">Aruni na iwanaghe wohimikighwa wawe watambika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 8:1" />IMNDEWA tsakamlongela Musa, <verse eid="LEV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 8:2" />“Mkeme Aruni na iwanaghe, kuya usole maghwanda ghawo maenzeluka, na mapfuta gha ukuwabakatsa na ng'ombe wa ukuwaleghusila nzambi tsawo, na ng'unzu weli na usole chiseghe china ipfighate ipfilihela hamila. <verse eid="LEV 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 8:3" />Kuya uwakeme wanu wose wa Isiraeli wetingane hambele hana ghumlango ghwa Lihema lya ukwitinganila.”<verse eid="LEV 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 8:4" />Musa tsakatenda ka IMNDEWA pfayamlaghitse, kawakema iwanu wose hambele ha ghumlango ghwa Lihema lya ukwitinganila. <verse eid="LEV 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 8:5" />Musa kawalongela apfino iwanu wose, “Aghano ghagho ghayalaghitse IMNDEWA ghatendeke.”<verse eid="LEV 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 8:6" />Kuya Musa tsakawaghala Aruni na iwanaghe hambele na kuwahopfugha na ghamatsi wele hambele ha IMNDEWA Imulungu. <verse eid="LEV 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 8:7" />Kuya kampfatsa Aruni likanzu na kulyoha kwa msipi, kuya kampfatsa lijoho na kampfatsa chisibau na kuchoha mchuno mwake kwa msipi ighwohighwe ghoya ghwa ichisibau acho. <verse eid="LEV 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 8:8" />Kuya keka chikoba cha mmambagha mwa Aruni, na mghati mwa ichikoba acho keka ghamabwe meli gha ukulamulila ighokemighwa Urimu na Thumimu. <verse eid="LEV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 8:9" />Kuya kampfatsa Aruni ikofiya na hambele ha ikofiya ayo keka chibamba chikighwe unzolingo wa nzahabu, litaji lyenzeluke ka IMNDEWA pfayamlaghitse Musa. <verse eid="LEV 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 8:10" />Kuya Musa kasola ghamapfuta ghenzeluke, kalibakatsa Lihema Lienzeluke na ipfinu pfose ipfili mghati mwake, na kwa ukutenda apfo kapfilapfa pfiwe pfa IMNDEWA. <verse eid="LEV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 8:11" />Kuya kamitsa ghamapfuta mna Imatsabahu mala saba, na kapfibakatsa ghamapfuta ipfinu pfose ipfili baho, na libigha lya ukuhopfughila, na chikalilo cha libigha, na kupfitenda pfenzeluke. <verse eid="LEV 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 8:12" />Pfipfila Musa kamghela Aruni ghamapfuta mwitwi, na baho kamhimika yamtambikileghe Imulungu. <verse eid="LEV 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 8:13" />Kuya Musa kawaghala iwana wa Aruni hambele, kawapfatsa tsikanzu na kawoha misipi mpfuno mwawo, na kawapfatsa tsikofiya mwitwi mwawo ka IMNDEWA pfayamlaghitse.<verse eid="LEV 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 8:14" />Kuya Musa kamghala ng'ombe wa nambiko ya ukuwaleghusila nzambi, naye Aruni na wanaghe weka ghamoko ghawo mwitwi mwa ing'ombe ayo. <verse eid="LEV 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 8:15" />Musa kamtsubutula ing'ombe ayo, kasola idamu chidogho, na kwa chidole chake katsibakatsa tsimembe tsa Imatsabahu kwa idamu ayo, ili Imatsabahu yele. Kuya kasola idamu ikalile kaikutula hasi he matsabahu. <verse eid="LEV 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 8:16" />Kuya Musa kasola ghamapfuta ghose ighali mna usapi, hanu hanoghile ha likini na tsifigho tsose mbili na ghamapfuta ghake kapfilakatsa mchanya mwa Imatsabahu. <verse eid="LEV 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 8:17" />Lekeni inyama ya ing'ombe ayo, ingotsi yake na imipfi yake, kapfilakatsa kwa ghumoto kunze kutali na ndalo yawo, ka IMNDEWA pfayamlaghitse. <verse eid="LEV 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 8:18" />Kuya keli Musa kamghala ng'unzu iyalapfighwe yalakatsighwe. Aruni na iwanaghe weka ghamoko ghawo mwitwi mwa ing'unzu ayo. <verse eid="LEV 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 8:19" />Musa kamchinja na idamu ya ing'olo ayo kaimitsa mna chila ubali wa Matsabahu. <verse eid="LEV 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 8:20" />Kamghana ing'olo ayo mahundemahunde, kaghalakatsa hamwe na litwi lyake na ghamapfuta ghake. <verse eid="LEV 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 8:21" />Kuya kauhopfugha usapi na ghamaghulu ghake kwa ghamatsi, Musa kamlakatsa ing'olo ayo wose mna Imatsabahu. Imnyama yuno iyalapfighwe ka nambiko ya ukulakatsighwa mmoto, tsa chijo cha Imulungu, na ukunung'ila kwake komnoghela ghoya IMNDEWA. Musa katenda ka IMNDEWA pfayamlaghitse. <verse eid="LEV 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 8:22" />Kuya kamghala ng'unzu yungi mmale, ayo yawe ng'unzu wa ukuhimikighwa kwa Aruni na wanaghe wawe watambika. Nawo weka ghamoko ghawo mwitwi mwa ing'unzu ayo. <verse eid="LEV 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 8:23" />Musa kamchinja, kasola idamu ya ing'olo ayo kambakatsa Aruni mna membe ya lighutwi lyake lya kujilo, na mna chidole gumba cha ghumoko ghwake ghwa kujilo na kambakatsa hane ichidole gumba ichili mna mghulu ghwake ghwa kujilo. <verse eid="LEV 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 8:24" />Kuya kawaghala iwana wa Aruni hambele, naye Musa kawabakatsa idamu chidogho mna tsimembe tsa ghamaghutwi ghawo gha kujilo na mna pfidole gumba ipfili mna maghulu ghawo gha kujilo. Idamu ingi kaimitsa mna chila ubali wa Imatsabahu. <verse eid="LEV 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 8:25" />Kuya kasola ghamapfuta ghose, ghumkila hamwe na ghamapfuta ghake, ghamapfuta ighaghubike usapi, hanu hanoghile ha likini, hamwe na tsifigho tsose mbili, ghamapfuta ghake na hatsa lya mghulu ghwa kujilo ghwa kuchughu ghwe ing'unzu ayo. <verse eid="LEV 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 8:26" />Kuya hane chiseghe chila cha pfighate ipfilihela hamila iikighwe hambele ha IMNDEWA, kalapfa chighate chimwe ichilihela ihamila, na chighate chimwe china ghamapfuta gha nzeituni na kalapfa chighate chimwe chidodo, pfose kapfika mchanya mwa ghamapfuta gha imnyama yula, na mchanya mwa ghumghulu ghula. <verse eid="LEV 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 8:27" />Musa kapfika mna ghamoko gha Aruni na wanaghe, nawo wapfinula mchanya na wapfihighisa akuno na akuno kulangusa ka pfose apfo pfilapfighwa kwa IMNDEWA. <verse eid="LEV 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 8:28" />Kuya Musa kapfisola pfinu apfo pfose mna ghamoko ghawo na kapfilakatsa mna Matsabahu hamwe na ipfinu ipfilapfighwe pfilakatsighwe. Imnyama yuno iyalapfighwe mna ukusaghulighwa kwa Aruni na iwanaghe, komnung'ila ghoya IMNDEWA. <verse eid="LEV 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 8:29" />Kuya Musa kasola chidali chila kachinula mchanya na kachihighisa akuno na akuno, ka IMNDEWA pfayamlaghitse. Ichidali acho cha ing'unzu iyalapfighwe mna ukuhimikighwa kwa Aruni na wanaghe wawe watambika, acho chijo chake Musa. <verse eid="LEV 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 8:30" />Kuya Musa kasola ghamapfuta gha kubaka ghenzeluke na idamu kulawa mna Matsabahu kammitsila Aruni na iwanaghe na kaghamitsila maghwanda ghawo. Kwa ukutenda apfo, Musa kamhimika Aruni na iwanaghe wamtambikileghe IMNDEWA hamwe na ghamaghwanda ghawo. <verse eid="LEV 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 8:31" />Musa kamlongela Aruni na iwanaghe, “Muyambike inyama ila ya ng'olo wakeli habehi ha ghumlango ghwa Lihema lyenzeluke, muije baho hamwe na pfighate ipfili mna chiseghe cha nambiko ya ukuhimika. Mtende ka pfayanilaghitse IMNDEWA, inyama ayo itsakujighwa na Aruni na iwanaghe. <verse eid="LEV 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 8:32" />Ilakatse Inyama yoyose na chighate chochose ichikala. <verse eid="LEV 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 8:33" />Namwe mleke kulawa kunze kwa ghumlango ghwe luwa lwa Lihema lya ukwitinganila kwa matsuwa saba mbaka ghamatsuwa gha kuhimikighwa ghamale, kwaapfila mtsohimikighwa mna ghamatsuwa saba. <verse eid="LEV 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 8:34" />IMNDEWA katulaghitsa tutende achino chatutendile leloli, tutenda apfi ili Imulungu yawaleghisile nzambi tsenu. <verse eid="LEV 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 8:35" />Mtsokala hane ghumlango ghwa Lihema chilo na misi mna ghamatsuwa agho saba, aku mwosang'ana aghala ghayawalaghitse IMNDEWA. Ka ng'amtenda apfo, mtsakufa ghendo. Apfi pfipfo pfayanilaghitse IMNDEWA.” <verse eid="LEV 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 8:36" />Apfo Aruni na iwanaghe watenda chila chinu IMNDEWA chayamlaghitse Musa.<verse eid="LEV 8:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LEV 9" />
  <para style="s">Aruni kolapfa nambiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 9:1" />Halipfikile tsuwa lya nane lya ukutendighwa Aruni ne wanaghe wawe watambika, Musa kamkema Aruni na iwanaghe na iwabala wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="LEV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 9:2" />Kamlongela Aruni, “Usole mwana wa ng'ombe iyali mmale, ayo katsolapfighwa kwa Imulungu yaleghuse nzambi tsako, na usole ing'unzu, ayo katsolapfighwa yalakatsighwe, iwanyama wose wenelele. Kuya umlapfile IMNDEWA. <verse eid="LEV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 9:3" />Walongele Waisiraeli wasole mvulati yumwe, ayo yawe wa nambiko ya ukuleghusa tsinzambi tsawo, na mwana yumwe wa ng'ombe na mwana yumwe wa ng'olo, wose wawe na ghumwaka ghumwe na wenelele, awo wolapfighwa wawe nambiko ya ukulakatsighwa. <verse eid="LEV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 9:4" />Kuya usole ng'ombe mmale na ng'unzu, walapfighwe kwa IMNDEWA ili iwanu wakale tseghamba na yeye, wamlapfile hamwe na usaghe iuhanganyighwe na ghamapfuta. Mtende apfi kwaapfila leloli IMNDEWA katsowalawila.” <verse eid="LEV 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 9:5" />Waisiraeli wapfighala pfinu pfose apfo hambele ha Lihema lya ukwitinganila ka pfayalaghitse Musa, na Waisiraeli wose waghenda kwima hambele ha IMNDEWA. <verse eid="LEV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 9:6" />Musa kawalongela, “Achino chicho IMNDEWA chayamlaghitseni mchitende ili ukumwelukamweluka kwake kwoneke kuna mwemwe” <verse eid="LEV 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 9:7" />Kuya Musa kamlongela Aruni, “Ghenda kuna Imatsabahu, ukamlapfile IMNDEWA imwana wa ng'ombe ka nambiko ya ukuleghusa tsinzambi na ng'unzu iyolapfighwa ka nambiko ya ukulakatsighwa. Ung'atenda apfo, Imulungu katsokuleghusila nzambi tsako na nzambi tsa Waisiraeli wose. Utende ka IMNDEWA pfayakulaghitse.” <verse eid="LEV 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 9:8" />Apfo Aruni kaghenda kuna Imatsabahu, kamsubutula imwana ayo wa ing'ombe iyamlapfile ili Imulungu yamleghusile nzambi tsake tsayatendile imwenyegho. <verse eid="LEV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 9:9" />Iwanaghe wamghalila idamu yawaikingile, naye kapfabika chidole chake mna idamu ayo, katsibakatsa tsimembe itsili mna Matsabahu. Idamu ikalile kaimwagha hasi ha ghumlango ghwa Matsabahu. <verse eid="LEV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 9:10" />Lekeni tsifigho na mapfuta ghake na likini na mapfuta ghake kaghalakatsa mna Imatsabahu ka IMNDEWA pfayamlaghitse Musa. <verse eid="LEV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 9:11" />Kuya inyama ila na ngotsi yake kailakatsa kunze kutali na tsindalo tsawo. <verse eid="LEV 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 9:12" />Kuya Aruni kamsubutula ing'unzu wa nambiko ya ukulakatsighwa. Iwanaghe wamghalila idamu yawaikingile, naye kaimitsa mna Matsabahu chila ubali. <verse eid="LEV 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 9:13" />Kuya wanaghe wamghalila inyama ya ing'olo ayo ighanighwe mahundemahunde, na litwi lyake, naye kaghalakatsa mna Imatsabahu. <verse eid="LEV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 9:14" />Kauhofugha usapi, maghondi keka mna Matsabahu, mahunde aghala gha ing'olo, kuya kaghalakatsa.<verse eid="LEV 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 9:15" />Kuya Aruni kawaghala iwanyama iwalapfighwe na iwanu. Kamsola na kamsubutula imene ayula iyalapfighwe na wanu ili Imulungu yawaleghusile nzambi tsawo. Kamlapfila Imulungu ka pfayatendile kwa ayula iyalongole. <verse eid="LEV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 9:16" />Kuya kamghala imnyama iyalapfighwe yalakatsighwe, kamsubutula na kamlakatsa ka Imulungu pfayamlaghitse. <verse eid="LEV 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 9:17" />Pfipfila kaghala nambiko ya usaghe, kadegha ghawo limwe lya usaghe na kuulakatsa mchanya mwa Matsabahu hamwe na imnyama ayula iyochinjighwa na kulakatsighwa chila hamitondo. <verse eid="LEV 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 9:18" />Kuya Aruni kamsubutula ing'ombe mmale na ing'unzu iwalapfighwe na Waisiraeli ili wakale tseghamba na Imulungu. Iwanaghe wamghalila idamu yawaikingile, kaimitsa mna Matsabahu chila ubali. <verse eid="LEV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 9:19" />Lekeni kasola ghamapfuta gha ing'ombe na ghe ng'unzu, mapfuta gha mkila na aghala ighaghubike usapi na aghala ighali mna tsifigho na likini, <verse eid="LEV 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 9:20" />na kagheka ghamapfuta agho mchanya mwe pfidali pfe iwanyama wano, naye kaghalakatsa ghamapfuta mna Matsabahu, <verse eid="LEV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 9:21" />lekeni ipfidali pfila, na lihatsa lya mghulu ghwa kujilo, Aruni kapfinula hambele ha IMNDEWA ka Musa pfayalaghitse, Katenda apfo kulangusa ghendo ka iwanyama wose wa kwake yeye Imulungu. <verse eid="LEV 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 9:22" />Aruni hayamalitse kumsubutula imnyama wa kuleghusa nzambi, na ayula iyolapfighwa ili iwanu wakale tseghamba na Imulungu, na hayamalitse kumsubutula ayula iyolapfighwa yalakatsighwe, kenula ghamoko ghake kawabaliki, kuya kahulumka. <verse eid="LEV 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 9:23" />Musa na Aruni wengila mghati mwa Lihema lya ukwitinganila, hambele kuya walawa kunze, wawabaliki iwanu, na baho ghumng'alo ghwa IMNDEWA ghwoneka kwe iwanu wose. <verse eid="LEV 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 9:24" />Ghumoto ghulawile kwa IMNDEWA ghulawila na kulakatsa ipfinu pfose na ghamapfuta ghose ighali mna matsabahu. Iwanu wose hawonile ghumoto aghwo, wadeng'elela na watowa lukenze na wenama mbaka pfihanga pfawo pfidonza hasi.<verse eid="LEV 9:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LEV 10" />
  <para style="s">Ukufa kwa Nadabu na Abihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 10:1" />Nadabu na Abihu, wanaghe Aruni tsawasola chinu cha ukuhalila ghumoto ichikemighwa chetetso, chila munu kasola chake, weka ghumoto na mumo wadusula upfumba, wamlapfila IMNDEWA ghumoto ighughomighwe, na Imulungu ng'awalaghitse waghudusule apfo baye. <verse eid="LEV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 10:2" />Bahala IMNDEWA kahulumsa ghumoto, ghuwalakatsa iwasongolo awo, nawo wafa baho hambele ha IMNDEWA. <verse eid="LEV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 10:3" />Kuya Musa kamlongela Aruni, “Kwa chinu achino ichilawile IMNDEWA kakulangusa ghendo yang'ali yolonga choni ahala hayalongile, ‘Nitselangusa ka nene na Mwenzeluka kwa awala iwali habehi na nene, na nitsotunyighwa hambele ha iwanu wose.’ ” Aruni kenyamala tulu.<verse eid="LEV 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 10:4" />Apfo Musa kawakema Mishaeli na Elisafani wanaghe Uzieli, aba wake mdodo Aruni, kawalongela waghende kusola mauti gha ndughu tsawo iwafile hane kaye yenzeluke, waighale kunze, kutali ne ndalo yawo. <verse eid="LEV 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 10:5" />Apfo watsa wasola mauti gha ndughu tsawo, waighala kunze, kutali na indalo yawo aku wapfala maghwanda ghawo ka Musa pfayalaghitse. <verse eid="LEV 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 10:6" />Kuya Musa kamlongela Aruni na iwanaghe Eriatsari na Isamari, “Mleke kuwalilila kwa kutsitimula tsimvili tsenu na kughadegha maghwanda ghenu, mng'atenda apfo, mtsakufa na IMNDEWA katsowaghudubukila iwanu wose. Lekeni ndughu tsenu, Iwaisiraeli wose, wodaha kuwalilila awo, iwakomighwe ne ghumoto ighulawile kwe IMNDEWA. <verse eid="LEV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 10:7" />Mleke kulawa kunze mwa Lihema lya ukwitinganila, hela mtsakufa kwaapfila ghamapfuta ghayawaghelile IMNDEWA hamuhimikighwe muwe watambika ghang'ali mchanya mwenu.” Aruni na iwanaghe tsawatenda ka Musa pfayalongile. <verse eid="LEV 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 10:8" />IMNDEWA tsakalonga na Aruni, <verse eid="LEV 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 10:9" />“Hamkwingila mng'anda mwe Lihema lya ukwitinganila, ghweghwe na iwanagho mleke ukunwa dipfai wala imbwali, mng'atenda apfo, mtsakufa. Ghweghwe mwenyegho ulikinde laghitso lino na watsukulu wako wose mna ghamatsuwa ghose ighakutsa. <verse eid="LEV 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 10:10" />Mwobamighwa mghatange aghala ighenzeluke na aghala ighali si ghenzeluka baye, ichihile na ichinoghie hambele he Imulungu, <verse eid="LEV 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 10:11" />namwe muwalangulitse Waisiraeli malaghitso ghose ghaniwalongele kubitila Musa.” <verse eid="LEV 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 10:12" />Musa kamlongela Aruni ne iwanaghe weli iwakalile, Eliasari na Isamari, “Msole usaghe we ingano iukalile kulawa mna ipfijo ipfilapfighwa kwe IMNDEWA pfilakatsighwe, muije habehi na Matsabahu. Usaghe awo uleke kuwa na ihamila kwaapfila awo wenzeluka ghendo. <verse eid="LEV 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 10:13" />Mtsoija hanu haenzeluke kwaapfila acho chijo chako ghweghwe na iwanagho ichilawa mna ipfijo ipfilapfighwa kwe IMNDEWA pfilakatsighwe. Apfo pfipfo Imulungu pfayandaghitse. <verse eid="LEV 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 10:14" />Lekeni chidali na lihatsa ipfinulighwe mchanya hambele ha Imulungu, ghweghwe ne iwanagho iwamale na iwapinga mwodaha kupfija hanu hohose helile hatogholighwe ne Imulungu. Kwaapfila chidali na lihatsa kwikighwa ghweghwe ne wanagho pfiwe chijo chenu kulawa mna iwanyama iwolapfighwa na Waisiraeli ili wakale tseghamba ne Imulungu. <verse eid="LEV 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 10:15" />Lihatsa na chidali ipfinulighwe hambele he Imulungu, mwobamighwa mpfighale hamwe na ghamapfuta igholakatsighwa mmoto, mtsakwinula mchanya kulangusa ka pfose pfilapfighwa kwe Imulungu. Apfo pfose pfitsakuwa chijo chako, ghweghwe ne iwanagho, mna ghamatsuwa ghose ighakutsa ka IMNDEWA pfayalaghitse.”<verse eid="LEV 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 10:16" />Kuya Musa kaghutsa kwayali mene iyalapfighwe na Waisiraeli ili Imulungu yawaleghusile nzambi tsawo. Na hayatangile ka imene ayo ma kalakatsighwa, kawonela maya Eliasari na Isamari, iwana wa Aruni iwakalile, kawaghutsa, <verse eid="LEV 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 10:17" />“Hebali ng'amumjile baye imene ayo hanu haenzeluke? Kwaapfila ayo kenzeluka ghendo, na Imulungu kamwing'ani mwemwe ili kuleghusa matotso ghe iwanu wose wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="LEV 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 10:18" />Kwaapfila idamu yake ng'aighalighwe baye mghati mwa hanu haenzeluke, mwemwe tsambamighwa muije inyama mghati mwa hanu haenzeluke ka pfanilaghitse.” <verse eid="LEV 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 10:19" />Aruni kamwidika, “Ulole, leloli wanangu walapfa imnyama wa kuleghusa nzambi tse iwanu na walapfa imnyama wa kulakatsighwa hambele he IMNDEWA, lekeni aghano ghandawila nene, wanangu wakomighwa! Angu lelo Imulungu yang'atoghole ka ning'ajile imnyama wa kuleghusa nzambi tse iwanu iyalapfighwe leloli?” <verse eid="LEV 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 10:20" />Naye Musa hayaghahulike agho, tsakatogholela.<verse eid="LEV 10:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LEV 11" />
  <para style="s">Wanyama wa ukujighwa na ing'awakujighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 11:1" />IMNDEWA kawalongela Musa na Aruni, <verse eid="LEV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 11:2" />“Walongele Waisiraeli apfino, mna wanyama wose iwokala muisi, mwodaha kuwaja iwanyama awano. <verse eid="LEV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 11:3" />Mwodaha kumja mnyama wowose yana tsikwato itsigholile mala mbili na iyoselula. <verse eid="LEV 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 11:4" />Lekeni mleke ukuja imnyama iyoselula lekeni tsikwato tsake ng'atsigholile baye au tsikwato tsake tsighola lekeni ng'oselula baye. Mleke kumja ing'amiya, ayo ng'oselula baye lekeni ng'wato tsake ng'atsigholile baye. Ayo mwemwe kumja mwiko. <verse eid="LEV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 11:5" />Mleke kumja imimbi, kwaapfila koselula lekeni tsikwato tsake ng'atsigholeke baye, mwemwe mwiko kumja. <verse eid="LEV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 11:6" />Mleke kumja isungula, ayo yeye koselula lekeni kahela kwato itsigholile, mwiko mwemwe kumja. <verse eid="LEV 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 11:7" />Mleke kumja ingubi, ayo kana kwato itsigholile lekeni ng'oselula baye, ayo mwiko mwemwe kumja. <verse eid="LEV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 11:8" />Kwaapfila iwanyama awo weha, mleke kuja inyama yawo wala kuidonza mitsogha yawo. <verse eid="LEV 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 11:9" />Pfilumbe wose iwokala mwibahali na iwokala mna imito, mwodaha kuwaja awala wane mapetsi na maghamba. <verse eid="LEV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 11:10" />Lekeni chilumbe chochose ichikala mwibahali na ichikala mna ghumto ichilihela mapetsi wala maghamba, acho mleke kuchija. <verse eid="LEV 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 11:11" />Mwiko mwemwe kuja pfilumbe apfo. Mleke kutsija nyama tsawo, wala kuidonza mitsogha yawo kwaapfila yodesa ghendo. <verse eid="LEV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 11:12" />Chinu chochose ichikala mna ghamatsi ichilihela mapetsi au maghamba, acho chiha kuna mwemwe.”<verse eid="LEV 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 11:13" />“Pfideghe wano wose weha kuna mwemwe, apfo mleke kuwaja maghengele, furukombe, chipungu, <verse eid="LEV 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 11:14" />chimanga, kosi wose, <verse eid="LEV 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 11:15" />bondwa wose, <verse eid="LEV 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 11:16" />imbuni, chighuluka nzila, dudumitsi, pfitema wose, <verse eid="LEV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 11:17" />chimulu, mnandi, chimulu mkulu, <verse eid="LEV 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 11:18" />mumbi, mwari, mderi, <verse eid="LEV 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 11:19" />korongo, koikoi wose, hudihudi, na popo. <verse eid="LEV 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 11:20" />Iwang'onyo wose wane ghamabawa na iwoghenda kwa ghamaghulu mane, awo wose weha kuna mwemwe. <verse eid="LEV 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 11:21" />Lekeni pfilumbe wane ghamabawa na iwane ghamaghulu iwoghendela ghamaghulu matali kwa kudalukila muisi, mwodaha kuwaja. <verse eid="LEV 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 11:22" />Mwodaha ukuja iwanzighe wose, senene wose, pfidanukila wose, na mbulumundu wose. <verse eid="LEV 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 11:23" />Lekeni iwang'onyo wose iwane ghamabawa na ghamaghulu mane, awo muwehile ghendo.”<verse eid="LEV 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 11:24" />“Imunu wowose iyokinda mitsogha yawo katsakuwa keha mbaka nemihe. <verse eid="LEV 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 11:25" />Imunu yang'aiduta mitsogha ya pfilumbe awano, katsakuwa keha mbaka nemihe, na yatsapfe maghwanda ghake. <verse eid="LEV 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 11:26" />Imunu wowose yang'amkinda imnyama yane tsikwato itsigholile lekeni ng'oselula baye, imunu ayo katsakuwa keha. <verse eid="LEV 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 11:27" />Iwanyama wose iwoghendela pfighanza pfawo hata ka wana maghulu mane, awo muwehile ghendo, na imunu wowose iyokinda ghumtsogha ghwa imnyama ka ayo kakuwa keha mbaka nemihe. <verse eid="LEV 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 11:28" />Imunu wowose iyoduta mitsogha yawo katsakuwa keha mbaka nemihe, naye yatsapfe maghwanda ghake. Iwanyama wano muwehile ghendo.”<verse eid="LEV 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 11:29" />“Pfilumbe apfino napfo pfiha kuna mwemwe, chikwili na mbewa na tukwa wose na <verse eid="LEV 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 11:30" />bulubulu, ng'enge, ghulughuja, ghong'ole na kangawingo. <verse eid="LEV 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 11:31" />Awo wose muwehile ghendo, na imunu wowose iyatsoikinda mitsogha yawo, kakuwa keha mbaka nemihe. <verse eid="LEV 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 11:32" />Ka ghumtsogha ghwa pfilumbe awo ghung'alaghalila chinu chochose chila, chiwe cha mibani au chiwe cha ghwanda au cha ngotsi au cha ghunila au chiwe cha chinu chochose chila ichitendighwe chisang'ane mna ing'onde yoyose ila, ichinu acho chakuwa chiha mbaka nemihe, lekeni ching'aghelighwe mna ghamatsi, chonogha keli. <verse eid="LEV 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 11:33" />Ka ghumtsogha ghwake ghulaghalila mna chiya, chochose ichili mghati mwa chiya acho chakuwa chiha na ichiya acho chitulighwe. <verse eid="LEV 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 11:34" />Ka ghamatsi ighali mna ichiya acho ghang'alaghalila mna ichijo, nacho ichijo chakuwa chiha. Na chokunwa chochose ichili mna ichiya acho nacho chakuwa chiha. <verse eid="LEV 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 11:35" />Ka pfitomo pfa mitsogha ayo pfilaghalila mna chinu chochose chila, ichinu acho chakuwa chiha. Chiwe tanuli au chiwe chikong'o, chobamighwa chitulighwe. Apfo pfitsakuwa pfiha, napfo kuna mwemwe pfiha ghendo. <verse eid="LEV 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 11:36" />Lekeni chisima au mbwibwi ya ghamatsi pfakuwa pfinogha. Lekeni chochose ichikinda imitsogha ayo chakuwa chiha. <verse eid="LEV 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 11:37" />Mitsogha ing'alaghalila mna tsimbeghu tsa ukuhanda, tsimbeghu atso ng'atsikuwa tsiha baye. <verse eid="LEV 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 11:38" />Lekeni ka tsimbeghu tsilowekighwa ili tsote, na chitomo cha mtsogha ching'alaghalila mumo, tsimbeghu atso tsiha ghendo kuna mwemwe.”<verse eid="LEV 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 11:39" />“Mnyama wowose wamlongelighwe mwodaha kumja yang'afa imwenyegho, imunu wowose iyokinda mtsogha ghwake, kakuwa keha mbaka nemihe. <verse eid="LEV 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 11:40" />Imunu wowose yang'aja nyama ya mitsogha ayo, kakuwa keha mbaka nemihe, ayo yatsapfe maghwanda ghake. Na wowose yatsoduta mtsogha agho, katsotsapfa maghwanda ghake, kakuwa keha mbaka nemihe.”<verse eid="LEV 11:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 11:41" />“Chilumbe chochose ichitambala muisi kuna mwemwe chiha, mleke kuchija. <verse eid="LEV 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 11:42" />Chochose achila ichitambalila ilida, au ichighendela maghulu mane au ichighenda kwa maghulu mengi, acho mleke kuchija, mwiko kuna mwemwe. <verse eid="LEV 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 11:43" />Mleke kwitenda mwiha kwa ukuja chochose achila kulawa mna pfilumbe apfino. <verse eid="LEV 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 11:44" />Kwaapfila nene IMNDEWA yuyo Imulungu wenu, muwe wahenzeluka kwaapfila nene na muhenzeluka. <verse eid="LEV 11:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 11:45" />Nene yuyo IMNDEWA yaniwalapfile Misiri ili niwe Imulungu wenu, apfo muhenzeluke kwaapfila nene na muhenzeluka.” <verse eid="LEV 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 11:46" />Aghano ghagho malaghitso gha iwanyama na iwapfideghe na pfilumbe pfose pfine ughima ipfikala mna ghamatsi na muisi, <verse eid="LEV 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 11:47" />ghamwing'ighwe ili mdahe kubaghula yuwi iyanoghile na yuwi iyehile, na mdahe kumanya chilumbe chachi chodaha kujighwa na chilumbe chachi ng'achikujighwa baye.<verse eid="LEV 11:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LEV 12" />
  <para style="s">Ukuwatenda iwapinga wele ahala hawolawa mna ukweleka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 12:1" />IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, <verse eid="LEV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 12:2" />“Walongele Waisiraeli apfino, ipinga yang'akinda inda, na kweleke mwana mmale, ayo kakuwa keha kwa ghamatsuwa saba ka apfila pfayakuwa keha mna ghamatsuwa ghake gha ukwingila kumto. <verse eid="LEV 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 12:3" />Mna tsuwa lya nane imwana ayo yengile ngoma. <verse eid="LEV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 12:4" />Kuya ipinga ayo katsoghendelela kuwa keha mbaka haghomala ghamatsuwa selasini na madatu. Mna ghamatsuwa agho yaleke kukinda chinu chochose ichilapfighwe kwe Imulungu wala yaleke kwingila hanu haenzeluke mbaka ghamatsuwa gha ukutendighwa yele keli ghapfike. <verse eid="LEV 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 12:5" />Lekeni ka keleka imwana pinga, ipinga ayo kakuwa keha kwa majuma meli ka apfila pfayakuwa keha mna ghamatsuwa ghake gha ukwingila kumto. Katsokala matsuwa sitini na sita aku kotendighwa yele keli.”<verse eid="LEV 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 12:6" />“Ghamatsuwa ghake gha ukutendighwa yele keli haghomala, ghawe gha ukweleka imwana mmale au ghe imwana pinga, yamghalile imtambika imwana we ing'olo yane ghumwaka ghumwe hana ghumlango ghwa Lihema lya ukwitinganila, iyatsolapfighwa yalakatsighwe na yamghalile injiwa au tetele, awo watsolapfighwa kwe IMNDEWA waleghuse tsinzambi tsake. <verse eid="LEV 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 12:7" />Kuya mtambika katsowalapfa kwe Imulungu, naye Imulungu komleghusila nzambi tsake tsayatendile. Apfo ipinga ayo kakuwa kela keli kulawa mna ukwingila kwake kumto. Apfi pfipfo pfaitsakuwa ipinga wowose yang'eleka imwana mmale au ipinga.”<verse eid="LEV 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 12:8" />“Ka ipinga ayo kahela imwana we ing'olo, yaghale tetele wabili au njiwa weli, yumwe katsolapfighwa yalakatsighwe na yungi katsolapfighwa yawe wa kuleghusa nzambi tsake. Mtambika katsomtenda ipinga ayo tsinzambi tsake tsileghusighwe. Na baho katsakwela keli.”<verse eid="LEV 12:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LEV 13" />
  <para style="s">Ghamalaghitso gha utamu wa ngotsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 13:1" />IMNDEWA kawalongela Musa na Aruni, <verse eid="LEV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 13:2" />“Munu wowose yang'apfimba au yang'awa na pfibuhu au ng'opfu ing'alawa mlukuli mwake, napfo pfing'oneka ka ukoma, imunu ayo yaghalighwe kwa mtambika Aruni au yaghalighwe kwa mwanaghe yumwe iyali mtambika. <verse eid="LEV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 13:3" />Mtambika katsohalola hanu hana utamu na ka mvili itsili ihanu aho tsighaluka tsiwa nzelu na utamu wenyegho ung'oneka uhimbika mna lukuli lwake, apfo mmanye awo ukoma. Mtambika yang'amalitsa kumlola, yawalongele iwanu ka imunu ayo keha. <verse eid="LEV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 13:4" />Ka ichibuhu acho chiwa chitselu, lekeni ng'achihimbike baye mlukuli wala tsimvili tsa ihanu aho ng'atsighaluke baye tsiwe nzelu, mtambika katsombaghula imunu ayo yakale kutali ne iwanu kwa ghamatsuwa saba. <verse eid="LEV 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 13:5" />Mtambika katsomkaghula keli imunu ayo mna litsuwa lya saba, na ka chibuhu cha pfipfila na kakona ng'achenele baye mna ingotsi yake, mtambika katsombaghula keli imunu ayo yakale kutali ne iwanu kwa ghamatsuwa saba ghangi. <verse eid="LEV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 13:6" />Mtambika yamlole keli imunu ayo mna litsuwa lya saba, ka hanu hane utamu hahona na utamu ng'awenele baye, mtambika katsowalongela iwanu ka imunu ayo kela, apfo tsa pfibuhu pfiliheka na si ukoma baye. Imunu ayo yatsapfe maghwanda ghake, naye kakuwa kela. <verse eid="LEV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 13:7" />Lekeni ka ipfibuhu apfo pfenela keli mna ngotsi kulawa hala mtambika hayamlolile na kulawa ahala hayawalongele iwanu kela, imunu ayo yamghendele keli mtambika. <verse eid="LEV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 13:8" />Mtambika katsomlola keli, na ka pfibuhu pfila pfenela mna ngotsi, mtambika yawalongele iwanu ka imunu ayo keha, awo lelo ukoma ghendo.”<verse eid="LEV 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 13:9" />“Imunu yang'awa na ukoma, yaghalighwe kwa mtambika. <verse eid="LEV 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 13:10" />Mtambika yamlole, na ka kakona upfimbe mtselu mna ingotsi yake, na tsimvili itsili ihanu aho tsiwa nzelu na upfimbe awo ughaluka uwa chilonda, <verse eid="LEV 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 13:11" />awo ukoma ukalile matsuwa mengi. Mtambika katsowalongela iwanu ka imunu ayo keha. Yaleke kumbaghula, kwaapfila yeye ma keha.”<verse eid="LEV 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 13:12" />“Ka ukoma umwenela mna lukuli lwake lwose, kulawa mwitwi mbaka mmaghulu ka apfila pfayakona mtambika, <verse eid="LEV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 13:13" />mtambika katsomlola keli. Yang'amwona ka ukoma umwenela mlukuli mwose, katsowalongela iwanu ka imunu ayo kela kwaapfila lukuli lwose lughaluka luwa lutselu, apfo imunu ayo kela. <verse eid="LEV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 13:14" />Lekeni ching'oneka chilonda chibisi mna lukuli lwe imunu ayo, imunu ayo kakuwa keha. <verse eid="LEV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 13:15" />Baho mtambika hayochona chilonda acho chibisi, yawalongele iwanu ka imunu ayo keha kwaapfila awo wenawo ukoma. <verse eid="LEV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 13:16" />Lekeni ichilonda acho ching'aghaluka keli chiwe chitselu, imunu ayo yamghendele mtambika. <verse eid="LEV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 13:17" />Naye katsomlola na yang'ona ichilonda chighaluka chiwa chitselu, katsowalongela iwanu ka imunu ayo kela.”<verse eid="LEV 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 13:18" />“Imunu yang'awa na pute mna ingotsi yake, nalyo lihona, <verse eid="LEV 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 13:19" />lekeni hanu hala halikalile lipute alyo halawila upfimbe mtselu au hawa hadung'u na hawa hatselu chidogho, yaghende yakamlanguse mtambika. <verse eid="LEV 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 13:20" />Mtambika katsohalola hanu aho, yang'ona haimbika na mvili itsili hanu aho tsiwa nzelu, mtambika katsowalongela iwanu ka imunu ayo keha, awo ukoma iulawile mna lipute. <verse eid="LEV 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 13:21" />Lekeni mtambika yang'ahalola ihanu aho na kwona haduhu mvili nzelu, wala ng'ahaimbike baye, ila hafinala, katsombaghula imunu ayo kwa ghamatsuwa saba. <verse eid="LEV 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 13:22" />Utamu awo ung'enela mna ingotsi, mtambika katsowalongela iwanu ka imunu ayo keha, kana utamu. <verse eid="LEV 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 13:23" />Lekeni ka hanu halili lipute hapfipfila na ng'ahongetseke baye mna ng'otsi, ila ili baho ng'opfu iliyeka ya lipute. Mtambika katsowalongela iwanu ka imunu ayo kela.”<verse eid="LEV 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 13:24" />“Imunu yang'alakala, na ingotsi ya hanu halakale yang'awa hadung'u au hatselu, au yang'awa hatselu ghendo, <verse eid="LEV 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 13:25" />mtambika katsohalola ihanu aho, yang'ona tsimvili tsiwa nzelu na haimbika, apfo awo ukoma. Ukoma awo ulawila kubitila ihanu aho halakale. Mtambika katsowalongela iwanu ka imunu ayo keha kwaapfila kana ukoma. <verse eid="LEV 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 13:26" />Lekeni mtambika yang'ona tsimvili tsa ihanu aho si nzelu baye, na ng'ahaimbike baye ila hafinala, mtambika katsombaghula imunu ayo kwa ghamatsuwa saba. <verse eid="LEV 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 13:27" />Mna litsuwa lya saba mtambika yamlole, na yang'ona ka utamu wenela mna ngotsi, mtambika yawalongele iwanu ka imunu ayo keha, kwaapfila kana ukoma. <verse eid="LEV 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 13:28" />Lekeni ka chilonda acho ng'achenele baye, ila chifinala, na uli baho upfimbe uliyeka iulawile mna ukulakala kwake, mtambika yawalongele iwanu ka imunu ayo kela, kwaapfila iyali nayo ng'opfu ya ukulakala.”<verse eid="LEV 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 13:29" />“Munu wowose, yawe mmale au pinga ka kana chilonda mwitwi mwake au hana ichidepfu chake, <verse eid="LEV 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 13:30" />mtambika yachilole ichilonda acho, na yang'ona chihimbika na tsimvili itsili baho tsiwa tsanjano na tsinyolodoka, mtambika yawalongele iwanu ka imunu ayo keha, kwaapfila apfo pfibuhu na awo ukoma iuli mwitwi na iuli mchidepfu. <verse eid="LEV 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 13:31" />Mtambika yang'ona ng'achihimbike baye na tsimvili itsili baho si nitu baye, katsombaghula imunu ayo kwa ghamatsuwa saba. <verse eid="LEV 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 13:32" />Litsuwa lya saba mtambika yachilole ichilonda acho. Ka ng'achongetseke baye na kuduhu mvili tsanjano wala kuduhu pfibuhu pfopfose ihanu aho, <verse eid="LEV 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 13:33" />imunu ayo yatsighete tsimvili tsake au ndepfu tsake, lekeni hane pfibuhu yaleke kutsigheta. Kuya mtambika katsombaghula imunu ayo kwa ghamatsuwa ghangi saba. <verse eid="LEV 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 13:34" />Mna litsuwa lya saba, mtambika yapfilole keli ipfibuhu apfo, yang'ona ka ng'apfenele baye mna ingotsi, na ng'apfihimbile baye mna ngotsi, mtambika yawalongele iwanu ka imunu ayo kela. Imunu ayo yatsapfe maghwanda ghake na baho kakuwa kela. <verse eid="LEV 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 13:35" />Lekeni ka ipfibuhu apfo pfenela kulawa ahala mtambika hayamlongele kela, <verse eid="LEV 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 13:36" />Mtambika yamlole imunu ayo yang'ona ka pfenela mna ngotsi, mtambika ng'obamighwa kulola tsimvili ka tsiwa tsanjano kwaapfila yoneka ghendo ka imunua yo keha. <verse eid="LEV 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 13:37" />Lekeni mtambika yang'ona ipfibuhu apfo pfihona na tsimvili tsinitu tsota hanu aho, ipfilonda apfo pfihona, na imunu ayo kela. Mtambika yawalongele iwanu ka imunu ayo kela. <verse eid="LEV 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 13:38" />Munu wowose, yawe mmale au pinga ka kana ng'opfu nzelu mlukuli mwake, <verse eid="LEV 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 13:39" />mtambika yamlole imunu ayo. Mtambika yang'ona ka tsing'opfu atso tsiwa nzelu chidogho, na pfili baho pfibuhu pfiliyeka, yamlongele ka kela.”<verse eid="LEV 13:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 13:40" />“Munu yang'awa na uhalatsa, ayo kela, kwaapfila yali nawo uhalatsa uliyeka. <verse eid="LEV 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 13:41" />Ka uhalatsa awo wanzila kuchisogho mbaka hane uhanga, imunu ayo kela kwaapfila yali nawo uhalatsa uliyeka. <verse eid="LEV 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 13:42" />Lekeni ka kana chilonda chidung'u au chitselu hane uhalatsa wake, awo ukoma ulawila hane uhalatsa wake. <verse eid="LEV 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 13:43" />Mtambika yamlole na ka kwona chilonda chidung'u au chitselu chipfimba hane uhalatsa wake au hane uhanga wake, nacho chakwoneka ka ukoma.”<verse eid="LEV 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 13:44" />Mtambika katsowalongela iwanu ka imunu ayo keha, kwa ukoma iuli mwitwi mwake. <verse eid="LEV 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 13:45" />“Imunu wowose yane ukoma katsopfala maghwanda ighadegheke, na tsimvili tsake yaleke kutsichana, kuya yaghubike mlomo wake na yadamilile yalonge, ‘Nene nyiha, nene nyiha!’ <verse eid="LEV 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 13:46" />Imunu ayo katsoghendelela kuwa keha kwa ghamatsuwa ghose gha utamu awo. Yeye keha, naye katsokala yaliyeka kunze kutali ne tsindalo tsawo.”<verse eid="LEV 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaghitso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 13:47" />“Ka maghwanda ghe munu yane ukoma ghananahila mna ligwanda, liwe ghwanda lya nyutsi, au ghwanda tselu, <verse eid="LEV 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LEV 13:48" />au ghwanda lyolyose lila, liwe lifumighwa au lifoghosighwa kwa chitambala chitselu au kwa nyutsi au ghwanda lye ingotsi yoyose lila, <verse eid="LEV 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 13:49" />ka upfundo awo unanahile mna lighwanda alyo uwa wa chijani au mdung'u, apfo ghwanda alyo lipfunda, nalyo lighalighwe kwa mtambika yakalilole. <verse eid="LEV 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 13:50" />Mtambika katsolola upfundoa awo naye kolika hambalimbali lighwanda alyo kwa ghamatsuwa saba. <verse eid="LEV 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LEV 13:51" />Litsuwa lya saba mtambika katsolola upfundo awo. Ka upfundo awo wenela mna lighwanda alyo, liwe lifumighwa au lifoghosighwa au ghwanda lya ngotsi yoyose ila, ghwanda alyo lina upfundo. <verse eid="LEV 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LEV 13:52" />Mtambika katsolilakatsa lighwanda alyo kwapfila lina upfundo iukwenela.”<verse eid="LEV 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 13:53" />“Mtambika yang'ona upfundo awo ng'awenele baye mna lighwanda, <verse eid="LEV 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 13:54" />yamlaghitse imunu yane lighwanda alyo yalitsapfe na yalyike hambalimbali kwa ghamatsuwa saba. <verse eid="LEV 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 13:55" />Lighwanda alyo ling'atsapfighwa, Mtambika baho yalilole, na ka kakwona hanu hana upfundo ng'ahelile baye, yalilakatse lighwanda alyo kwaapfila liha hata ka upfundo wake ng'awenele baye, na hata ka hanu hane upfundo ha kuchughu au hambele. <verse eid="LEV 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LEV 13:56" />Lekeni ka mtambika kohakaghula keli na kakwona hanu hana upfundo hela, yahadeghe ihanu aho hane upfundo. <verse eid="LEV 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LEV 13:57" />Lekeni ka upfundo wolawila keli mna lighwanda ilifumighwe au ilifoghosighwe au mna ligwanda lye ngotsi, lighwanda alyo lilakatsighwe. <verse eid="LEV 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LEV 13:58" />Lekeni ka upfundo ulawila ahala lighwanda halitsapfighwe, lighwanda alyo litsapfighwe keli ili lyele.” <verse eid="LEV 13:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LEV 13:59" />Aghano ghagho malaghitso ghe upfundo iulawila mna lighwanda lya nyutsi au maghwanda matselu au ilifumighwe au ilifoghosighwe au lya ngotsi. Kwa kuwinza ghamalaghitso ghano mtsodaha kumanya lighwanda ilelile na lighwanda ilihile.<verse eid="LEV 13:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LEV 14" />
  <para style="s">Ukumtenda munu yane ukoma yele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 14:1" />IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, <verse eid="LEV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 14:2" />“Aghano ghagho ghamalaghitso ighomlongotsa imunu iyahonile ukoma mna litsuwa lya ukutendighwa yele, imunu ayo yaghalighwe kwa mtambika, <verse eid="LEV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 14:3" />naye imtambika yamghale kunze, kutali na tsindalo tsawo, kuko yamlole ka ukoma iyali nawo uhona, <verse eid="LEV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 14:4" />mtambika katsolaghitsa waghalighwe wapfideghe weli waghima iwanoghile na chibanzi cha mbiki ghwa mweretsi, na nyutsi ndung'u na putila lya hisopo kwa imunu ayo iyotendighwa yele keli. <verse eid="LEV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 14:5" />Mtambika katsolaghitsa wamchinje chideghe yumwe mna chiha ichimemile ghamatsi ghanoghile gha mbwibwi. <verse eid="LEV 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 14:6" />Mtambika katsomsola ichideghe ayula iyali mghima, na ichibanzi achila cha ghumbiki ghwa mweretsi, na nyutsi aila ndung'u na putila lya hisopo na pfose apfo yapfipfabike mna idamu ya ichideghe ayula iyachinjighwe. <verse eid="LEV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 14:7" />Kuya yammitsile idamu mala saba imunu ayo iyotendighwa yele, baho mtambika yawalongele iwanu ka imunu ayo kela. Kuya katsomlekelela ichideghe ayula iyali mghima yaghuluke mlanga. <verse eid="LEV 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 14:8" />Imunu ayo yatsapfe maghwanda ghake na yatsighete tsimvili tsake kuya yoghe, naye baho kakuwa kela. Yang'atenda agho, katsokala na wayaghe mna ndalo yawo, lekeni tanu katsokala kunze mwa chibumbulika chake kwa ghamatsuwa saba. <verse eid="LEV 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 14:9" />Mna tsuwa lya saba yaghete tsimvili tsake tsose, na tsindepfu tsake tsose na mikiti na mvili tsose itsili mlukuli mwake. Kuya yatsapfe maghwanda ghake kuya yoghe, naye baho kakuwa kela. <verse eid="LEV 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 14:10" />Mna tsuwa lya nane yaghale wana wamale weli we ng'olo, iwenelele, na yaghale ing'olo mbughuma yane ghumwaka ghumwe, na yaghale makimbo madatu gha utimbo utighinike ghendo na una ghamapfuta, utimbo awo uwe wa kumlapfila Imulungu na ghamapfuta koloboi saba. <verse eid="LEV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 14:11" />Mtambika iyomtenda imunu ayo yele yamghale hambele he IMNDEWA habehi na ghumlango ghwa Lihema lya ukwitinganila hamwe nea ipfinu pfayaghalile. <verse eid="LEV 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 14:12" />Mtambika yasole imwana yumwe we ing'olo na ghamapfuta aghala koloboi saba, yamlapfile IMNDEWA ili naye yamleghusile inzambi yake. Yapfinule mchanya kulangusa ghendo ka pfilapfighwa kwe IMNDEWA. <verse eid="LEV 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 14:13" />Kuya yamchinje ing'olo ayo hanu haenzeluke, ahala hawochinjila iwanyama iwolapfighwa ne iwanu ili nzambi tsawo tsileghusighwe na iwanyama iwolapfighwa ne iwanu walakatsighwe. Ing'olo ayuno wa ukuleghusa matotso keghala na ing'olo wa ukuleghusa nzambi, pfinu pfake pfakuwa pfa mtambika, ayo nambiko iihenzeluke ghendo. <verse eid="LEV 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 14:14" />Mtambika yasole idamu chidogho ye nambiko ya ukuleghusa matotso, yambake imunu ayo iyotendighwa yele mna membe ya ghutwi lyake lya kujilo na chidole ghumba cha ghumoko ghwake ghwa kujilo na chidole ghumba cha mghulu ghwake ghwa kujilo. <verse eid="LEV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 14:15" />Kuya mtambika yasole chidogho ghamapfuta yaghide mna chighanza cha ghumoko ghwake ghwa kumoso. <verse eid="LEV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 14:16" />Yapfabike chidole chake cha ghumoko ghwake ghwa kujilo mna ghamapfuta agho na yamitse hambele he IMNDEWA mala saba. <verse eid="LEV 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 14:17" />Ghamapfuta ighokala mna chighanza chake yambakatse imunu ayo ahala hana membe ya lighutwi lyake lya kujilo na yambakatse hane chidole ghumba cha ghumoko ghwake ghwa kujilo na yambakatse hane chidole ghumba cha mghulu ghwake ghwa kujilo, hanu hahala hayabakile idamu ye imnyama iyalapfighwe kuwaleghusila iwanu inzambi. <verse eid="LEV 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 14:18" />Ghamapfuta ighokala yambake mwitwi imunu ayo na yaitende sang'ano aino ili kumtenda yele na kumlamlitsa imunu ayo na IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="LEV 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 14:19" />“Mtambika yamchinje imnyama yumwe mna awala weli iwalapfighwe, ili Imulungu yamleghusile tsinzambi tsayatendile imunu ayula iyoneke keha. Kuya mtambika yamchinje imnyama yungi iyalapfighwe yalakatsighwe. <verse eid="LEV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 14:20" />Pfipfila mtambika yeke ipfijo pfe ingano mchanya mwe imnyama ayo iyalapfighwe yalakatsighwe mna imatsabahu. Apfo mtambika koitenda ing'onde ya ukumtenda imunu ayo yele, naye baho kakuwa kela.”<verse eid="LEV 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 14:21" />“Lekeni ka imunu ayo ka muhingwa, ng'odaha baye kulapfa ipfinu apfo, yamghalile mtambika imwana yumwe mmale we ing'olo yawe wa kumliha Imulungu iwe nambiko ya kuleghusa matotso inulighwe mchanya, yatsotendighwa chiwe chitango cha ukumtenda imunu ayo yele. Pfipfila yaghale kimbo limwe lya usaghe utighinike ghendo na une ghamapfuta uwe pfijo pfe ingano ipfilapfighwa kwe Imulungu na ghamapfuta koloboi saba. <verse eid="LEV 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 14:22" />Pfipfila yaghale mughi wabili au iwana weli we njiwa, yumwe yawe wa ukuleghusa nzambi tsayatendile na yungi yawe wa ukulakatsighwa. <verse eid="LEV 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 14:23" />Mna litsuwa lya nane yamghalile mtambika ipfinu apfo hambele ha ghumlango ghwa Lihema lya ukwitinganila, pfikalapfighwe kwe Imulungu ahala hayotendighwa yele. <verse eid="LEV 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 14:24" />Mtambika yamsole imwana mmale we ing'olo iyamlapfile kwa kulema kulapfa ipfinu ipfili pfake Imulungu na ghamapfuta aghala koloboi saba na wapfinule mchanya kulangusa ka womlapfila IMNDEWA. <verse eid="LEV 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 14:25" />Mtambika yamsubutule imwana ayo we ng'olo wa nambiko ya ukuleghusa nzambi na yakinge idamu, kuya yasole idamu chidogho yambake imunu ayo hane ghutwi lyake lya kujilo na hane chidole ghumba lya ghumoko ghwake ghwa kujilo na hane chidole ghumba cha mghulu ghwake ghwa kujilo. <verse eid="LEV 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 14:26" />Mtambika yaghaghide ghamapfuta agho chidogho mna chighanza chake cha ghumoko ghwa kumoso. <verse eid="LEV 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 14:27" />Kuya katsomitsa ghamapfuta agho chidogho mala saba kwa chidole cha ghumoko ghwake wa kujilo hambele he IMNDEWA. <verse eid="LEV 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 14:28" />Kuya mtambika katsomghela imunu ayo ghamapfuta hane membe ya lighutwi lya kujilo na hane chidole ghumba cha ghumoko ghwake ghwa kujilo na chidole ghumba cha mghulu ghwake ghwa kujilo. Katsombakatsa ahala hayambakile idamu ye nambiko ya ukuleghusa matotso. <verse eid="LEV 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 14:29" />Ghamapfuta ighakalile mna chighanza chake katsombaka mwitwi imunu ayo, ili yamtende yele hambele he IMNDEWA na kwilamlitsa naye. <verse eid="LEV 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 14:30" />Kuya mtambika katsomsola tetele yumwe mna awala weli au njiwa weli ka imunu ayo pfayodaha kulapfa. <verse eid="LEV 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 14:31" />Mughi yumwe katsolapfighwa ili yaleghuse nzambi na yungi wa katsolapfighwa ili yalakatsighwe, hata ka katsolapfa mughi awo, pfipfila yalapfe na usaghe ili mtambika yamtende imunu ayo yele hambele he IMNDEWA. <verse eid="LEV 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 14:32" />Aghano ghagho ghamalaghitso gha mbuli tsa imunu yane ukoma, lekeni ng'odaha baye kulapfa ipfinu ipfibamighwa ipfimtenda yele.”<verse eid="LEV 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Upfundo iuli mna ing'anda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 14:33" />IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa na Aruni, <verse eid="LEV 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 14:34" />“Hamkwingila mna isi ya Kanani yanimwing'ani iwe yenu, na ning'eka upfundo mna ubanda we ing'anda imwe ili muisi amwo, <verse eid="LEV 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 14:35" />yane ing'anda ayo yamlongele mtambika ka upfundo woneka mng'anda mwake. <verse eid="LEV 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 14:36" />Mtambika katsolaghitsa ipfinu pfose pfilapfighwe kunze ng'ana yeye yengile baye kulola chinu acho, ili pfose ipfili mng'anda pfileke kwoneka pfiha. Kuya mtambika katsakwingila kuilola ing'anda ayo. <verse eid="LEV 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 14:37" />Katsolola ukungu ka woneka mbanda na ka uwa wa chijani au uwa mdung'u na ka woneka wingila mghati wohimba ubanda, <verse eid="LEV 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 14:38" />mtambika katsolawa kunze kwe ghumlango na kuihinda ing'anda ayo kwa ghamatsuwa saba. <verse eid="LEV 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 14:39" />Litsuwa lya saba mtambika katsakuya keli kuilola ing'anda ayo. Ka ukungu awo wenela mwibanda mwa ing'anda ayo, <verse eid="LEV 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 14:40" />mtambika katsolaghitsa ghamabwe ighali hanu hane ukungu ulapfighwe na ukwasighwa hanu hehile kunze mwe ikaye. <verse eid="LEV 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 14:41" />Naye katsolaghitsa imibanda ya mng'anda amwo ikwangulighwe chila ubali, na chokaa iikwangulighwe yasighwe kunze mwe kaye hanu hehile. <verse eid="LEV 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 14:42" />Kuya watsosola ghamabwe ghangi na kuhatsenga hanu ahala hawabomole, nawo watsoikulugha keli ing'anda ayo.”<verse eid="LEV 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 14:43" />“Ka ukungu awo utsolawila keli ahala haulapfa ghamabwe agho na kukwangula chokaa na kuikulugha keli, <verse eid="LEV 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 14:44" />mtambika yatse kuilola. Ka ukungu wenela mna ing'anga ayo, awo ukungu iuhinya ing'anda, apfo ing'anda ayo iha. <verse eid="LEV 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 14:45" />Ing'anda ayo imwaghighwe na ghamabwe ghake, mibiki yake na msanga mtselu pfighalighwe hanu hehile kunze mwe kaye. <verse eid="LEV 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 14:46" />Kuya imunu wowose iyatsakwingila mng'anda amwo ghamatsuwa ing'anda ayo ihindighwa katsakuwa keha mbaka nemihe. <verse eid="LEV 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 14:47" />Imunu wowose iyowasa au iyakuja mmng'anda amwo kobamighwa yatsapfe maghwanda ghake.”<verse eid="LEV 14:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LEV 14:48" />“Lekeni mtambika yang'engila kuikaghula ing'anda ayo, na kuyona ka ukungu ng'awenele baye kulawa ahala haikulughighwe, mtambika katsowalongela iwanu ka ing'anda ayo yela kwaapfila ukungu umala. <verse eid="LEV 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 14:49" />Ili kuitenda ing'anda ayo yele yane ing'anda katsoghala pfideghe wabili ne chibiki cha mweretsi, nyutsi ndung'u na putila lya hisopo. <verse eid="LEV 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 14:50" />Katsomsubutula chideghe yumwe mna chiya chine ghamatsi ghanoghile gha mbwibwi. <verse eid="LEV 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LEV 14:51" />Katsosola chibiki cha mweretsi na putila lya hisopo na nyutsi ndung'u ne chideghe ayula yungi iyali mghima na kupfighela pfose mna idamu ya ichideghe ayula iyasubutulighwe. Kuya mtambika katsoimitsa idamu mna ing'anda ayo mala saba. <verse eid="LEV 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LEV 14:52" />Apfo pfipfo pfatsoitenda ing'anda ayo yele kwa idamu ya chideghe na ghamatsi ghanoghile gha mbwibwi na chideghe na chibiki cha mweretsi na liputila lya hisopo na nyutsi ndung'u. <verse eid="LEV 14:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 14:53" />Ichideghe ayula mghima katsomlekelela yaghende tsake mmighunda kunze mwe ikaye. Apfo pfipfo pfayatsoitenda ing'anda ayo yele, nayo itsakuwa yela.”<verse eid="LEV 14:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 14:54" />“Aghano ghagho ghamalaghitso gha mbuli yoyose ya ukungu wa utamu uukwenela, <verse eid="LEV 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 14:55" />ukungu iuli mna lighwanda au mna ing'anda, <verse eid="LEV 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LEV 14:56" />upfimbe, lipute au chilonda, <verse eid="LEV 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LEV 14:57" />ili kulangusa chinu chihi ichihile na chihi ng'achihile baye. Agho ghagho ghamalaghitso gha mbuli ya ukungu na ukoma.”<verse eid="LEV 14:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LEV 15" />
  <para style="s">Ipfinu ipfihile ipfimlawa imunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 15:1" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa na Aruni, <verse eid="LEV 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 15:2" />“Walongeleni Waisiraeli apfino, kuhisi kwe mmale wowose kung'alawa udusi, udusi awo iulawa womtenda yehe. <verse eid="LEV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 15:3" />Imunu ayo kakwoneka keha hata ka udusi awo woghendelela kulawa au woleka kulawa. Apfi pfipfo immale iyolawa udusi pfayakwoneka keha. <verse eid="LEV 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 15:4" />Lusatsi lwolwose lyayowasila au chinu chochose chayokalila chakuwa chiha. <verse eid="LEV 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 15:5" />Imunu wowose iyodonza lusatsi lwa immale ayo, <verse eid="LEV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 15:6" />au iyokalila chinu chochose chayakalile immale ayo, kobamighwa yatsapfe maghwanda ghake, kuya yoghe, naye katsakuwa keha mbaka nemihe. <verse eid="LEV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 15:7" />Imunu wowose iyomdonza immale iyolawa udusi, kobamighwa yatsapfe maghwanda ghake kuya yoghe, naye katsakuwa keha mbaka nemihe. <verse eid="LEV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 15:8" />Immale wowose iyolawa udusi yang'ambwalulila ghamate imunu, imunu ayula iyabwalulilighwe ghamate kobamighwa yatsapfe maghwanda ghake, kuya yoghe, naye katsakuwa keha mbaka nemihe. <verse eid="LEV 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 15:9" />Ichinu chochose chayokalila immale iyolawa udusi ahala hayomwendesa imnyama, nacho pfipfila chiha. <verse eid="LEV 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 15:10" />Imunu wowose iyochidonza ichinu chayakalile immale ayo, katsakuwa keha mbaka nemihe. Imunu wowose iyochighala chayakalile imunu ayo kobamighwa yatsapfe maghwanda ghake, kuya yoghe, naye katsakuwa keha mbaka nemihe. <verse eid="LEV 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 15:11" />Immale wowose iyolawa udusi yang'amdonza imunu aku ng'ahopfughe baye ghamoko ghake na ng'oghile baye, iyakindighwe katsakuwa keha mbaka nemihe. <verse eid="LEV 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 15:12" />Chiya chochose cha lidongo ichidonzighwe ne imunu iyolawa udusi chobamighwa chitulighwe. Lekeni chiya chochose ichitendighwe na libiki chobamighwa chihopfughighwe na ghamatsi.”<verse eid="LEV 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 15:13" />“Immale yang'ahona ukulawa udusi yabete kwa ghamatsuwa saba mbaka haghopfika matsuwa gha ukutendighwa yele keli. Haghopfika ghamatsuwa agho yatsapfe maghwanda ghake, kuya yoghe mna ghamatsi ighalengele, naye baho kakuwa kela. <verse eid="LEV 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 15:14" />Litsuwa lya nane, yasole njiwa weli au makinda meli ghe njiwa, yawaghale hambele he IMNDEWA hane ghumlango ghwa Lihema lya ukwitinganila, na baho yamwing'e mtambika. <verse eid="LEV 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 15:15" />Mtambika katsowalapfa, yumwe yawe wa nambiko ya kuleghusa nzambi tsayatendile na yungi yawe wa nambiko ya ukulakatsighwa, kwa ukutenda apfo mtambika katsomlamlitsa ne IMNDEWA, na immale ayo kakuwa kela mna ukulawa kwake udusi.”<verse eid="LEV 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 15:16" />“Immale wowose ka tsimbeghu tsake tsomlawa, yaloghetse lukuli lwose, naye katsokala keha mbaka nemihe. <verse eid="LEV 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 15:17" />Tsimbeghu tsing'alaghalila mna lighwanda au mna ghwanda lya ngotsi yoyose ila, alyo litsapfighwe kwa ghamatsi, nalyo lyakuwa liha mbaka nemihe. <verse eid="LEV 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 15:18" />Ka immale yang'awasa ne ipinga na tsimbeghu tsing'alawa, awo wose weli woghe, nawo watsokala weha mbaka nemihe.”<verse eid="LEV 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 15:19" />“Ipinga wowose yang'awa mna ghamatsuwa ghake gha ukughenda kumto, katsakuwa keha kwa ghamatsuwa saba. Imunu wowose iyomkinda ipinga ayo, katsakuwa keha hambele he Imulungu mbaka nemihe. <verse eid="LEV 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 15:20" />Ichinu chochose chayokalila au chayowasila chakuwa chiha. <verse eid="LEV 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 15:21" />Imunu wowose iyodonza lusatsi lwake au ichinu chochose chayakalile ipinga ayo, yatsapfe maghwanda ghake kuya yoghe, naye kakuwa keha mbaka nemihe. <verse eid="LEV 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 15:22" />Imunu wowose iyodonza chinu chochose chayakalile ipinga ayo, yatsapfe maghwanda ghake kuya yoghe, naye kakuwa keha mbaka nemihe. <verse eid="LEV 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 15:23" />Imunu wowose iyatsodonza ichinu chochose chayawasile au chayakalile ipinga ayo, katsakuwa keha mbaka nemihe.”<verse eid="LEV 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 15:24" />“Ka immale kanga ne ipinga ayo na idamu imlaghalila, immale ayo kakuwa keha kwa ghamatsuwa saba, na lusatsi lwolwose lwayawasile lwakuwa lwiha.”<verse eid="LEV 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 15:25" />“Idamu ing'alumbilila kumlawa ipinga kwa ghamatsuwa mengi kubita pfailawagha au kolawa idamu matsuwa si ghake baye gha ukulawa idamu, ayo katsoghendelela kuwa keha ghamatsuwa ghose idamu haimlawa. <verse eid="LEV 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 15:26" />Lusatsi lyolyose lyayowasila au chighoda chochose chayokalila, chitsakuwa chiha ka pfaghali ghamatsuwa ghake gha ukughenda kumto. <verse eid="LEV 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 15:27" />Imunu wowose iyodonza ipfinu apfo, katsakuwa keha hambele he IMNDEWA na yahopfughe maghwanda ghake kuya yoghe, naye katsokala keha mbaka nemihe. <verse eid="LEV 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 15:28" />Ipinga ayo yang'amalitsa kughenda kumto, yakale kwa ghamatsuwa saba, na ghang'amala matsuwa agho, kakuwa kela. <verse eid="LEV 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 15:29" />Mna tsuwa lya nane yasole njiwa weli au makinda meli gha tetele yamghalile mtambika habei ne ghumlango ghwa Lihema lya ukwitinganila. <verse eid="LEV 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 15:30" />Mtambika yamlapfe yumwe yawe wa nambiko ya ukuleghusa nzambi tsayatendile na yungi yawe nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa. Mtambika yang'atenda apfo, katsomlamlitsa ne IMNDEWA na komleghusila nzambi tsayatendile.”<verse eid="LEV 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 15:31" />“Apfo muwakanye Waisiraeli wakale kutali ne ipfinu ipfiwatenda wehe, ili waleke kukomighwa mna ukwiya kwawo kwa kulitenda lihe Lihema lyangu lya ukwitinganila ilili mna wawo.”<verse eid="LEV 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 15:32" />Aghano ghagho ghamalaghitso gheng'ighwe immale iyolawa udusi na ayula iyolawa tsimbeghu iyakuwa keha, <verse eid="LEV 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 15:33" />na kwa ipinga iyoghenda kumto na kuwa keha. Na immale au ipinga wowose iyolawa chochose na mmale iyowasa na ipinga yehile.<verse eid="LEV 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LEV 16" />
  <para style="s">Litsuwa lya Ukwilamla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 16:1" />IMNDEWA tsakalonga na Musa ahala hawafile iwana weli wa Aruni, tsawafa ahala hawamsoghelele IMNDEWA habehi na kuudusula upfumba iwaghomighwe. <verse eid="LEV 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 16:2" />Kamlongela, “Umlongele ndughu yako Aruni apfino, mwiko ukwingila Hanu Haenzeluke ihali kuchughu mwe lipanzia ka pfayobama mwenyegho. Yaleke kwingila hanu aho kwaapfila aho nene nitsolawila mna libingu mchanya mwa hanu ha ukuwalombela iwanu libatsi. <verse eid="LEV 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 16:3" />Aruni ng'ana yengile hanu haenzeluke ng'ani, kobamighwa yalapfe mwana mmale we ng'ombe wa kuleghusa nzambi na ng'unzu yumwe wa ukulakatsighwa.”<verse eid="LEV 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 16:4" />“Katsakwogha ne ghamatsi, kuya katsopfala lighwanda lila lienzeluke, lijoho litselu, kaputula na kwiyoha msipi mtselu mchuno na chilemba.”<verse eid="LEV 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 16:5" />“Yasole mvulati weli kulawa kwa iwanu wa Isiraeli, wawe wa nambiko ya kuleghusa nzambi na ng'unzu yumwe yawe wa nambiko ya ukulakatsighwa. <verse eid="LEV 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 16:6" />Tanu Aruni yamlapfe ng'ombe mmale ayo yawe wa nambiko ya ukuleghusa nzambi tsayatendile yeye imwenyegho na tsawatendile iwanu iwali hakaye yake. <verse eid="LEV 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 16:7" />Kuya yasole wamene weli, yaweke habei ne ghumlango ghwa Lihema lya ukwitinganila. <verse eid="LEV 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 16:8" />Yase tsisimbi mchanya na hatsilaghala hasi tsilamule mene wachi yatsolapfighwa kwa IMNDEWA, na mene yungi yatsolekelelighwa yoke kunyika kutali ne ndalo, iyokemighwa Azazeli, aku ka kobapa tsinzambi tse wanu yatsighale kutali. <verse eid="LEV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 16:9" />Yamsole imene ayula itsisimbi itsimghwile yawe wa IMNDEWA na yamlapfe yawe wa ukuleghusa nzambi. <verse eid="LEV 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 16:10" />Imene itsisimbi itsimghwile yoke, katsolapfighwa aku kamghima. Aruni hayomlekelela yoke mna inyika kutali ne ndalo iyokemighwa Azazeli, aku ka kabapa tsinzambi tse wanu, baho iwanu watselamla ne IMNDEWA kwa ukuleghusighwa nzambi tsawo.”<verse eid="LEV 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 16:11" />“Aruni hayomlapfa ing'ombe mmale iyatsoleghusa tsinzambi tsayatendile yeye mwenyegho na iwanu iwali akaye yake, <verse eid="LEV 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 16:12" />yasole chitetso na yakahale imikala ikwaka mna imatsabahu, na yasole maghawo meli gha upfumba utighinike ghendo, kuya yengitse upfumba awo na ichitetso acho mna hanu henzeluke ng'ani. <verse eid="LEV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 16:13" />Yeke upfumba awo mna imikala ikwaka, na baho lyolawila hosi lyoghubika chighubiko cha Lisanduku lya Laghano. <verse eid="LEV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 16:14" />Yaditse kwa chidole chake mna idamu ye ng'ombe iyaikingile, na yamitse hambele ya chighoda cha ukuwalombela iwanu libatsi, na yamitse mala saba kwa ichidole chicho hambele ya lisanduku lya laghano.”<verse eid="LEV 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 16:15" />“Kuya yamsubutule imene ayula wa nambiko ya ukuleghusa tsinzambi tse iwanu wose. Kuya yasole idamu yake na yaighale hanu henzeluke ghendo kuli kuchughu mwe lipanzia na yamitse hanu ha ukuwalombela iwanu libatsi, na yamitse kwa ichidole chicho hambele ha lisanduku lya laaghano, ka pfayatendile na idamu ye ng'ombe. <verse eid="LEV 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 16:16" />Kwa ukutenda apfi, kohatenda hanu Haenzeluke Ghendo hele, naye yamitse mna Lihema lya ukwitinganila, kwaapfila lyahaghati mwe iwanu wa Isiraeli iwehile na iwane tsinzambi nyingi. <verse eid="LEV 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 16:17" />Yaleke kwingila munu wowose mna Lihema lya ukwitinganila ahala Aruni hayakwingila mghati kuhatenda Hanu Henzeluke Ghendo hele. Imunu kodaha kwingila ahala hayomalitsa kwilamla yeye mwenyegho, na hayomalitsa kuwalamlitsa wanu iwali ukaye yake ne Imulungu na iwanu wose wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="LEV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 16:18" />Kuya katsolawa na kughenda hana imatsabahu hambele ha IMNDEWA na kohatenda hele. Yasole idamu chidogho ya ing'ombe ayula na ya imene ayula na yaibake imatsabahu chila ubali. <verse eid="LEV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 16:19" />Katsoimitsila idamu imatsabahu ayo kwa chidole chake mala saba, na kwa ukutenda apfo koitenda yele na koihimika kulawa mna ukwiha kwose kwa iwanu wa Isiraeli.”<verse eid="LEV 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imene koghalighwa kunze kwa indalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 16:20" />“Aruni hayomalitsa kuhatenda Hanu Haenzeluke Ghendo hele na Lihema lya ukwitinganila lyele na matsabahu nayo yele, baho yamsole ing'unzu ayula mghima iyasaghulighwe yawe wa Azazeli iyobapa tsinzambi tse wanu yatsighale kutali. <verse eid="LEV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 16:21" />Aruni katsakwika ghamoko ghake mchanya mwa ing'unzu ayo iyali mghima na yalonge aku yatoghole ka iwanu wa Isiraeli watenda ghehile na watotsa na watenda nzambi, na agho ghose ghawatendile yagheke mna litwi lya imene ayo, kuya katsomdima yaghende kunyika na imunu iyasaghulighwe ukutenda apfo. <verse eid="LEV 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 16:22" />Yakamlekelele imene ayo yoke kunyika, hanu halihela iwanu, aku kasola nzambi tsawo tsose.”<verse eid="LEV 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 16:23" />“Kuya Aruni yengile mghati mwa Lihema lya ukwitinganila, katsotsula maghwanda matselu ghanoghile ghayapfalile ahala hayengile Hanu Haenzeluke Ghendo na kughaleka amwo. <verse eid="LEV 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 16:24" />Naye katsakogha baho hanu haenzeluke na kupfala maghwanda ghake gha ukaye. Katsolawa na yawachinje iwanjama iwolapfighwa walakatsighwe, yumwe yawe wa ukuleghusa nzambi tsake mwenyegho na yungi yawe wa ukuleghusa nzambi tsawatendile iwanu. <verse eid="LEV 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 16:25" />Ghamapfuta ighalawile mna iwanyama iwalapfighwe nambiko ya ukuleghusa nzambi ghatsolakatsighwa mna matsabahu. <verse eid="LEV 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 16:26" />Imunu ayula iyasaghulighwe kumlekelela ing'unzu ayula yoke mna inyika ukwasa tsinzambi tse wanu, tanu kobamighwa yatsapfe maghwanda ghake na yoghe, kuya kodaha kwingila mna indalo. <verse eid="LEV 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 16:27" />Ing'ombe na imene ayula iwasubutulighwe ili wawe nambiko ya ukuleghusa nzambi tse wanu, awala idamu yawo isolighwe na kughalighwa Hanu Haenzeluke Ghendo ili Waisiraeli waleghusighwe nzambi tsawo, watsolapfighwa kunze kwa ndalo yawo. Kuko ngotsi tsawo na nyama tsawo na mipfi yawo pfitsolakatsighwa. <verse eid="LEV 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 16:28" />Naye imunu iyowalakatsa kobamighwa yatsapfe maghwanda ghake na yoghe mwenyegho mna ghamatsi, Yang'atenda apfo, kodaha kwingila mna indalo.”<verse eid="LEV 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 16:29" />“Laghitso lino mlikinde ghamatsuwa ghose. Mna tsuwa lya kumi mna ghumwetsi ghwa saba, mwemwe wenyegho na iwagheni iwokala namwe mwobamighwa mleke ukuja chinu chochose na mleke kusang'ana. <verse eid="LEV 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 16:30" />Mtsotenda apfo kwaapfila mna litsuwa alyo mwemwe mtselamlitsa na nene IMNDEWA, na nitsowatenda mwele kulawa mna tsinzambi tsenu, namwe mtsakoneka mwela hambele hangu. <verse eid="LEV 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 16:31" />Mna tsuwa alyo mtsobwihila, namwe mtsoleka ukuja. Laghitso alyo mtsolikinda matsuwa ghose. <verse eid="LEV 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 16:32" />Mtambika iyabakighwe ghamapfuta na iyasaghulighwe yakinde hanu hayang'ali yosang'ana aba wake, yuyo yatsosang'ana isang'ano ya ulamlitsi aku kopfala maghwanda matselu ghaenzeluke, <verse eid="LEV 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 16:33" />katsohatenda Hanu Haenzeluke Ghendo hele, na kotenda Lihema lya ukwitinganila nalyo lyele, na koitenda imatsabahu nayo yele, na kowatenda iwatambika na iwanu wose wa Isiraeli wele. <verse eid="LEV 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 16:34" />Mna ghamatsuwa ghenu ghose ghamkala, mwobamighwa kughakinda malaghitso ghano chila mwaka, ghatsowatenda iwanu wose wa Isiraeli wele kulawa mna tsinzambi tsawo tsawotenda.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 16:34">Musa tsakatenda ghose ka Imulungu pfayamlaghitse.<verse eid="LEV 16:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LEV 17" />
  <para style="s">Ukuja idamu koghomighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 17:1" />IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, <verse eid="LEV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 17:2" />“Mlongele Aruni na iwanaghe na uwalongele iwanu wose wa Isiraeli. IMNDEWA kolaghitsa apfino, <verse eid="LEV 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 17:3" />munu wowose yang'amsubutula nambiko ya ng'ombe au ya ng'olo au ya mene mna ndalo yenu au kunze kwa ndalo yenu, <verse eid="LEV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 17:4" />naye ng'amghalile baye mnyama ayo hana ghumlango ghwa Lihema lya ukwitinganila ili kumlapfila IMNDEWA hambele ha Lihema Lienzeluke, imunu ayo katotsa kwa kuimwagha idamu hela, naye katsobaghulighwa na iwanu wake. <verse eid="LEV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 17:5" />Kwaapfila laghitso lino lyowalongotsa Waisiraeli waleke kuwasubutula iwanyama wawo mna mighunda. Wobamighwa wawaghale kwa Imtambika hana ghumlango ghwa Lihema lya ukwitinganila, naye katsowasubutula na kumlapfila Imulungu ka nambiko tsa ukukala tseghamba ne IMNDEWA. <verse eid="LEV 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 17:6" />Apfo mtambika katsomitsa idamu mna matsabahu ya IMNDEWA iili habei na ghumlango ghwa Lihema lya ukwitinganila, naye koghalakatsa ghamapfuta ghawo ghamnung'ile ghoya IMNDEWA. <verse eid="LEV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 17:7" />Apfo Waisiraeli watsoleka ghendo kuitambikila milungu ingi ya ughutsu iighala na wamene, chinu ichiwatendile waleke kuniwinza. Laghitso lino walikinde matsuwa ghose ghawokala, kulawa mweleko ghumwe mbaka mweleko ghungi.”<verse eid="LEV 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 17:8" />“Uwalongele keli apfino, munu wowose iyali Muisiraeli au mgheni wowose ayula iyokala nawo, iyolapfa nambiko ya mnyama wa ukulakatsighwa au komlapfila chinu chingi, <verse eid="LEV 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 17:9" />lekeni ng'oighala baye hana ghumlango ghwa Lihema lya ukwitinganila ili kumlapfila IMNDEWA, imunu ayo yabaghulighwe ghendo na iwanu wake.”<verse eid="LEV 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 17:10" />“Munu wowose ayula iyali Muisiraeli au mgheni wowose ayula iyokala nawo, ka kakuja idamu, nene nitsomghudubukila imunu ayo iyakuja idamu na nombaghula yakale kutali na iwanu wake. <verse eid="LEV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 17:11" />Kwaapfila ughima wa chila chiumbe wa mna idamu. Na nene nimlaghitseni kuilapfa idamu mna imatsabahu ili kuulamlitsa ughima wenu na Imulungu, kwaapfila idamu iyo ighala ulamlitsi, na ughima wenu wa mna idamu. <verse eid="LEV 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 17:12" />Apfo tsaniwalaghitsa Waisiraeli apfino, munu wowose ayula iyali Muisiraeli au mgheni wowose ayula iyokala nawo yaleke ukuja idamu.”<verse eid="LEV 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 17:13" />“Munu wowose iyali Muisiraeli au mgheni wowose iyokala namwe yang'aghenda kwibagho kuwinga imnyama au kutowa chideghe wa ukuja, kobamighwa yaimwaghe hasi idamu yake na yasole msanga yasile hasi. <verse eid="LEV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 17:14" />Kwaapfila ughima wa chila chiumbe wa mna idamu. Apfo nene tsaniwalaghitsa Waisiraeli waleke kuja idamu ya chiumbe chochose achila kwaapfila ughima wa chiumbe chochose achila wa mna idamu yake. Na imunu wowose iyakuja idamu katsobaghuliwa.”<verse eid="LEV 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 17:15" />“Munu wowose ayula yawe kwoneka mna isi ya Isiraeli au ka mgheni, naye kakuja ichinu ichifile chenyegho au kakuja ichinu ichikomighwa na mnyama wa kumuhulo, ayo kobamighwa yatsapfe ghamaghwanda ghake na yoghe, naye katsakwoneka keha mbaka nemihe haipfika. Kuya katsakuwa kela. <verse eid="LEV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 17:16" />Lekeni ka ng'atsapfile baye maghwanda ghake na ng'oghile baye, ilitsompata alyo lyake.”<verse eid="LEV 17:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LEV 18" />
  <para style="s">Matendo gha ughoni ighaghomighwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 18:1" />IMNDEWA tsakamlongela Musa, <verse eid="LEV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 18:2" />“Walongele apfino iwanu wa Isiraeli, Nene na IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu. <verse eid="LEV 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 18:3" />Mleke ukutenda ka pfawotenda iwanu wa Misiri ako kwamkalile, wala mleke ukutenda ka pfawotenda iwanu wa Kanani ako kwanimghalani. Mwiko ghendo ukutenda aghala ghawotenda wawo. <verse eid="LEV 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 18:4" />Mwemwe mwobamighwa kughakinda malaghitso ghangu na imiko yose yaniwalongele. Nene na IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu. <verse eid="LEV 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 18:5" />Mwobamighwa mghakinde malaghitso na imiko yangu. Imunu yang'akinda ghamalaghitso ghangu na imiko yangu, katsoukombola ughima wake. Nene na IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="LEV 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 18:6" />“Munu wowose yaleke kuwasa na ndughu yake wa habehi. Nene IMNDEWA yanilaghitsa apfo. <verse eid="LEV 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 18:7" />Uleke kumghela chinyala aba wako kwa ukuwasa na mai wako. Ayo mai wako, uleke kuwasa naye.”<verse eid="LEV 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 18:8" />“Uleke kumghela chinyala aba wako kwa ukuwasa na pinga wake wowose ayula, awo mai tsako.”<verse eid="LEV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 18:9" />“Uleke kuwasa na lumbu wako, yawe lumbu wako ghendo, au yawe mwana wa aba wako au yawe mwana wa mai wako, yawe kwoneka ukaye yenu au kwoneka kuna kaye ingi.”<verse eid="LEV 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 18:10" />“Mwiko kuwasa na mtsukulu wako, yawe mwana wa mwanagho mmale au yawe mwana wa mwanagho ipinga, kwa ukutenda apfo kweghela chinyala ghumwenyegho.”<verse eid="LEV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 18:11" />“Mwiko kuwasa na mwana pinga wa aba wako, iyelekighwe na aba wako kwe pinga yungi, ayo ka lumbu wako.”<verse eid="LEV 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 18:12" />“Mwiko kuwasa na shangatsi yako, kwaapfila ayo na aba wako wong'a tombo limwe.”<verse eid="LEV 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 18:13" />“Mwiko kuwasa na mai wako mdodo au mai wako mkulu, kwaapfila awo wose wong'a tombo limwe na mai wako.”<verse eid="LEV 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 18:14" />“Mwiko kuwasa na ipinga wa aba wako mkulu au aba wako mdodo, ayo mai wako.”<verse eid="LEV 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 18:15" />“Mwiko kuwasa na pinga we imwanagho, ayo mkwe yako ghendo, uleke kuwasa naye.”<verse eid="LEV 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 18:16" />“Mwiko kuwasa na pinga wa mdodo wako au mkulu wako, ayo mlamu wako, kutsomghela chinyala ndughu yako. <verse eid="LEV 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 18:17" />Ung'awasa na ipinga, mwiko kuwasa na imwanaghe wala na mtsukulu wake. Awo wose ndughu, ung'awahanganya kotenda chinu chihile ghendo. <verse eid="LEV 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 18:18" />Ipinga wako ka yang'ali mghima, mwiko kumkwela na imdodo wake au imkulu wake, ung'atenda apfo kutsowatenda wesonge.”<verse eid="LEV 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 18:19" />“Mwiko kuwasa na ipinga iyali mna ghamatsuwa ghake.”<verse eid="LEV 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 18:20" />“Mwiko kuwasa na ipinga wa miyagho, ukutenda apfo kutsokutenda wihe.”<verse eid="LEV 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 18:21" />“Uleke kumlapfa imwanagho wowose yakalapfighwe kwa mlungu Moleki kwaapfila mng'atenda apfo, mwolighela chinyala taghwa lyangu nene Imulungu wako. Nene yuyo IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="LEV 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 18:22" />“Mwiko kuwasa na mmale miyagho ka pfauwasa na ipinga. Imulungu kochihila ng'ani ichinu acho.”<verse eid="LEV 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 18:23" />“Mwiko munu mmale au pinga kuwasa na imnyama. Pfiha ng'ani ukutenda apfo.”<verse eid="LEV 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 18:24" />“Mleke kwitenda wenyegho mwiha kwa kughatenda agha ghose, kwaapfila iwanu yaniwawinga woke hambele henu tsawetenda wenyegho wehe kwa kughatenda agho ghose. <verse eid="LEV 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 18:25" />Apfo waitenda isi yawo ihe, na nene IMNDEWA niitowa kwa tsinzambi tsawo tsawatendile, nayo isi yowawinga iwanu wake woke. <verse eid="LEV 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 18:26" />Lekeni mwemwe imli Wasiraeli au imli wagheni, mkinde malaghitso ghangu na imiko yangu, na mleke ukutenda aghala ighonyihila nene IMNDEWA. <verse eid="LEV 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 18:27" />Aghano ghose ighonyihila nene IMNDEWA tsawaghatenda iwanu iwakalile mna isi ya Kanani ahala mwemwe ng'ana mtse baye, nawo tsawaitenda isi ihe. <verse eid="LEV 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 18:28" />Lelo mwemwe mleke ukughatenda agho, hela isi ayo itsowawingani ka pfaiwawingile iwanu iwakalile ahano ng'ana mwemwe mtse.”<verse eid="LEV 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 18:29" />“Iwanu wose iwatsotenda pfinu apfo ipfinyihila, watsobaghulighwa kutali ne iwanu wawo.”<verse eid="LEV 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 18:30" />“Apfo mghakindise ghose ghaniwalaghitse, mleke kughawinza aghala ghose ighonyihila ghawatendile iwanu wala iwakalile muisi amwo ahala ng'ana mwemwe mpfike baye, mleke kwitenda mwiha kwa agho. Nene yuyo IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu.”<verse eid="LEV 18:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LEV 19" />
  <para style="s">Ghamalaghitso ghangi gha ukutenda ighanoghile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 19:1" />IMNDEWA tsakamlongela Musa, <verse eid="LEV 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 19:2" />“Ulonge ne iwanu wose wa Isiraeli, walongele apfino, muwe wenzeluka kwaapfila nene IMNDEWA wenu na Mwenzeluka.”<verse eid="LEV 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 19:3" />“Chila munu mna mwemwe yamtegheletse mai wake na aba wake, namwe mwiikinde imiko yangu mna ghamatsuwa ghangu gha ukubwihila. Nene na IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu.”<verse eid="LEV 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 19:4" />“Mleke kuhunduka na kupfitambikila pfinyagho pfe milungu, wala mleke kwitendela milungu ya chuma. Nene na IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu.”<verse eid="LEV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 19:5" />“Hamnilapfila nene IMNDEWA nambiko tse wanyama ili mkale tseghamba na nene, mnilapfile ka pfaibamighwa ili namwe mtogholighwe. <verse eid="LEV 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 19:6" />Inyama ya nambiko ayo ijighwe mna tsuwa lilila imnyama hayosubutulighwa au ijighwe mna tsuwa lya keli. Inyama yoyose ikala mbaka tsuwa lya kadatu ilakatsighwe mna ghumoto. <verse eid="LEV 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 19:7" />Ka inyama yake chidogho ijighwa mna tsuwa lya kadatu, ukutenda apfo kodesa, na imnyama ayo iyalapfighwe sitsomtoghola baye, <verse eid="LEV 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 19:8" />na imunu wowose iyakuja inyama ayo, alyo lwake, kwaapfila kachitenda chinu chienzeluke cha IMNDEWA chihe. Imunu ayo katsobaghulighwa yakale kutali ne iwanu wake.”<verse eid="LEV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 19:9" />“Hampfuna ipfijo pfenu ipfili mna isi yenu, mleke kupfuna ghendo mbaka hana ghumbaka ghwa mghunda ghwako, na mleke kuya kuchughu kutsalalitsa ipfijo pfamlekile. <verse eid="LEV 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 19:10" />Hampfuna nzabibu mna mighunda yenu, mleke kuya lwakeli kutsalalitsa nzabibu tsamlekile na mleke kudondola nzabibu itsilaghale hasi, tsinzabibu atso muwalekele iwahingwa ne iwagheni wamkala nawo. Nene na IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu.”<verse eid="LEV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 19:11" />“Mleke kwiba.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 19:11">“Mleke kulonga ughutsu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 19:11">“Mala kumbugha miyagho.”<verse eid="LEV 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 19:12" />“Mleke kwilaha kwa litaghwa lyangu kwa ughutsu, mng'atenda apfo mwoliligha litaghwa lye Imulungu wenu. Nene na IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu.”<verse eid="LEV 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 19:13" />“Uleke kumbunza miyagho wala kumboka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 19:13">“Uleke kukala ne isendi ye munu iyakusang'anile ing'onde yako chilo chose mbaka nemitondo.”<verse eid="LEV 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 19:14" />“Uleke kumlighita chitsiwi, wala uleke kwika chinu chochose ichimtenda munu chifita yekwale, lekeni mpfuke Imulungu wako. Nene yuyo IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="LEV 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 19:15" />“Hamuhigha maghomba muhighe pfinoghile, mleke kumwonela libatsi imunu muhingwa wala kumpfuka iyali mkulu.”<verse eid="LEV 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 19:16" />“Uleke kwanga akuno na akuno aku kwakwenetsa ung'enye kwe iwanu iwali hakaye yako.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 19:16">“Uleke kumhonza miyagho yafe kwa kulonga mbuli tsako tsa ung'enye. Nene yuyo IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="LEV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 19:17" />“Uleke kumuhila ndughu yako mmoyo mwako, kobamighwa ummanile miyagho ili hayototsa totso lyenu lileke kuwa limwe.”<verse eid="LEV 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 19:18" />“Uleke kumuitsila chihile chayokutendela miyagho, na uleke kukala na fondogholo na yumwe we iwanu wako, lekeni umkunde miyagho ka pfawikunda ghumwenyegho. Nene na IMNDEWA, Imulungu wako.”<verse eid="LEV 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 19:19" />“Mghakinde malaghitso ghangu. Uleke kumleka mnyama wako imnyama wa aina ingi yambebese. Mumghunda mwako uleke kuhanda mbeghu tsa aina mbili. Uleke kupfala ghwanda ilidadatsighwe kwe tsinyutsi tsa aina mbili.”<verse eid="LEV 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 19:20" />“Immale yang'awasa na pinga iyali mtumwa, naye kalapfighwa tsengele na mmale yungi lekeni yang'ali kukombolighwa na mmale wake iyamlapfile tsengele wala yang'ali kulekelighwa yoke, Immale iyawasile naye na yeye wose watsohighighwa, lekeni waleke kukomighwa kwaapfila ipinga ayo yang'ali kulekelighwa yoke. <verse eid="LEV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 19:21" />Immale ayo katsongalila ing'unzu habei na Lihema lya ukwitinganila, kolapfighwa ka nambiko ya nzambi ili yawe wa kuleghusa nzambi tsayatendile. <verse eid="LEV 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 19:22" />Mtambika katsomsubutula ing'olo ayo na kondapfila nene Imulungu, na nene nomleghusila inzambi iyatendile.”<verse eid="LEV 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 19:23" />“Hamtsopfika isi ya Kanani na kuhanda mibiki yoyose ya ghamatunda, mghomighwa kughaja ghamatunda ghawo kwa miyaka midatu. <verse eid="LEV 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 19:24" />Lekeni mna ghumwaka wa kane ghamatunda ghake ghakuwa ghaenzeluka, ghatsolapfighwa kwe Imulungu ghawe gha kumlongela mighede. <verse eid="LEV 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 19:25" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa tano mwodaha kughaja ghamatunda agho, na mibiki yenu itsakweleka ghamatunda mengi. Nene yuyo IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu.”<verse eid="LEV 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 19:26" />“Mleke ukuja inyama yoyose ine idamu. Mleke kulaghula wala kutenda uhawi.”<verse eid="LEV 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 19:27" />“Mleke kugheta tsivili tsenu mmbalimbali mwa litwi, wala kugheta ndepfu tsenu.”<verse eid="LEV 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 19:28" />“Mleke kwisanza sale mlukuli mwenu ili mwoneke mwowadomboketsela iwanu wafile au kwika pfitango mlukuli mwenu. Nene yuyo IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="LEV 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 19:29" />“Uleke kumghuma chinyala neghe wako kwa kumtenda yawe pinga chiweghe, ung'atenda apfo isi yose itsomema uweghe we wanu na ghehile ghe wanu.”<verse eid="LEV 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 19:30" />“Mghakinde ghamatsuwa ghangu gha kubwihila na mlipfuke Lihema lyangu Lienzeluke. Nene yuyo IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="LEV 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 19:31" />“Mleke kwitenda mwiha kwa kuwaghendela wane mitsimu au iwahawi na kuwalomba wawalaghulile. Nene yuyo IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu.”<verse eid="LEV 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 19:32" />“Wime wima haukala ne iwanu wabala na uwahulikitse iwanu iwakubitile imiyaka, na mnipfuke, nene yuyo IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="LEV 19:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 19:33" />“Ka kokala na munu mgheni mna isi yako, uleke kumtendela pfihile. <verse eid="LEV 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 19:34" />Kobamighwa kumtendela imunu mgheni ka pfaumtendela Muisiraeli miyagho, umkunde ka pfawikunda mwenyegho kwaapfila mwemwe namwe tsamwawagheni mna isi ya Misiri. Nene na Imulungu wenu.”<verse eid="LEV 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 19:35" />“Mlamle pfinoghile ahala hamlinga utali, hampima utsito na hampima ukumema kwe pfinu. <verse eid="LEV 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 19:36" />Na mtumile mizani ya haki. Nene yuyo IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, iyaniwalapfile mna isi ya Misiri. <verse eid="LEV 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 19:37" />Mghakinde na kughatenda ghamalaghitso ghangu. Nene yuyo IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="LEV 19:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LEV 20" />
  <para style="s">Mahigho kwaajili ya matotso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 20:1" />IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, <verse eid="LEV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 20:2" />“Walongele apfino Waisiraeli, munu wowose, yawe Muisiraeli au yawe mgheni iyokala namwe, iyomlapfa mwanaghe yamsang'anile mlungu Moleki katsotowighwa na ghamabwe na iwanu mbaka yafe. <verse eid="LEV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 20:3" />Nene mwenyegho nitsomwing'a chisogho imunu ayo na nombaghula yakale kutali na wanu wake, kwaapfila tsakamlapfa mwanaghe yamsang'anile imulungu Moleki, apfo kalitenda lihe Lihama lyangu Lienzeluke na kalighuma chinyala taghwa lyangu lienzeluka. <verse eid="LEV 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 20:4" />Ka iwanu iwali akaye yake ng'awakwalangula baye chayotenda imunu ayo na ng'awomtowa yafe baye, <verse eid="LEV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 20:5" />nene mwenyegho nitsomuhigha yakomighwe imunu ayo na iwanu wose iwali akaye yake. Nitsombaghula yakale kutali na wanu wangu, yeye imwenyegho na wose iwandekile nene na kumghendela mlungu Moleki.”<verse eid="LEV 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 20:6" />“Imunu wowose yowaghendela walaghutsi wa mitsimu na iwahawi, nitsomwing'a chisogho imunu ayo na nombaghula yakale kutali na wanu iwali akaye yake. <verse eid="LEV 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 20:7" />Lelo muwe wenzekuka, kwaapfila nene yuyo IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu. <verse eid="LEV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 20:8" />Mghakinde ghamalaghitso ghangu na kughatenda. Nene yuyo IMNDEWA yanimtendani muwe wenzeluka.”<verse eid="LEV 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 20:9" />“Imunu wowose iyomlighita aba wake au iyomlighita mai wake, ayo yakomighwe. Ayo kehonza mwenyegho ahala idamu yake haitsomwaghika.”<verse eid="LEV 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 20:10" />“Imunu yang'aghoghighwa ughoni na pinga wa miyaghe, wose weli wakomighwe.”<verse eid="LEV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 20:11" />“Imunu yang'awasa ne pinga yumwe wa aba wake, ayo komghuma chinyala aba wake, wose weli wakomighwe. Awo wehonza wenyegho ahala idamu yawo haitsomwaghika.”<verse eid="LEV 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 20:12" />“Munu wowose yang'awasa na pinga wa imwanaghe, wose weli wakomighwe ghendo. Watenda chinu chihile ghendo. Awo wehonza wenyegho ahala idamu yawo haitsomwaghika.”<verse eid="LEV 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 20:13" />“Munu wowose yang'awasa na mmale miyaghe ka pinga wake, wose weli wakomighwe kwaapfila watenda chinu chihile ghendo. Awo wehonza wenyegho ahala idamu yawo haitsomwaghika.”<verse eid="LEV 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 20:14" />“Imunu yang'amkwela ipinga hamwe na mai wake, ayo katenda chinu chihile ghendo. Wose wadatu walakatsighwe kwa ghumoto kwaapfila chawatendile chiha. Muwatendele apfo ili kuleke kulawila ghehile mna mwemwe.”<verse eid="LEV 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 20:15" />“Immale wowose yang'awasa na immnyama, imunu ayo na imnyama ayo wose wakomighwe.”<verse eid="LEV 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 20:16" />“Ipinga yang'amseghelela imnyama ili yawase naye, ipinga ayo na imnyama ayo wose wakomighwe. Awo wehonza wenyegho ahala idamu yawo haitsomwaghika.”<verse eid="LEV 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 20:17" />“Imunu yang'amkwela lumbu wake, imwana iyelekighwe kunze na aba wake au imwana iyamweleke kunze mai wake, nawo wang'awasa hamwe, acho chinyala ghendo, awo watsowingighwa wakale kutali ne iwanu wawo kwaapfila kawasa na lumbu wake. Immale ayo katsoliha kwa ichinu acho chihile chayatendile.”<verse eid="LEV 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 20:18" />“Immale yang'awasa na ipinga yali mna ghamatsuwa ghake, wose weli watsowingighwa wakale kutali na iwanu wawo, kwaapfila immale ayo kaghubula kuhisi kwake pfakuli na ipinga ayo kalangusa idamu yake pfailawa. <verse eid="LEV 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 20:19" />Uleke kuwasa na mai wako mdodo, au mai wako mkulu, wala uleke kuwasa na shangatsi yako, kwaapfila awo ndughu tsako ghendo. Wose awo watsoliha kwa ichinu acho chihile chawatendile. <verse eid="LEV 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 20:20" />Imunu yang'awasa na ipinga wa aba wake mkulu au aba wake mdodo, ayo kamghuma chinyala aba wake mkulu au aba wake mdodo. Wose awo watsoliha kwa chinu acho chihile chawatendile na watsakufa bila ukweleka wana.”<verse eid="LEV 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 20:21" />“Imunu yang'amkwela pinga wa mdodo wake au mkulu wake aku mdodo wake au mkulu wake kamghima, ayo komghela chinyala ndughu yake, wose weli watsakufa aku wahela wana, kwaapfila watenda chinu chihile.”<verse eid="LEV 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 20:22" />“Mghakinde ghamalaghitso ghangu ghose na imiko yangu hela isi yanitsomghalani itsomdekani. <verse eid="LEV 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 20:23" />Mleke ukwigha pfihendo pfe wanu waniwawinga iwali hambele yenu, kwaapfila wawo tsawatenda agho ghose, na nene nowahila ghendo. <verse eid="LEV 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 20:24" />Lekeni tsaniwalongela, ‘Mtsosola isi yawo, nene nitsoweng'a isi yawo iwe yenu, isi inoghile kwa ukulima na ukufughila.’ Nene yuyo IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu yaniwabaghule mkale kutali na wanu wa isi tsingi.”<verse eid="LEV 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 20:25" />“Apfo mwobamighwa mdahe kumtanga imnyama iyanoghile na iyehile na chideghe iyehile na iyanoghile. Mleke kwitenda mwiha kwa ukuja imnyama yehile au chideghe yehile au chiumbe chochose ichitambala muisi, awala waniwalongele mwiko mwemwe kuwaja. <verse eid="LEV 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 20:26" />Kwaapfila nene IMNDEWA nienzeluka, na nene niwabaghula mwemwe na iwanu wa isi tsingi ili muwe wangu, namwe muwe waenzeluka.”<verse eid="LEV 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 20:27" />“Imunu wowose ayula yawe mmale au yawe ipinga yang'alaghula au yang'awa mhawi, ayo mumkome kwa kumtowa na ghamabwe. Ayo kehonza mwenyegho ahala idamu yake haitsomwaghika.”<verse eid="LEV 20:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LEV 21" />
  <para style="s">Ghamalaghitso kwa iwatambika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 21:1" />IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, “Walongele iwatambika, iwana wa Aruni apfino, ka kuleke kuwa ne imunu wowose mna wawo iyetenda keha kwa kukinda lukuli lwa munu yafile wa hakaye yake, <verse eid="LEV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 21:2" />ila kodaha kulukinda lukuli lwa mai wake na lwa aba wake na lwa imwanaghe na lwa mkulu wake. <verse eid="LEV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 21:3" />Pfipfila kodaha kulukinda lukuli lwa lumbu wake iyali ng'ana yakwelighwe baye iyokala mng'anda mwake. Kwitenda keha kwa kukinda tsing'uli tsawo kwaajili ye wanu awo kodaha. <verse eid="LEV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 21:4" />Yaleke kwitenda keha kwa kukinda lukuli lwa munu wa lukolo lwa mwehe wake.”<verse eid="LEV 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 21:5" />“Iwatambika mwiko kubeya chipala, wala kubeya mmbalimbali mwa ndepfu tsawo wala kwisanza sale mlukuli ili woneke ka womlilila imunu yafile. <verse eid="LEV 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 21:6" />Wobamighwa wawe waenzeluke kwe Imulungu wawo, wala waleke kuliligha taghwa lya Imulungu wawo. Kwaapfila wawo iwo iwondapfila nene ipfijo ipfilakatsighwa, ka ipfijo pfangu nene Imulungu. Apfo wobamighwa wawe wahenzeluka. <verse eid="LEV 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 21:7" />Imtambika yaleke kukwela ipinga iyali chiweghe, wala ipinga iyalekighwe na mmale wake, lekeni hayokwela yakwele ipinga ayula ng'ana yammanye baye immale, kwaapfila imtambika kaenzeluka kwe Imulungu. <verse eid="LEV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 21:8" />Iwanu muwone iwatambika ka wenzeluka, kwaapfila wawo womlapfila Imulungu wenu ichijo. Muwone watambika ka wenzeluka kwaapfila nene yaniwatenda mwemwe mwenzeluke na Imulungu na nienzeluka.”<verse eid="LEV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 21:9" />“Imwana pinga wa imtambika yang'awa chiweghe, ayo komghela chinyala aba wake, apfo yalakatsighwe kwa ghumoto. <verse eid="LEV 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 21:10" />Mtambika mkulu wowose, kwaapfila yeye ka mkulu mna ndugu tsake, naye tsakaghelighwa ghamapfuta mwitwi mwake, na kasaghulighwa ili yapfale maghwanda ighenzeluke, yaleke kukala aku mvili tsitimka wala yaleke kudegha maghwanda ghake kulangusa ka kodomboketsa, <verse eid="LEV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 21:11" />yaleke kwingila hanu hane lukuli lwa munu yafile, yaleke kwitenda keha kwa kukinda imauti ya aba wake, au imauti ya mai wake. <verse eid="LEV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 21:12" />Kwaapfila kasaghulighwa yamsang'anile Imulungu kwa kubakighwa ghamafuta mwitwi, apfo yaleke kuka hanu haenzeluke wala yaleke kuhatenda hehe. Nene yuyo IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="LEV 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 21:13" />“Mtambika mkulu yakwele ipinga yula yang'ana yammaye immale baye. <verse eid="LEV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 21:14" />Yaleke kukwela pinga mghane, wala pinga iyalekighwe na mmale wake wala yaleke kukwela ipinga chiweghe. Yakwele ipinga ayula yang'ana yammanye immale baye kulawa mna lukolo lwake, <verse eid="LEV 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 21:15" />ili iwanu wake waleke kuwona weha iwanaghe iyatsoweleka mwenyegho. Nene yuyo IMNDEWA yanimtendile yenzeluke.”<verse eid="LEV 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 21:16" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, <verse eid="LEV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 21:17" />“Mlongele apfino Aruni, imtsukulu wowose iyatsakwoneka mna pfeleko pfako pfose ipfikutsa iyali na chilema mlukuli, ng'obamighwa baye kunisoghelela habehi na kundapfila nene chijo. <verse eid="LEV 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 21:18" />Munu wowose ayula yawe ka chifita au ka chimbete, au kana mula igholeke ka ya sungula au kana chilungo chongetseka mlukuli mwake, <verse eid="LEV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 21:19" />au kana mghulu ighubeneke au kana ghumwoko ghugholojoke, <verse eid="LEV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 21:20" />au kana chinumbi, au iyali mughuhi ng'ani, au yane chilema mna tsinenge tsake, yane upfimbe au yane utamu wa ngotsi au ayula iyatulike tsimbeghu, ayo yaleke kunisoghelela habehi na kundapfila nene ichijo. <verse eid="LEV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 21:21" />Imunu wowose mna lweleko lwa mtambika Aruni yana ichilema yaleke kunisoghelela habehi na kundapfila ipfijo ipfilapfighwa kwa kulakatsighwa kwa ghumoto. Kwaapfila yeye kana chilema, yaleke kunisoghelela nene Imulungu yandapfile ichijo changu. <verse eid="LEV 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 21:22" />Imunu ayo kodaha ukuja ichijo ichilapfighwe kwa Imulungu wake, pfinu ipfienzeluke na apfila ipfienzeluke ghendo. <verse eid="LEV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 21:23" />Kwaapfila kana chilema, apfo yaleke kwingila mghati mwa lipanzia wala kuiseghelela imatsabahu, hela katsohatenda hanu haenzeluke hehe, kwaapfila nene na IMNDEWA yaniwatenda wenzeluke.”<verse eid="LEV 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 21:24" />Musa kamlongela Aruni na iwanaghe na Waisiraeli wose ipfinu apfo.<verse eid="LEV 21:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LEV 22" />
  <para style="s">Uenzeluka wa Tsinambiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 22:1" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, <verse eid="LEV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 22:2" />“Mlongele Aruni na iwanaghe, wapfalangitse ipfinu pfenzeluke pfawolapfa Waisiraeli kuna nene, ili taghwa lyangu lihenzeluke lileke kulighighwa. Nene yuyo IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="LEV 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 22:3" />“Pfipfila walongele apfino, mna pfeleko pfenu pfose, mtsukulu wowose wa lukolo lwenu yang'apfisoghelela habehi pfinu pfihenzeluke Waisiraeli pfawondapfila nene IMNDEWA aku mwenyegho keha, imunu ayo yabaghulighwe yakale kutali na nene. Nene yuyo IMNDEWA. <verse eid="LEV 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 22:4" />Mtsukulu wowose wa lukolo lwa Aruni yang'awa na ukoma au yang'alawa na udusi yaleke kuja pfinu ipfihenzeluke mbaka hayakuwa kela. Pfipfila yeye kakuwa keha ka yang'amkinda imunu iyetendile keha kwa kukinda ghamauti au kwa kumkinda imunu iyalawilighwe na shahawa, <verse eid="LEV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 22:5" />au yang'achikinda chiumbe chochose ichitambala ichimtenda munu yehe au yang'amkinda imunu ayula iyomtenda yehe, kwa chinu chochose achila ichimtenda yehe. <verse eid="LEV 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 22:6" />Mtambika wowose iyokinda ipfinu apfo kakuwa keha mbaka nemihe na yaleke ukuja pfijo pfienzeluka mbaka hayakogha. <verse eid="LEV 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 22:7" />Litsuwa halikuswa, yeye kakuwa kela, na baho kodaha ukuja ipfijo pfihenzeluke kwaapfila acho chicho chijo chake. <verse eid="LEV 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 22:8" />Mtambika yaleke kumja imnyama iyafile imwenyegho au iyakomighwe na mnyama wa kumuhulo, kwaapfila yang'amja, ketenda mwenyegho yehe. Nene yuyo IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="LEV 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 22:9" />“Iwatambika waikinde imiko yangu, ili waleke kutenda nzambi na kukomighwa kwa kulema kunihulikitsa. Nene na IMNDEWA yaniwatenda wele.”<verse eid="LEV 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 22:10" />“Imunu wowose iyali si wa lukolo lwa watambika, ng'odaha baye ukuja chijo chienzeluke. Hata imunu mgheni au imtumwa iyakemighwe yamsang'anile imtambika, wose ng'awobamighwa baye ukuja chijo acho. <verse eid="LEV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 22:11" />Lekeni ka imtambika kamghula imtumwa kwa sendi tsake yawe wake, au ka imtumwa kwoneka ukaye yake, ayo kodaha ukuja ichijo acho. <verse eid="LEV 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 22:12" />Ka mwana wa mtambika kakwelighwa na imunu yali si mtambika baye, ayo yaleke ukuja ipfijo ipfihenzeluke. <verse eid="LEV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 22:13" />Ka imwana pinga we mtambika ka mghane au kalekighwa na mmale wake na kahela imwana, naye koya na kokala kwa aba wake ka pfayakalile mwali, ayo kodaha ukuja ichijo cha aba wake, lekeni mgheni wowose yaleke ukuja ichijo acho.”<verse eid="LEV 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 22:14" />“Ka munu yungi kakuja ichijo chienzeluke aku ng'omanya baye chayotenda, imunu ayo yoitse ichijo chayajile na yongetse asilimia ishilini ya ichinu acho, na yamwing'e imtambika. <verse eid="LEV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 22:15" />Iwatambika waleke kupfitenda pfihe ipfijo apfila pfenzeluke Waisiraeli pfawondapfila nene IMNDEWA, <verse eid="LEV 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 22:16" />kwa kuwalekelela iwanu wangi wapfije ipfijo apfo. Wang'atenda apfo, wakuwa watotsa ghendo na wobamighwa kuitsa ipfijo pfenzeluke pfawajile. Nene na IMNDEWA yanipfitenda ipfijo apfo pfezeluke.”<verse eid="LEV 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nambiko itsilemighwa na Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 22:17" />Kuya IMNDEWA tsakamlaghitsa Musa, <verse eid="LEV 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 22:18" />“Mlongele apfino Aruni na iwanaghe na Wisiraeli wose, imunu wowose ayula yawe Muisiraeli au yawe imgheni yamkala naye yang'alapfa imnyama wa ukulakatsighwa, yawe wa kulawila laghano lyayekile, au yawe wa kumlapfila hela Imulungu, <verse eid="LEV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 22:19" />kobamighwa yaghale ing'ombe mmale au ing'unzu au mvulati iyenelele ili yatogholighwe. <verse eid="LEV 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 22:20" />Mwiko ukumlapfa imnyama yang'enelele, kwaapfila hamtsomlapfa nene sitsomtoghola baye. <verse eid="LEV 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 22:21" />Imunu wowose iyomlapfila IMNDEWA imnyama kulawa kwa iwang'ombe wake au kulawa kwa iwamene wake wa ukukala tseghamba na yeye. <verse eid="LEV 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 22:22" />Uleke kumlapfila IMNDEWA mnyama wowose iyali chifita, au iyali chimbete, iyabeneke, au iyolawa udusi, au yane pfilonda, uleke kuwalapfa awo wawe wa kulakatsighwa kwa ghumoto mna imatsabahu IMNDEWA. <verse eid="LEV 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 22:23" />Kodaha kundapfila hela Ing'ombe au imwana we ing'olo yane mghulu mtali au yane mghulu mghuhi, lekeni mleke kundapfila imnyama ka ayo yawe wa kutimitsa laghano lyanyikile. <verse eid="LEV 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 22:24" />Mleke kumlapfila IMNDEWA imnyama iyahondighwe, au iyaghanighwe au iyatulighwe tsimbeghu tsake. Mwiko ukutenda apfi muisi mwenu.”<verse eid="LEV 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 22:25" />“Kuya mleke kubokela iwanyama ka awo kulawa kwe iwagheni na kundapfila nene wawe chijo changu. Hamtsondapfila awo, nene sitsowatoghola baye kwaapfila wawo watsilapfa tsimumbu tsawo, apfo wana chilema.”<verse eid="LEV 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 22:26" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, <verse eid="LEV 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 22:27" />“Imwana we ng'ombe au imwana ng'olo au imwana we mene yang'oneka, kobamighwa yakale na mai wake kwa ghamatsuwa saba. Haghomala ghamatsuwa agho, kodaha kumlapfila IMNDEWA yawe wa kulakatsighwa kwa ghumoto. <verse eid="LEV 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 22:28" />Lekeni uleke kumsubutula ing'ombe au ing'olo mna litsua limwe hamwe na imwanaghe.”<verse eid="LEV 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 22:29" />“Haundapfila nene IMNDEWA imnyama wa kunongela mighede, umlapfe ka apfila pfaibamighwa ili utogholighwe. <verse eid="LEV 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 22:30" />Muije inyama yake mna litsua lilyo hayolapfighwa, inyama yake ileke kukala mbaka hamitondo. Nene yuyo IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="LEV 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 22:31" />“Apfo mghakinde na mghatende ghamalaghitso ghangu. Nene yuyo IMNDEWA. <verse eid="LEV 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 22:32" />Mleke kuliligha taghwa lyangu henzeluka, iwanu wose wa Isiraeli wobamighwa wamanye ka nene namwenzeluka. Nene IMNDEWA yuyo yaniwatenda mwemwe mwenzeluke, <verse eid="LEV 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 22:33" />yaniwalapfile Misiri ili niwe Imulungu wenu. Nene yuyo IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="LEV 22:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LEV 23" />
  <para style="s">Malaghitso ghe pfihungo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 23:1" />IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, <verse eid="LEV 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 23:2" />“Walongele Waisiraeli apfino, mna pfihungo pfangu nene IMNDEWA iyanipfisaghule mtsakuwa na mtingano mwenzeluka. Apfino pfipfo ipfihungo pfangu.”<verse eid="LEV 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Litsuwa lya Sabato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 23:3" />“Mtsosang'ana ghamatsuwa sita. Lekeni litsuwa lya saba litsakuwa lya Sabato, tsuwa lya kubwihila ghendo, ng'amtsosang'ana baye na mtsakuwa na mtingano mwenzeluka, mleke kutenda sang'ano yoyose, alyo litsuwa lya kubwihila kuna nene IMNDEWA hohose hamkala.”<verse eid="LEV 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ichihungo cha Ipasaka na pfighate ipfilihela hamila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 23:4" />“Pfihungo pfangu pfingi nene IMNDEWA Pfipfo apfino, mtsakuwa na mitingano mienzeluka yamtsoitowela malati mna pfipindi pfake.”<verse eid="LEV 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 23:5" />“Ghumwetsi ghwa mwanduso, tsuwa lya kumi na nne nemihe, litsakuwa litsuwa lya Pasaka kuna nene IMNDEWA. <verse eid="LEV 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 23:6" />Tsuwa lya kumi na tano lya ghumwetsi ghugho litsakuwa tsuwa lya Chihungo lya IMNDEWA lya pfighate ipfilihela hamila, mtsopfija pfighate apfo kwa ghamatsuwa saba. <verse eid="LEV 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 23:7" />Mne litsuwa lya mwanduso mtsakuwa na mtingano mwenzeluka. Mleke kusang'ana. <verse eid="LEV 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 23:8" />Mna ghamatsuwa ghose saba, chila tsuwa mtsondapfila nene IMNDEWA inambiko ya kulakatsighwa kwa ghumoto. Mne litsuwa lya saba mtsotenda mtingano mwenzeluka. Mleke kusang'ana.”<verse eid="LEV 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ichihungo cha ipfijo pfa ukulimbula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 23:9" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, <verse eid="LEV 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 23:10" />“Walongele keli Waisiraeli apfino, hamtsakwingila mna isi yanimwing'ani na hampfuna ipfijo ipfili mumo, mghalileni imtambika kinza limwe lye pfijo pfamlimbula. <verse eid="LEV 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 23:11" />Litsuwa lya Sabato halimala, mna tsuwa lya keli, lmtambika yalinule mchanya na yalihighise hambele hangu ili liwe chitango cha kundapfila nene. <verse eid="LEV 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 23:12" />Mna litsuwa lilo lyamkwinula mchanya likinza, mwobamighwa mndapfile imwana mmale we ng'olo yane ghumwaka ghumwe yenelele yawe nambiko ya ukulakatsighwa. <verse eid="LEV 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 23:13" />Pfipfila mndapfile makimbo meli gha usaghe utighinike ghendo na une ghamapfuta gha nzeituni, mtsondapfila kwa kuulakatsa mna ghumoto, na ukulakala kwake kutsoninung'ila ghoya nene. Kuya mndapfile kimbo limwe lya dipfai, ayo itsakuwa nambiko ya chokunwa iilapfighwa kwa IMNDEWA. <verse eid="LEV 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 23:14" />Namwe mleke ghendo ukuja chighate wala ingano itsingighwe wala ingano ing'aikomale baye mbaka halipfika litsuwa alyo, aho hamtsoghala na kundapfila nene ipfinu apfo. Mlikinde laghitso lino mna pfeleko pfenu pfose na kwokwose kula kwamkala.”<verse eid="LEV 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chihungo cha mapfuno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 23:15" />Mtsopeta majuma saba kulawa mna litsuwa alila lyakeli halimala litsuwa lya Sabato, litsuwa hamnighalile likinza lye ngano na kundapfila nene IMNDEWA. <verse eid="LEV 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 23:16" />Mtsopeta matsuwa hamsini mbaka mna litsuwa lya kabili lya litsuwa lya Sabato ya saba, namwe mndapfile nambiko ya usaghe wa sambi. <verse eid="LEV 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 23:17" />Mwobamighwa kumghalila imtambika pfighate pfili kulawa mna tsikaye tsenu ili yakapfinule mchanya. Chila chighate mchambike kwa makimbo meli gha usaghe iughumighwe hamila, napfo mtsondapfila nene IMNDEWA kulawa mna ingano yamlimbula. <verse eid="LEV 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 23:18" />Hamtsolapfa ipfighate apfo, pfipfila mlapfe wana saba we ng'olo wane ghumwaka ghumwe na wenelele, na mlapfe ng'ombe yumwe mmale, na ng'unzu weli, wose wawe wahela chilema wala chilonda. Wanyama awo wose watsakuwa nambiko ya kulakatsighwa hamwe na nambiko ya usaghe na idipfai ipfilapfighwe kuna nene. Ukulakala kwa ipfinu apfo koninung'ila ghoya nene IMNDEWA. <verse eid="LEV 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 23:19" />Pfipfila mumsubutule mvulati yumwe, ayo yawe nambiko ya ukuleghusa nzambi tsenu na msubutule iwana weli we ng'olo wane ghumwaka ghumwe, awo wawe nambiko ya ukukala tseghamba na nene. <verse eid="LEV 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 23:20" />Mtambika katsowenula yawahighise iwana awo weli we ng'olo kulangusa ka walapfighwa kuna nene, hamwe na pfighate pfili ipfilapfighwa kuna nene kulawa mna ingano yamlimbule. Ipfinu apfo pfenzeluka ghendo kuna nene, na pfitsakujighwa na imtambika yaliyeka. <verse eid="LEV 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 23:21" />Mna litsuwa alyo mleke kusang'ana ng'onde yoyose ila, lekeni mwitingane mnitamanile nene. Pfeleko pfenu pfose pfikinde malaghitso ghano ghamatsuwa ghose, hohose hamkala.<verse eid="LEV 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 23:22" />“Hambeta ipfijo ipfili mna isi yenu, mwiko kubawa mbaka mna imibaka ya mighunda yenu, wala mleke kuya kuchughu kusalalitsa ipfijo ipfilekighwe. Ipfijo apfo muwalekele iwahingwa na iwahenza. Nene yuyo IMNDEWA, Imulugu wenu.”<verse eid="LEV 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chihungo cha ukutowa tsimalati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 23:23" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, <verse eid="LEV 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 23:24" />“Walongele Waisiraeli apfino, mlibaghule litsuwa lya mwanduso mna ghumwetsi ghwa saba, liwe tsuwa lya kubwihila, na mlikumbukeghe kwa kutowa tsimalati, namwe muwe na mtingano mwenzeluka mnitambikile mna litsuwa alyo. <verse eid="LEV 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 23:25" />Mleke kusang'ana ng'onde yoyose mna litsuwa alyo, namwe mtsondapfila nene IMNDEWA wenu nambiko ya ukulakatsighwa.”<verse eid="LEV 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsuwa lya Ulamlitsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 23:26" />“IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, <verse eid="LEV 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 23:27" />Mlibaghule litsuwa lya kumi mna ghumwetsi ghugho ghwa saba liwe Tsuwa lya Ulamlitsi. Mna litsuwa alyo msinde ne nzala, mwitingane hamwe na mndafile nene IMNDEWA nambiko tsa kulakatsighwa. <verse eid="LEV 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 23:28" />Mleke kusang'ana ng'onde yoyose mna litsuwa alyo, kwaapfila mna litsuwa alyo lya ulamlitsi nzambi tsenu tsileghusighwe hambele he Imulungu. <verse eid="LEV 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 23:29" />Munu wowose iyang'osinda ne nzala mna litsuwa alyo, yabaghulighwe yakale kutali ne iwanu wake. <verse eid="LEV 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 23:30" />Munu wowose iyosang'ana mna litsuwa alyo yakomighwe. <verse eid="LEV 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 23:31" />Mleke kusang'ana ng'onde yoyose, mlikinde laghitso lino mna ghamatsuwa ghenu ghose ghamkala, na kokose akula kwamkala. <verse eid="LEV 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 23:32" />Mna litsuwa alyo mwemwe mtsobwihila ghendo na mtsosinda ne nzala. Litsuwa alyo litsakwanza nemihe mna litsuwa lya tisa lya ghumwetsi aghwo na litsomala nemihe mna litsuwa lya kumi.”<verse eid="LEV 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chihungo cha pfibumbulika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 23:33" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, <verse eid="LEV 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 23:34" />“Walongele Waisiraeli apfino, mna litsuwa lya kumi na tano lya ghumwetsi ghugho ghwa saba mwanze kumtendela IMNDEWA chihungo cha pfibumbulika. Mchitende chihungo acho kwa matsuwa saba. <verse eid="LEV 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 23:35" />Mna litsuwa lya mwanduso mwemwe mwitingane hamwe mnitambikile nene, na mleke kusang'ana ng'onde yoyose. <verse eid="LEV 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 23:36" />Chila tsuwa mna ghamatsuwa agho saba mtsondapfila nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa mna ghumoto. Mna litsuwa lya nane mwitingane keli hamwe mnitambikile nene na mndapfile nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa. Agho mtingano mwenzeluka, mghwalangitse na mleke kusang'ana mna litsuwa alyo.”<verse eid="LEV 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 23:37" />“Apfino pfipfo pfihungo pfa IMNDEWA pfayapfisaghule, namwe mtsowakema iwanu wetingane hamwe na wanitambikile nene. Nawo watsondapfila nambiko tse wanyama tsa ukulakatsighwa na watsondapfila ipfijo pfawo na idipfai, ka pfaibamighwa mna chila tsuwa. <verse eid="LEV 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 23:38" />Tsinambiko atso tsamndapfila nene, atso tsa nyongetsa mna tsinambiko atsila tsamndapfila mna Litsuwa lya Sabato, na tsamlapfa matsuwa ghose, na tsa nyongetsa mna tsinambiko atsila tsamndapfila ka pfamwilahile, na atsila tsamndapfila nene IMNDEWA kwa ukubama wenyegho.”<verse eid="LEV 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 23:39" />“Hammalitsa kubeta ipfijo mna imighunda yenu, mtende chihungo kwa matsuwa saba, mwandusile litsuwa lya kumi na tano mna ghumwetsi ghwa saba. Litsuwa lya mwanduso litsakuwa lya kubwihila, pfipfila na litsuwa lya nane. <verse eid="LEV 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 23:40" />Mna litsuwa lya mwanduso mghondole ghamatunda kulawa mna mibiki inoghile, mghane maputila ghe mitende, maputila ghe mibiki ine mitsani mingi, na maputila gha imibiki iikota mmbalimbali mwe mito, namwe mtsenge pfibumbulika. Kuya mchideng'elele chihungo acho kwa matsuwa saba hambele he IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu. <verse eid="LEV 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 23:41" />Chila mwaka mumtendele IMNDEWA chihungo chino kwa matsuwa saba. Alino laghitso lya kukindighwa na pfeleko pfenu ghamatsuwa ghose. Mchitende mna ghumwetsi ghwa saba. <verse eid="LEV 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 23:42" />Kwa matsuwa saba mtsokala mna pfibumbulika. Iwanu wose wa Isiraeli watsokala mna pfibumbulika matsuwa agho, <verse eid="LEV 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 23:43" />ili pfeleko pfenu pfimanye ka haniwalapfile iwabala wenu mna isi ya Misiri, tsaniweka wakale mna pfibumbulika. Nene yuyo IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu.”<verse eid="LEV 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 23:44" />Naye Musa kawalongela Waisiraeli ipfihungo apfo pfe IMNDEWA.<verse eid="LEV 23:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LEV 24" />
  <para style="s">Pfitasa pfe Hanu Haenzeluke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 24:1" />IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, <verse eid="LEV 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 24:2" />“Walaghitse iwanu wa Isiraeli wakughalile mapfuta ighalengele gha nzeituni gha ukwika mna ipfitasa ili pfakeghe matsuwa ghose. <verse eid="LEV 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 24:3" />Aruni katsotuwa ipfitasa mghati mwa Lihema lya ukwitinganila, kunze kwa lipanzia lya lisanduku lya laghano ili pfakeghe hambele hangu kulawa nechilo mbaka nemitondo. Alino laghitso lya kukindighwa na pfeleko pfenu mna ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse eid="LEV 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 24:4" />Yapfituwe ipfitasa apfo ipfili mna chighutso cha nzahabu iliyeka, pfakeghe matsuwa ghose hambele hangu nene IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="LEV 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pfighate ipfilapfighwa kwa IMNDEWA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 24:5" />“Naghwe usole makimbo kumi na meli gha utimbo utighinike ghendo, woke pfighate kumi na pfili. <verse eid="LEV 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 24:6" />Ipfighate apfo pfikighwe mna imilia mili mchanya mwa metsa ikandikighwe nzahabu iliyeka ikighwe hambele ha IMNDEWA, chila mlia wike pfighate sita. <verse eid="LEV 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 24:7" />Chila mlia wike upfumba unoghile mna pfikombe pfa nzahabu, upfumba awo utsolakatsighwa mna ghumoto na utsakuwa chitango ka pfighate apfo pfilapfighwa kwe IMNDEWA. <verse eid="LEV 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 24:8" />Chila Tsuwa lya Sabato Aruni katsakwika ghoya pfighate pfingi mna imilia hambele hangu nene IMNDEWA, ipfilawa kwe iwanu wa Isiraeli ka laghano lya ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse eid="LEV 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 24:9" />Ipfighate apfo pfitsakuwa pfa Aruni yaliyeka ne wanaghe, nawo watsopfija hanu henzeluke kwaapfila pfienzeluka ghendo kulawa mna tsinambiko tsila tsamndapfila nene IMNDEWA kwa ghumoto.”<verse eid="LEV 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukuwahigha iwomligha Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 24:10" />Tsuwa limwe tsakuna msongolo yumwe aba wake tsa Mmisiri na mai wake tsa Mwisiraeli. Tsakesonga na Muisiraeli yumwe mghati mwe ndalo. <verse eid="LEV 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 24:11" />Imsongolo ayo kaliligha na kulilighita taghwa lye Imulungu. Apfo iwanu wamghala imsongolo ayo kwa Musa. Mame wa imsongolo ayo tsakakemighwa Shelemosi, neghe Debri, wa lukolo lwa Dani. <verse eid="LEV 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 24:12" />Nawo wamsweka mng'anda aku wombeta Imulungu yatsowalongela choni. <verse eid="LEV 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 24:13" />IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, <verse eid="LEV 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 24:14" />“Mlapfeni kunze kwe ndalo yenu imsongolo ayo, na awala wose iwamuhulike koligha weke ghamoko ghawo mwitwi mwake, kuya iwanu wose wamkome kwa kumtowa na mabwe. <verse eid="LEV 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 24:15" />Kuya uwalongele Waisiraeli, munu wowose iyomlighita Imulungu ilitsompata alyo lyake. <verse eid="LEV 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 24:16" />Munu wowose iyomligha Imulungu, yawe Muisiraeli au yawe mgheni, ayo yakomighwe na wanu wose kwa kutowighwa na mabwe.”<verse eid="LEV 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 24:17" />“Munu wowose iyomkoma munu yungi naye yakomighwe. <verse eid="LEV 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 24:18" />Munu wowose iyomkoma imnyama wa miyaghe, ayo yamuitsile mnyama iyali mghima, kwa ayula iyamkomile.”<verse eid="LEV 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 24:19" />“Munu wowose iyomlagha miyaghe, naye yalaghighwe pfipfila ka pfayamlaghile miyaghe, <verse eid="LEV 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 24:20" />ka kambena ghumpate naye katsobenighwa ghumpate, nenge kwa nenge, tsino kwa tsino. Pfipfila pfayamlaghile miyaghe naye yalaghighwe pfipfo. <verse eid="LEV 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 24:21" />Wowose iyomkoma mnyama wa miyaghe katsakuitsa mnyama iyali mghima, lekeni ayula iyomkoma munu yungi naye yakomighwe. <verse eid="LEV 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 24:22" />Malaghitso ghano ghakindighwe na Muisiraeli na iyali mhenza. Nene yuyo IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu.”<verse eid="LEV 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 24:23" />“Musa kalonga na Waisiraeli, nawo wamghala kunze kwe ndalo imsongolo ayula iyamlighite IMNDEWA, wamkoma kwa kumtowa na ghamabwe. Apfo pfipfo Waisiraeli pfawatendile ka IMNDEWA pfayamlaghitse Musa.”<verse eid="LEV 24:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="LEV 25" />
  <para style="s">Ghumwaka ghwa sabato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 25:1" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa mna chidunda cha Sinai, kamlongela, <verse eid="LEV 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 25:2" />“Walongele apfino Waisiraeli, hamtsopfika mna isi yanimwing'ani nene IMNDEWA iwe yenu chila mwaka ghwa saba mulileke lidongo libwihile, lileke kulimighwa. Aghwo mwaka ghwe lidongo kubwihila kwa IMNDEWA. <verse eid="LEV 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 25:3" />Kwa miyaka sita mtsolima, na mtsohanda na mtsosangulila mitsabibu yenu na mtsopfuna nzabibu tsenu. <verse eid="LEV 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 25:4" />Lekeni mna ghumwaka ghwa saba mlileke lidongo libwihile, aghwo mwaka ghwa kubwihila kwe IMNDEWA. Mleke kuhanda chochose wala kusangulila imighunda yenu ya mitsabibu. <verse eid="LEV 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 25:5" />Chinu chochose ichikota chenyegho mleke kuchipfuna wala mleke kubawa nzabibu kulawa mna minzabibu ila ng'ana isangulighwe baye. Aghwo ghutsakuwa mwaka ghwa kulileka lidongo libwihile ghendo.”<verse eid="LEV 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 25:6" />“Lekeni mwodaha ukuja ipfijo pfose ipfikota pfenyegho mna ghumwaka aghwo ghwa kubwihila, mtsakuja mwemwe wenyegho, iwatumwa wenu, na iwanu yamuwakemile watse kumsang'anilani na iwagheni wamkala nawo. <verse eid="LEV 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 25:7" />Pfipfila iwanyama wenu wamfugha na awala wa kumuhulo iwali mna isi yenu, nawo watsakuja ipfijo apfo pfa ghumwaka aghwo.”<verse eid="LEV 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chihungo cha Miyaka Hamsini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 25:8" />“Mtsopeta Sabato saba tse miyaka, miyaka saba mala saba, yoseyose itsakuwa miyaka alubaini na tisa. <verse eid="LEV 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 25:9" />Kuya mna litsuwa lya kumi lya ghumwetsi ghwa saba, mna litsuwa lya nene Imulungu kwilamlitsa ne iwanu, mtume munu yatoe malati muisi mwose. <verse eid="LEV 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 25:10" />Mghubaghule ghumwaka ghwa hamsini ghuwe mwaka ghwa ukulekelighwa kwe watumwa. Ghumwaka aghwo ghuwe ghwa ukudeng'elela Jubilei. Chila munu katsakuitsilighwa imali yake iutsighwe, na chila munu iyautsighwe yawe mtumwa katsakuya kwe wanu wake. <verse eid="LEV 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 25:11" />Ghumwaka aghwo ghwa hamsini ghutsakuwa ghwa Jubilei kuna mwemwe, mghukumbuke na mghudeng'elele. Apfo mleke kuhanda mbeghu, wala kupfuna chochose achila ichimela chenyegho, wala kubawa nzabibu mna minzabibu ng'ana isangulighwe. <verse eid="LEV 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 25:12" />Kwaapfila ghutsakuwa mwaka ghwa ukudeng'elela Jubilei, ghutsakuwa mwaka mwenzeluka kuna mwemwe. Apfo mtsakuja ipfijo ipfimela pfenyegho mmighunda. <verse eid="LEV 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 25:13" />Mna ghumwaka aghwo chila munu iyautsile mali au mghunda ghwake katsakuitsilighwa. <verse eid="LEV 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 25:14" />Ka koghula mghunda au ka komuutsila mghunda Muisiraeli miyagho, mleke kwibunza. <verse eid="LEV 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 25:15" />Imunu iyoghula ghumghunda kobamighwa yapete ibei ilingane ne miyaka ibitile kulawa jubilei, na ayula iyoutsa ghumghunda aghwo kobamighwa yapete ibei ilingane ne miyaka ya ghamapfuno ng'ana ghumghunda ghuitsighwe kuna imwenyegho mna ghumwaka ghwa jubilei. <verse eid="LEV 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 25:16" />Miyaka ayo ing'awa mingi kutsakongetsa ibei, na ka miyaka ayo midodo kutsohungutsa ibei, kwaapfila ibei yake itsakwikighwa kulingana ne ipfijo pfayokuutsila. <verse eid="LEV 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 25:17" />Mleke kwibunza, ila mumpfuke Imulungu wenu. Nene yuyo IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu.”<verse eid="LEV 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 25:18" />“Apfo muikinde imiko yangu na mghakinde ghamalaghitso ghangu na mghatende, namwe mtsokala tseghamba muisi. <verse eid="LEV 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 25:19" />Nayo isi itsomela ipfijo, namwe mtsakuja na ukwighuta na mtsokala tseghamba muisi.”<verse eid="LEV 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 25:20" />“Na ka mtsakwalangula mwolonga, ‘Lelo tutsakuja choni mna ghumwaka ghwa saba ka ng'atuhanda wala ng'atupfuna ipfijo pfetu baye?’ <verse eid="LEV 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 25:21" />Nene nitsoibaliki isi mna ghumwaka ghwa sita, nayo itsomela ipfijo bwelele, napfo pfitsowenela kwa miyaka midatu. <verse eid="LEV 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 25:22" />Hamuhanda mna ghumwaka ghwa nane, mwemwe mtsakuja ipfijo pfampfunile ghumwande. Namwe mtsoghendelela ukuja ipfijo apfo mbaka hampfuna keli mna ghumwaka ghwa tisa.”<verse eid="LEV 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukuhitsighwa imighunda kwa wenyegho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 25:23" />“Mwiko ghendo kuutsa mghunda lumwe kwa lumwe, kwaapfila isi mali yangu namwe mwa wahenza na wabita nzila muisi mwangu. <verse eid="LEV 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 25:24" />Mghunda haghuutsighwa, imunu youtsa yawe na haki ya kughukombola. <verse eid="LEV 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 25:25" />Ka ndughu yako ka muhingwa, na kautsa mghunda ghwake, ndughu yake wa habehi ghendo kodaha kughukombola mghunda aghula ghwautsile ndughu yake. <verse eid="LEV 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 25:26" />Lekeni ka imunu ayo kahela ndughu wa habei iyodaha kughukombola, lekeni hambele kapata mali keli na kodaha kughukombola mghunda ghwake, <verse eid="LEV 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 25:27" />katsopeta miyaka kulawa hayaghuutsile na kuliha ichibamighwa, na imunu ayula iyaghughulile mghunda kobamighwa yoyitse mghunda aghwo. <verse eid="LEV 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 25:28" />Lekeni ka ng'odaha kughukombola, itsosighala mna ghamoko gha ayula iyaighulile mbaka ghumwaka ghwa chihungo cha ukumbusho wa miyaka hamsini. Mna ghumwaka aghwo imali ayo ilekelighwe na iyuitsighwe ayula iyautsile.”<verse eid="LEV 25:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 25:29" />“Imunu yang'autsa ng'anda yake iili mghati mwa ghumji ighutsungulusighwe ubanda, kodaha kuikombola mna chipindi cha ghumwaka ghumwe kulawa hayaiutsile. Kwa ghumwaka aghwo mghima katsakuwa na haki ya kuikombola. <verse eid="LEV 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 25:30" />Ka ing'anda iili mghati mwa ghumji iitsungulutsighwe ubanda ng'aikombolighwe baye kwa ghumwaka ghumwe, itsakuwa mali ya ayula iyaighulile kwa matsuwa ghose mna pfeleko pfawo pfose, wala ng'aitsoyutsighwa mna ghumwaka wa chihungo cha ukumbusho wa miyaka hamsini. <verse eid="LEV 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 25:31" />Lekeni ng'anda itsili mna pfijiji ing'apfitsungulusighwe ubanda tsitsakuwa hasi mwe malaghitso ghaghala gha isi, tsing'anda atso tsodaha kukombolighwa kwa ghumwaka ghumwe lekeni tsiyuitsighwe mna ghumwaka ghwa chihungo cha ukumbusho wa miyaka hamsini. <verse eid="LEV 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 25:32" />Hata apfo, ng'anda itsili mna mibululu ya Walawi tsodaha kukombolighwa chipindi chochose. <verse eid="LEV 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 25:33" />Ka ing'anda ya Mlawi iusighwa na ng'ayuitsighwe baye, yobamighwa yuitsighwe mna ghumwaka ghwa chihungo cha kukumbuka miyaka hamsini, kwaapfila tsing'anda itsili mna mibululu ya Walawi iweng'ighwe iwe yawo kulawa kwa Waisiraeli. <verse eid="LEV 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 25:34" />Lekeni mighunda ya kudimila iiwatsunguluka Walawi ilekighwe kuutsighwa, kwaapfila awo uhatsi wawo ghamatsuwa ghose.”<verse eid="LEV 25:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukuwakopesha iwahingwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 25:35" />“Ka miyagho kawa muhingwa mbaka ng'odaha baye kwitunza imwenyegho yang'awa hamwe naghwe, umtunze yaghendelele kukala naghwe, mtendele ka mhenza iyali ukaye yako. <verse eid="LEV 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 25:36" />Uleke kubama liba au faida kulawa kuna yeye. Ila mpfuke Imulungu, naye ndughu yako yakale hamwe naghwe. <verse eid="LEV 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 25:37" />Uleke kukopesa kwa liba au kumwing'a ichijo ili yakulihe faida. <verse eid="LEV 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 25:38" />Nene yuyo IMNDEWA, Imulungu wako yanikulapfile mna isi ya Misiri ili kukwing'a isi ya Kanaani, kuya nene niwe Imulungu wako.”<verse eid="LEV 25:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwatendela pfinoghile iwahingwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 25:39" />“Ka ndughu yako iyokala habehi naghwe kawa muhingwa, yang'eutsa kuna ghweghwe, uleke kumtenda yakusang'anile ka mtumwa. <verse eid="LEV 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 25:40" />Katsokala naghwe ka mtumwa iyolihighwa sendi au ka munu iyali mna ghumwanza. Katsokusang'anila mbaka ghumwaka ghwa chihungo cha miyaka hamsini. <verse eid="LEV 25:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 25:41" />Ghumwaka aghwo umleke yoke kwa ndughu tsake na ulisi we iwabala wake umlekele, hamwe ne iwanaghe. <verse eid="LEV 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 25:42" />Kwaapfila Waisiraeli watumighwa wangu yaniwalapfile Misiri, lelo waleke kuutsighwa ka watumwa. <verse eid="LEV 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 25:43" />Uleke kumtawala ndughu yako kwa ukali, ila umpfuke Imulungu wako. <verse eid="LEV 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 25:44" />Ka kobama watumwa, kodaha kuwaghula kulawa mna isi tsingi tsa habehi. <verse eid="LEV 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 25:45" />Kuya kodaha kughula iwatumwa kulawa kwa wahenza iwokala hamwe naghwe na iwanu wawo iwelekighwe muisi mwenu, nawo watsakuwa uhala wenu. <verse eid="LEV 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 25:46" />Iwatumwa awo kodaha kuweng'a iwanagho wawe uhala wawo ghamatsuwa ghose. Hawo kodaha kuwatenda watumwa wako, lekeni ndughu yako Mwisiraeli uleke kumtawala kwa ukali.”<verse eid="LEV 25:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 25:47" />“Ka muhenza iyokala namwe kawa na mali na ndughu yako kawa mhingwa na kwiutsa kwe imunu mayo au kwe ndughu we imunu ayo, <verse eid="LEV 25:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LEV 25:48" />kodaha kukombolighwa. Yumwe wa ndughu tsake kodaha kumkombola, <verse eid="LEV 25:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 25:49" />au mtumba wake, au binamu yake, au ndughu yake wa habehi mna lukolo lwake kodaha kumkombola, pfipfila yang'awa na mali kodaha kwikombola mwenyegho. <verse eid="LEV 25:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 25:50" />Yeye na ayula iyamghulile watsopeta miyaka kulawa hayeutsile mbaka ghumwaka wa kukumbuka miyaka hamsini. Bei ya kulekelelighwa kwake itsolingana na miyaka ila iyamtumikile. Ghamatsuwa ghayakalile mtumwa wa imtwatsa wake ghatsopimighwa ka ghamatsuwa gha mtumwa wa kulihighwa sendi. <verse eid="LEV 25:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LEV 25:51" />Ka miyaka iisighale mbaka ghumwaka ghwa ukumbusho wa miyaka hamsini ing'ali mingi, katsoyuitsa sendi nyingi ka bei iyaghulilighwe nayo. <verse eid="LEV 25:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LEV 25:52" />Ka miyaka ihunguka ng'ana ichipfike chihungo cha ukukumbuka miyaka hamsini, katsopeta sendi ya bei iisighale kulingana ne miyaka ayo na kumliha fidia ayo. <verse eid="LEV 25:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 25:53" />Ghamatsuwa ghose hayokala kwa imtwatsa wake yatendelighwe ka mtumwa wa kulihighwa sendi chila mwaka. Ayo iyamghulile yaleke kumtendela kwa ukali. <verse eid="LEV 25:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 25:54" />Lekeni ka imunu ayo na kaye yake ng'awakombolighwe kwa tsinzila atso tsose, yalekelelighwe mna ghumwaka ghwa ukukumbuka miyaka hamsini. <verse eid="LEV 25:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 25:55" />Waisiraeli watumishi wangu, kwaapfila tsaniwalapfa mna isi ya Misiri. Nene yuyo IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu.”<verse eid="LEV 25:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="LEV 26" />
  <para style="s">Mng'anitegheletsa mtsobweda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 7:12-28:1">Kumb 7:12-24–28:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 26:1" />IMNDEWA kalonga, “Mleke kwitendela pfinyagho pfe milungu ya ughutsu, wala kwimitsa pfinyagho pfa kusongola, wala kwimitsa ingutso, wala mleke kwimitsa libwe lyolyose lila ilisongolighwe mna isi yenu, ili mpfinamile na kupfitambikila. Nene na IMNDEWA wenu. <verse eid="LEV 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 26:2" />Mghakindilise Ghamatsuwa ghangu gha kubwihila na mlipfuke Lihema lyangu Lienzeluke. Nene yuyo IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="LEV 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 26:3" />“Mng'ategheletsa na kukinda malaghitso ghangu na imiko yangu yaniwalongele, <verse eid="LEV 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 26:4" />nitsowaghalila imvula ya chila msimu, isi itsakweleka ipfijo pfingi, na mibiki ili kumghunda itsakweleka ghamatunda ghake. <verse eid="LEV 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 26:5" />Ipfijo pfitsakuwa pfingi ghendo mbaka msimu ghwa ukupfuna ingano ghutsetingana na msimu ghwa kubawa tsinzabibu, na msimu ghwa kubawa tsinzabibu ghutsetingana na msimu ghwa kuhanda ingano. Mtsakuwa na pfijo bwelele, namwe mtsokala ghoya mna isi yenu.”<verse eid="LEV 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 26:6" />“Nitsowatenda mkale tseghamba mna isi yenu, namwe mtsowasa aku ng'ampfuka chinu chochose baye. Nitsowalapfa iwanyama iwakali muisi na isi yenu ng'aitsakuwa na ng'ondo baye. <verse eid="LEV 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 26:7" />Mtsowawinga iwanu iwowehila na kuwakoma kwa lipanga. <verse eid="LEV 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 26:8" />Iwanu wenu watano watsowawinga iwanu miya imwe, iwanu wenu miya imwe watsowawinga iwanu elufu kumi. Iwanu iwowehila watsakughwa kwa lipanga hambele henu. <verse eid="LEV 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 26:9" />Nitsowalola kwa uluso mkulu na nitsowatenda mweleke iwana, nawo watsakongetseka. Nitsotenda achila chanilaghane na mwemwe. <verse eid="LEV 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 26:10" />Mwemwe mtsakuwa na pfijo bwelele mbaka ipfijo pfampfunile ghumsimu ghufosile mtsolapfa kunze ili mwike ipfijo pfampfuna sambi. <verse eid="LEV 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 26:11" />Na nene nitsokala namwe, wala sitsomlekani baye. <verse eid="LEV 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 26:12" />Nitsakwanga mghati mwenu na nitsakuwa Imulungu wenu namwe mtsakuwa wanu wangu. <verse eid="LEV 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 26:13" />Nene na IMNDEWA Imulungu, inili Imulungu wenu, yaniwalapfile mna isi ya Misiri ili mleke kuwa watumwa wa Wamisiri. Tsanilibena libiki lyamwohighwe msingo na niwatenda mwemwe mghende aku mghende wima.”<verse eid="LEV 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ka ng'amuhulikitsa mtsohighighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 26:14" />“Lekeni ka ng'amnitegheletsa baye wala ng'amghakinda baye ghamalaghitso ghangu, <verse eid="LEV 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 26:15" />mng'ailema imiko yangu na mimoyo yenu ing'aghahila ghamalaghitso ghangu na mwolema ukutenda aghala ghatwilaghane ka mtsotenda, <verse eid="LEV 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 26:16" />na nene nitsotenda apfino, nitsowaghalila uwogha wa kwidukitsa, na chikololo ing'achihona, na lihoma ilitsowatenda muwe pfifita na muwe nyondenyonde. Mtsohanda hela mbeghu tsenu, kwaapfila iwala iwowehila iwo iwatsakuja chamuhandile. <verse eid="LEV 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 26:17" />Na nene nitsoweng'a chisogho, na iwanu iwowehila watsowatowa, mtsotawalighwa na awala iwomuhilani. Namwe mtsopfuka na kutsuma hata ka kuduhu imunu iyowawinga.”<verse eid="LEV 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 26:18" />“Hata ka agha ghose ghalawila na mng'ali nga'mbama baye kunihulikitsa, nitsoghendelelagha kuwatowa mala saba kwa tsinzambi tsenu tsamtenda. <verse eid="LEV 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 26:19" />Nitsochilapfa ichidandali chenu ichiwatenda mwighode na nitsokutenda kulanga kuwe kukomu ka chuma na lidongo liwe komu ka shaba. <verse eid="LEV 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 26:20" />Tsingupfu tsenu tsitsakwagha hela ghendo, kwaapfila isi yenu ng'aitsomela baye ipfijo, na imibiki ihili mna isi yenu ng'aitsakweleka ghamatunda baye.”<verse eid="LEV 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 26:21" />“Namwe mng'aghendelela kuleka kunihulikitsa, na mng'aghendelela kundema nitsowongetsela keli maghayo mala saba, ka nzambi tsenu pfatsili. <verse eid="LEV 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 26:22" />Na nene nitsoghala iwanyama wakali mghati mwenu, nawo watsowaboka iwana wenu na ukuja imifugho yenu, nene nitsowahungutsa muwe chidogho, apfo nzila tsenu tsitsakuwa tsahela wanu wa kutsibita.”<verse eid="LEV 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 26:23" />Na ka ghamaghayo aghano ghamlawilani aku namwe ng'ambama baye kunihulikitsa wala kunihundukila, <verse eid="LEV 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 26:24" />nene mwenyegho nitsowehila na nitsowadununza mala saba kwa nzambi tsenu tsamtenda. <verse eid="LEV 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 26:25" />Nene nitsoghala ilipanga mna mwemwe, nalyo litsowatowa kwaapfila tsamlema ukutenda achila chatwilaghane. Na hamtsumila mna tsikaye tsenu mwikinge, nene nitsowaghalila utamu ing'auhona mbaka iwanu iwowehila watsowaghogha na woweka mna ghamoko ghawo. <verse eid="LEV 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 26:26" />Ichijo chenu nitsochihungutsa mbaka wapinga kumi watsakwambika pfighate pfawo pfose mna chikong'o chimwe. Nawo watsowagholela pfighate kwa kulinga mna minzani, namwe mtsakuja lekeni ng'amwighuta.<verse eid="LEV 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 26:27" />Ka agha ghose ghomlawilani lekeni mwemwe ng'amnihulika baye na mwoghendelela kunihila, <verse eid="LEV 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 26:28" />na nene nitsowonela maya na nitsowabela. Nitsowongetsela keli ghamaghayo ghawe mala saba kwa nzambi tsenu tsamtenda. <verse eid="LEV 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 26:29" />Nzala yenu itsakuwa ng'ulu mbaka mtsowaja iwana wenu iwamale ne wapinga. <verse eid="LEV 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 26:30" />Nitsopfihinya ipfidunda pfenu pfa kutambikila milungu, nitsohahinya hanu henu hamdusulila upfumba, na notsasa tsimauti tsenu mchanya mwa pfinyagho pfa milungu yenu. Na nene nitsowahila ghendo. <verse eid="LEV 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 26:31" />Tsikaye tsenu nitsotsilakatsa, na hanu henu ha kutambikila nitsohatenda hawe hachuwa, na ipfijo pfamndapfile pfilakatsighwe, ng'apfitsoninung'ila ghoya baye. <verse eid="LEV 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 26:32" />Nitsoihinya isi yenu mbaka iwanu iwowehila iwatsakutsa kukala amwo wakangawale. <verse eid="LEV 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 26:33" />Nitsowatenda mwemwe mtowighwe na lipanga namwe mtsopwililika mna tsiisi tsa wanu wangi. Isi yenu itsokala uchuwa na tsikaye tsenu tsitsakuwa mahame.<verse eid="LEV 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 26:34" />Mwemwe hamtsakuwa mna ghamoko gha iwehile wenu, isi itsoghadeng'elela ghamatsuwa ghake gha kubwihila baho hakutsakuwa na uchuwa. Isi itsobwihila na kudeng'elela ghamatsuwa ghake gha kubwihila. <verse eid="LEV 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 26:35" />Ghamatsuwa ghose hakutsakuwa na uchuwa, isi itsobwihila mbwihilo ing'aghupatile baye mna ghamatsuwa ghenu gha kubwihila hamng'ali mkala amwo.<verse eid="LEV 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 26:36" />Na wayenu wala iwahonile iwali mna tsiisi tsa wanu wangi nitsowatenda wawe na wogha mkulu mmoyo mwawo hata lutsani iluhighisighwa na libeho lutsowatenda watsume. Watsotsuma ka wowingighwa na munu yane lipanga na watsakughwa hata ka kuduhu munu iyowawinga. <verse eid="LEV 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 26:37" />Watseghwila wenyegho kwa wenyegho ka imunu iyotsuma yaleke kutowighwa na lipanga. Mtsakuwa mwahela ngupfu yoyose ya kuwatowa iwanu iwowehila. <verse eid="LEV 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 26:38" />Mtsokufa mna tsiisi tsa wanu wangi na isi tsawo tsitsowametsa. <verse eid="LEV 26:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 26:39" />Na wayenu iwahonile watsakufila mna isi tse wanu iwowehila kwa aghala ghehile ghawatendile, nawo watsohupila kuko kwa aghala ghehile ghawatendile iwabala wawo.<verse eid="LEV 26:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 26:40" />Lekeni wang'alonga na wang'atoghola ka wawo na iwabala wawo wose watenda ghehile, na kwa ughutsu wawo iwangutsukile na kwa ukulema kwao kwawandemile, <verse eid="LEV 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 26:41" />na wang'atanga ebali nene niwalemele na kuwaghala mna isi tsa wanu iwowehila, na kwa mimoyo yawo ili misughu ing'aleghela na kutoghola ghehile ghawo ghawatendile, <verse eid="LEV 26:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 26:42" />baho nene nitsokumbuka laghano lyangu lyatwilaghane na Aburahamu, Isaka, na Yakobo na kuikumbuka isi ila yaniwalongele nitsoweng'a.<verse eid="LEV 26:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 26:43" />“Hawatsakuwa kunze mwa isi yawo, isi ayo itsodeng'elela matsuwa ghake gha ukubwihila haitsakuwa uchuwa. Matsuwa agho watsosama ghehile ghawo kwa kubetsa malaghitso ghangu na kughahila. <verse eid="LEV 26:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 26:44" />Lekeni hata ghang'alawila agho, hawatsokala mna isi tsa wanu iwowehila, nene sitsowaleka baye wala kuwahila ili niwakome na ndeke kutenda achila chanilaghane nawo. <verse eid="LEV 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 26:45" />Lekeni kwaajili yawo nitsolikumbuka laghano lyanendile ne iwabala tsawo iyaniwalapfile mna isi ya Misiri, aku iwanu wa isi tsingi wolola, ili nene niwe Imulungu wawo. Nene yuyo IMNDEWA wawo.”<verse eid="LEV 26:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 26:46" />Aghano ghagho ghamalaghitso, imiko, na malangulitso gha IMNDEWA ghayaweng'ile iwanu wa Isiraeli akula kuchidunda Sinai kubitila Musa.<verse eid="LEV 26:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="LEV 27" />
  <para style="s">Malaghitso gha tsinzawadi itsilapfighwa kwa Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 27:1" />Kuya IMNDEWA kalonga na Musa, kamlongela, <verse eid="LEV 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 27:2" />“Uwalongele apfino wana wa Isiraeli, Imunu yang'elaha kumlapfila IMNDEWA munu yamsang'anile, lekeni ka imunu ayo ng'odaha baye kumlapfila imunu, yalapfe apfino tsisendi, <verse eid="LEV 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 27:3" />Immale wa miyaka ishilini mbaka miyaka sitini katsokombolighwa kwa sendi shekeli hamsini ka chipimo cha hanu haenzeluka. <verse eid="LEV 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 27:4" />Ipinga katsokombolighwa kwa pfihande pfa fetsa salasini. <verse eid="LEV 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 27:5" />Imunu ayo ka kana miyaka mitano mbaka ishilini, yang'awa msongolo katsokombolighwa kwa pfihande pfa fetsa ishilini, na mwali katsokombolighwa kwa pfihande pfa fetsa kumi. <verse eid="LEV 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 27:6" />Imwana wa mwetsi ghumwe mbaka miyaka mitano katsokombolighwa kwa pfihande pfitano pfa fetsa ka imwana msongolo, na pfihande pfa fetsa pfidatu ka imwana ayo chindele. <verse eid="LEV 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 27:7" />Ka imunu ayo kana miyaka kubita sitini kuya mmale, bei yake itsakuwa pfihande kumi na tano pfa fetsa, ka pinga bei yake itsakuwa pfihande kumi pfa fetsa. <verse eid="LEV 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 27:8" />Lekeni munu iyelahile ka kamhingwa na ng'odaha baye kuliha, yamghale imunu ayo kwa mtambika. Naye imtambika katsomlola imunu yalihighwe bei yachi.”<verse eid="LEV 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 27:9" />Ka natsili ayo, ya mnyama iwomlapfagha iwanu ka nambiko kwa Imulungu, imnyama ayo katsakuwa mwenzeluka, <verse eid="LEV 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 27:10" />na kuduhu imunu iyalapfile natsili kumghalusa mnyama ayo kwa mnyama wowose yungi, yanoghile kwa yehile au yehile kwa yanoghile. Yang'amghalusa kwa mnyama yungi, wose weli watsakuwa waenzeluka.<verse eid="LEV 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 27:11" />“Na natsili ayo ka ya mnyama yehile, ayula ng'apfinoghile kumlapfila IMNDEWA, imunu iyamlapfile katsomghala kwa mtambika, <verse eid="LEV 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 27:12" />naye mtambika katsolamla bei yake kulingana na ukunogha na ukwiha kwake. Ka pfayolamla mtambika, pfipfo pfaitsakuwa. <verse eid="LEV 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 27:13" />Lekeni ka imwenyegho kobama kumkombola, katsakongetsa asilimia ishilini ya bei ya mnyama ayo.”<verse eid="LEV 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 27:14" />“Imunu yang'eka wakifu ing'anda yake iwe ihenzeluka kwe IMNDEWA, mtambika katsolamla bei yake kulingana na ukunogha au ukwiha kwake. Ka pfayolamla mtambika, pfipfo pfaitsakuwa. <verse eid="LEV 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 27:15" />Ka imunu ayo iyaikile wakifu yang'abama kuikombola ing'anda ayo, katsakongetsa asilimia ishilini ya bei yake, nayo itsakuwa yake.”<verse eid="LEV 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 27:16" />“Imunu yang'alapfa ndeu ya mghunda ghwake kwa IMNDEWA, bei yake itsopimighwa kwa kulingana na tsimbeghu itsitumika kuhanda mghunda aghwo, kwa chila pishi ishilini tsa shayili bei yake itsakuwa pfihande hamsini pfa fetsa. <verse eid="LEV 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 27:17" />Yang'alapfa mghunda ghwake mna ghumwaka ghwa kukumbuka miyaka hamsini, bei yake ilingane na pfipimo pfenu. <verse eid="LEV 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 27:18" />Lekeni yang'alapfa hambele ha ghumwaka aghwo, mtambika katsolamla bei yake kulingana na miyaka iisighale kupfikila ghumwaka ghwa kukumbuka miyaka hamsini na bei yake ihungutsighwe. <verse eid="LEV 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 27:19" />Imwenyegho yang'abama kulikombola, yongetse asilimia ishilini ya bei ya mghunda, na baho ghutsakuwa ghwake. <verse eid="LEV 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 27:20" />Lekeni ka ng'obama kughukombola baye, au ka imtambika kamuutsila munu yungi, mghunda aghwo ghuleke kukombolighwa keli. <verse eid="LEV 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 27:21" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa kukumbuka miyaka hamsini mghunda aghwo ghutsolekelighwa na kuwa ghwa IMNDEWA ghamatsuwa ghose. Kuya ghutsakuwa ghwa mtambika.”<verse eid="LEV 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 27:22" />“Imunu yang'alapfa kwe IMNDEWA Imulungu mghunda ghwayaghughulile, aghula si ghwake kwa ukuhala, <verse eid="LEV 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 27:23" />mtambika katsolamla bei ya mghunda aghwo kwa kulingana na miyaka iisighale kupfikila ghumwaka ghwa ukukumbuka miyaka hamsini na munu ayo katsoliha bei yake ka chinu chihenzeluka kwa IMNDEWA. <verse eid="LEV 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 27:24" />Lekeni mna ghumwaka ghwa ukukumbuka miyaka Hamsini, mghunda aghwo ghuitsighwe kwe imunu ayula iyaghuutsile. <verse eid="LEV 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 27:25" />Chila bei itsolingighwa kwa chipimo cha utito cha pfihande pfa fetsa kulingana na chipimo cha hanu haenzeluka, utito wa gera ishilini utsakuwa chihande cha fetsa imwe.”<verse eid="LEV 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 27:26" />“Ng'aibamighwa baye kumlapfa mwelekighwa wa mwanduso we imnyama kwe IMNDEWA Imulungu, kwaapfila ayo ma we IMNDEWA, yawe ng'ombe au ing'olo. <verse eid="LEV 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 27:27" />Lekeni mwelekighwa wa mwanduso wa imnyama yehile, mwenyegho katsomghula kwa kulingana na pfamumpima na katsakongetsa asilimia ishilini ya bei mnyama ayo. Ka ng'okombolighwa, katsoutsighwa kulingana na pfipimo pfenu.”<verse eid="LEV 27:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 27:28" />“Lekeni chinu chochose ichilapfighwe lumwe kwe IMNDEWA, yawe imunu au mnyama au chinu ichipatikane kwa uhala, ng'achitsoutsighwa wala kukombolighwa baye. Chochose ichilapfighwe kwa IMNDEWA acho chienzeluka ghendo. <verse eid="LEV 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 27:29" />Imunu wowose iyahighighwe kukomighwa, ayo yakomighwe ghendo, yaleke kukombolighwa.”<verse eid="LEV 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 27:30" />“Hanu ha kumi ya izaka ha matsawo, iwe mbeghu au ghamatunda gha mibiki, yose itsakuwa mali ya IMNDEWA, ayo ihenzeluka kwa IMNDEWA. <verse eid="LEV 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 27:31" />Na imunu yang'abama kukombola chinu chochose cha ingoto yake, katsakongetsa hanu ha tano. <verse eid="LEV 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 27:32" />Kuya tsaka ya iwanyama haipetighwa, mna chila wanyama kumi yumwe we IMNDEWA. <verse eid="LEV 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 27:33" />Imunu wowose ng'obamighwa kughutsa ka mnyama ayo kanogha au keha wala mnyama ayo ng'atsoghalusighwa kwa mnyama yungi, ka katsoghalusighwa kwa mnyama yungi, wanyama wose weli watsakuwa waenzeluka, ng'awatsokombolighwa.”<verse eid="LEV 27:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 27:34" />Aghano ghagho ghamalaghitso IMNDEWA ghayamlaghitse Musa yawalongele Waisiraeli mchidunda Sinai.<verse eid="LEV 27:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 27" />
</usx>